(634324, 65269, 16420, '<td valign="top">Finally... a nice and simple (and beautiful) shot for this challenge. Good luck!</td>', 'Finally... a nice and simple (and beautiful) shot for this challenge. Good luck!', '2004-03-24 00:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(634325, 65292, 16420, '<td valign="top">Yaay! Go VW!! Great shot.</td>', 'Yaay! Go VW!! Great shot.', '2004-03-24 00:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(634327, 66414, 16420, '<td valign="top">Great idea for this challenge. I like the blue background.</td>', 'Great idea for this challenge. I like the blue background.', '2004-03-24 00:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(634328, 66108, 16420, '<td valign="top">Great architectural shot. Good idea for this challenge.</td>', 'Great architectural shot. Good idea for this challenge.', '2004-03-24 00:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(634329, 65813, 16420, '<td valign="top">Really eye-catching. I love the composition.</td>', 'Really eye-catching. I love the composition.', '2004-03-24 00:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(634332, 66175, 16420, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful shot. Love the lone pink/white fish. One suggestion for future challenges (although it won''t affect my vote) - it seems images that are a bit larger in pixel size seem to do much better in these challenges. If you found it hard to get to 150 kb, you may want to try resampling down to 67 dpi or something and still go with the larger file size. I find even when you save things at .jpg quality 7 and 8 you can still get a good photo. Good luck with this one. It''s one of the best so far.</td>', 'Really beautiful shot. Love the lone pink/white fish. One suggestion for future challenges (although it won''t affect my vote) - it seems images that are a bit larger in pixel size seem to do much better in these challenges. If you found it hard to get to 150 kb, you may want to try resampling down to 67 dpi or something and still go with the larger file size. I find even when you save things at .jpg quality 7 and 8 you can still get a good photo. Good luck with this one. It''s one of the best so far.', '2004-03-24 00:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(634333, 65858, 16420, '<td valign="top">Really well done. I love the composition and that orange fills the entire frame.</td>', 'Really well done. I love the composition and that orange fills the entire frame.', '2004-03-24 00:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(634334, 66252, 16420, '<td valign="top">Very well done!</td>', 'Very well done!', '2004-03-24 00:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
