(635308, 65393, 18868, '<td valign="top">Wow -- I haven''t seen one of those in years!  Sort of plain composition -- perhaps a bit more drama with lighting?</td>', 'Wow -- I haven''t seen one of those in years!  Sort of plain composition -- perhaps a bit more drama with lighting?', '2004-03-24 08:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
