(635358, 66006, 18868, '<td valign="top">very blah compositon -- how to add drama is the big question for you.  possibly short DOF, angle the carrot in the frame, shoot it in context (the texture of cake icing would add a lot of interest).</td>', 'very blah compositon -- how to add drama is the big question for you.  possibly short DOF, angle the carrot in the frame, shoot it in context (the texture of cake icing would add a lot of interest).', '2004-03-24 09:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
