(635410, 65983, 10167, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  Think the main horizontal line is a little too close to being horizontal...  That, or not close enough.  Think it''d look a little better if it were rotated to where that was truly horizontal or rotated in the other direction to where it is nowhere close...  Kind of has that "crooked horizon" feel to it as it stands.  Just my opinion!</td>', 'Interesting.  Think the main horizontal line is a little too close to being horizontal...  That, or not close enough.  Think it''d look a little better if it were rotated to where that was truly horizontal or rotated in the other direction to where it is nowhere close...  Kind of has that "crooked horizon" feel to it as it stands.  Just my opinion!', '2004-03-24 09:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
