(635419, 66259, 5792, '<td valign="top">Decent flower shot. Composed well. The hot spot at the top of the main flower is distracting. Don''t know if you tried different apertures for diffeent DOF possibilities, but I like to when I take flowers pictures.  Then choose the one with the best focus on the main flower and the shallowest depth of field to make it stand out the most.</td>', 'Decent flower shot. Composed well. The hot spot at the top of the main flower is distracting. Don''t know if you tried different apertures for diffeent DOF possibilities, but I like to when I take flowers pictures.  Then choose the one with the best focus on the main flower and the shallowest depth of field to make it stand out the most.', '2004-03-24 09:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(635423, 65762, 5792, '<td valign="top">Always try to find some interesting foreground object to include in the frame to add interest to your sunset/sunrise images. A nice silhouette would work great with this image.</td>', 'Always try to find some interesting foreground object to include in the frame to add interest to your sunset/sunrise images. A nice silhouette would work great with this image.', '2004-03-24 09:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
