(635569, 65752, 18194, '<td valign="top">I thought the subject was great and the lighting just right, well done</td>', 'I thought the subject was great and the lighting just right, well done', '2004-03-24 11:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(635572, 66285, 18194, '<td valign="top">I really liked the contrast in this photo.  The background is perfect for the flower.</td>', 'I really liked the contrast in this photo.  The background is perfect for the flower.', '2004-03-24 11:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(635573, 65667, 18525, '<td valign="top">I like this shot the orange is subtle and it works for me  but I am afraid your score might be influenced by the orange nazis.:-)</td>', 'I like this shot the orange is subtle and it works for me  but I am afraid your score might be influenced by the orange nazis.:-)', '2004-03-24 11:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(635574, 66175, 18194, '<td valign="top">The white fish in the center was just what was needed, this works well I think.</td>', 'The white fish in the center was just what was needed, this works well I think.', '2004-03-24 11:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(635577, 66366, 18525, '<td valign="top">Very visually appealing,as a thumbnail it stands out, as a full shot it keeps me coming back and looking at it. Well done</td>', 'Very visually appealing,as a thumbnail it stands out, as a full shot it keeps me coming back and looking at it. Well done', '2004-03-24 11:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(635581, 66077, 3102, '<td valign="top">The focus could be a bit stronger here, I think.</td>', 'The focus could be a bit stronger here, I think.', '2004-03-24 11:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(635586, 66291, 3102, '<td valign="top">Taking a regular photo and toning it orange seems like a rather liberal interpretation of the challenge, IMO.</td>', 'Taking a regular photo and toning it orange seems like a rather liberal interpretation of the challenge, IMO.', '2004-03-24 11:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(635587, 65152, 18525, '<td valign="top">In my humble opinion... Had the background been different I most likely would have scored this higher.</td>', 'In my humble opinion... Had the background been different I most likely would have scored this higher.', '2004-03-24 11:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(635588, 65599, 18525, '<td valign="top">You can''t go wrong with a thong... or can you?</td>', 'You can''t go wrong with a thong... or can you?', '2004-03-24 11:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(635591, 66197, 3102, '<td valign="top">A bit of a stretch for "orange"... I really think this is much more red...</td>', 'A bit of a stretch for "orange"... I really think this is much more red...', '2004-03-24 11:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(635592, 66002, 2011, '<td valign="top">I love this! 10</td>', 'I love this! 10', '2004-03-24 11:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(635596, 65570, 18194, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this I thought Not another sunset , then I saw what it really was, great, loved it.<br/>BTW to those who submitted real sunsets, they were nice too but a LOT of them. <br/></td>', 'When I first saw this I thought Not another sunset , then I saw what it really was, great, loved it.BTW to those who submitted real sunsets, they were nice too but a LOT of them. ', '2004-03-24 11:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(635598, 66035, 18194, '<td valign="top">I thought this was one of the better orange flower photos.</td>', 'I thought this was one of the better orange flower photos.', '2004-03-24 11:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(635602, 66245, 18194, '<td valign="top">I found the blurred branches in the foreground just a bit distracting but over all I really liked this photo.</td>', 'I found the blurred branches in the foreground just a bit distracting but over all I really liked this photo.', '2004-03-24 11:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(635603, 65437, 18525, '<td valign="top">My thoughts on this photographbad shot, bad spelling, and bad comprehension of the challenge parameters.</td>', 'My thoughts on this photographbad shot, bad spelling, and bad comprehension of the challenge parameters.', '2004-03-24 11:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(635606, 65649, 18525, '<td valign="top">Great ,an unfocused picture of an orange---&gt; insert roll eyes smiley here&lt;-----</td>', 'Great ,an unfocused picture of an orange---> insert roll eyes smiley here<-----', '2004-03-24 11:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(635615, 65454, 18194, '<td valign="top">At first I did not get this one, and then realized that the cup is only orange because of the yellow it is sitting on.  A very interesting study on light I thought.</td>', 'At first I did not get this one, and then realized that the cup is only orange because of the yellow it is sitting on.  A very interesting study on light I thought.', '2004-03-24 11:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(635616, 66152, 12661, '<td valign="top">Brown??? Naaa, dark orange. I''ll buy that. The photo does captures the essence of the change of seasons. Had there been a bit of green, or even better, a crocus poking it''s way through the ice, it would have totally captured spring. Still, nice composition and a serene photo.</td>', 'Brown??? Naaa, dark orange. I''ll buy that. The photo does captures the essence of the change of seasons. Had there been a bit of green, or even better, a crocus poking it''s way through the ice, it would have totally captured spring. Still, nice composition and a serene photo.', '2004-03-24 11:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(635619, 66197, 4767, '<td valign="top">Laissez les bons temps rouler!  Memories of the Big Easy... mmm MMMM mmm.  Great imagination, nice shot, evokes wonderful memories!</td>', 'Laissez les bons temps rouler!  Memories of the Big Easy... mmm MMMM mmm.  Great imagination, nice shot, evokes wonderful memories!', '2004-03-24 11:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(635621, 65531, 12661, '<td valign="top">The photo feels like it''s exploding off the screen. I think using a gentle light from the top/side would have served better. As is, the texture of the marigold is really lost. Furhter, the yellowish background provides little contrast to the flower.</td>', 'The photo feels like it''s exploding off the screen. I think using a gentle light from the top/side would have served better. As is, the texture of the marigold is really lost. Furhter, the yellowish background provides little contrast to the flower.', '2004-03-24 11:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(635627, 65571, 12661, '<td valign="top">The tight crop has stripped the essence of the subject away. Frankly, I don''t know what I am looking at. Viewed as an abstract photo, the texture is very well captured and the DOF isolates the subject well, but the relation to the title (a hand?) is lost.</td>', 'The tight crop has stripped the essence of the subject away. Frankly, I don''t know what I am looking at. Viewed as an abstract photo, the texture is very well captured and the DOF isolates the subject well, but the relation to the title (a hand?) is lost.', '2004-03-24 11:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(635628, 66135, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed abstract</td>', 'Nicely composed abstract', '2004-03-24 11:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(635635, 66416, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great composition and lighting. Simple and elegant. White on Orange looks good on this image.</td>', 'Great composition and lighting. Simple and elegant. White on Orange looks good on this image.', '2004-03-24 12:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(635636, 66342, 12661, '<td valign="top">Your choice of background really brings out the colors of the flower. I am a bit unsure about the unnatural look of a black stem. If it''s the result of messing with the colors too much, then I don''t like it. However, if that flower actually has a very dark stem, then it''s fine. Alas, I am no botonist, so I will give you the benefit of the doubt. I only mention this so that if the former is the case, I find that it detracts from the image.</td>', 'Your choice of background really brings out the colors of the flower. I am a bit unsure about the unnatural look of a black stem. If it''s the result of messing with the colors too much, then I don''t like it. However, if that flower actually has a very dark stem, then it''s fine. Alas, I am no botonist, so I will give you the benefit of the doubt. I only mention this so that if the former is the case, I find that it detracts from the image.', '2004-03-24 12:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(635639, 65570, 18748, '<td valign="top">Cool sunset! But a guy out of focus a liitle bit.</td>', 'Cool sunset! But a guy out of focus a liitle bit.', '2004-03-24 12:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(635640, 66383, 5792, '<td valign="top">The definition of the sun in this image is outstanding. Good use  of the ROT.</td>', 'The definition of the sun in this image is outstanding. Good use  of the ROT.', '2004-03-24 12:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(635643, 65361, 12661, '<td valign="top">A larger picture would bring out more detail from this photo. As is, it''s difficult to make out exactly what I am looking at. (Or as some would say, "Give me some more pixels!!!!"). As far as the theme, you are really pushing the boundaries here. Certainly it doesn''t scream orange, however, it''s close enough to let slide. Now for the happy mood.... I do like the lines as they provide for a nice, almost mellowing, sensation. A nicely composed abstract.</td>', 'A larger picture would bring out more detail from this photo. As is, it''s difficult to make out exactly what I am looking at. (Or as some would say, "Give me some more pixels!!!!"). As far as the theme, you are really pushing the boundaries here. Certainly it doesn''t scream orange, however, it''s close enough to let slide. Now for the happy mood.... I do like the lines as they provide for a nice, almost mellowing, sensation. A nicely composed abstract.', '2004-03-24 12:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(635644, 66375, 18748, '<td valign="top">Nice orange flower. Love the way it croped. 10</td>', 'Nice orange flower. Love the way it croped. 10', '2004-03-24 12:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(635646, 66077, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great composition but poor focus hurts this image. You might also consider changing the background to remove the grain and make it solid white. This image has real possibilities.</td>', 'Great composition but poor focus hurts this image. You might also consider changing the background to remove the grain and make it solid white. This image has real possibilities.', '2004-03-24 12:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(635649, 65876, 18748, '<td valign="top">WOW! This is a beautiful shot, absolutely fits the challenge and deffinetly grabs attention! 10</td>', 'WOW! This is a beautiful shot, absolutely fits the challenge and deffinetly grabs attention! 10', '2004-03-24 12:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(635652, 65128, 5391, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot and a clever take on the challenge theme.  8</td>', 'Lovely shot and a clever take on the challenge theme.  8', '2004-03-24 12:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(635657, 66228, 14603, '<td valign="top">Love this shot and really want to score it high ..but there`s nothing screaming orange at me  :(<br/>I would have scored this very high in the Parallel lines challenge.</td>', 'Love this shot and really want to score it high ..but there`s nothing screaming orange at me  :(I would have scored this very high in the Parallel lines challenge.', '2004-03-24 12:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(635664, 66239, 5792, '<td valign="top">This has got to be the most creative "between red and yellow" concepts in the challenge.  The red underwear and yellow top is perfect and the positioning of your model between the purple background thingys (That is a technical photography term) adds to it. And it has great sex appeal. What more could we ask for?</td>', 'This has got to be the most creative "between red and yellow" concepts in the challenge.  The red underwear and yellow top is perfect and the positioning of your model between the purple background thingys (That is a technical photography term) adds to it. And it has great sex appeal. What more could we ask for?', '2004-03-24 12:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(635669, 66061, 16790, '<td valign="top">I love this photograph.  Marvelous colours, and the angle''s fantastic.  The shadows and highlights on the glass really bring out a very vivid shade of orange.  The focus is great, too.</td>', 'I love this photograph.  Marvelous colours, and the angle''s fantastic.  The shadows and highlights on the glass really bring out a very vivid shade of orange.  The focus is great, too.', '2004-03-24 12:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(635672, 66357, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and well lit</td>', 'Nicely composed and well lit', '2004-03-24 12:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(635675, 66180, 5792, '<td valign="top">This image has that jjbeguin look to it and that is meant as high praise. He is one of the best of the best. Color, lighting and texture are very good.</td>', 'This image has that jjbeguin look to it and that is meant as high praise. He is one of the best of the best. Color, lighting and texture are very good.', '2004-03-24 12:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(635678, 65454, 14603, '<td valign="top">Like the composition..nice abstract</td>', 'Like the composition..nice abstract', '2004-03-24 12:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(635679, 66429, 16790, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, vivid colours - and so crisp and clear!  Lovely photograph, and it''s quite unique in this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful, vivid colours - and so crisp and clear!  Lovely photograph, and it''s quite unique in this challenge.', '2004-03-24 12:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(635683, 66199, 18025, '<td valign="top">One of the most serene. I really like the orange in the water - it balances the whole image so well.</td>', 'One of the most serene. I really like the orange in the water - it balances the whole image so well.', '2004-03-24 12:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(635690, 66069, 16790, '<td valign="top">So vivid and crisp... fantastic use of colours and texture.</td>', 'So vivid and crisp... fantastic use of colours and texture.', '2004-03-24 12:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(635694, 66144, 5391, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of one of the funniest websites I''ve ever seen:  //www.peepresearch.org/smoking.html<br/> <br/>Photographically, it could be exposed about a half of a stop more, and the centered composition doesn''t make the subject very exciting.  However, you''ve managed a perfectly black background, which always makes a subject jump out more - I like that a lot.</td>', 'This reminds me of one of the funniest websites I''ve ever seen:  //www.peepresearch.org/smoking.html Photographically, it could be exposed about a half of a stop more, and the centered composition doesn''t make the subject very exciting.  However, you''ve managed a perfectly black background, which always makes a subject jump out more - I like that a lot.', '2004-03-24 12:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(635696, 65886, 5792, '<td valign="top">The simplicity and composition of this image is just wonderful. It takes a photographer''s mind to think of stuff like this. It would be better if the prongs on the plug were in focus. After all,  the main subject is the expectation of being plugged in. A nice image.</td>', 'The simplicity and composition of this image is just wonderful. It takes a photographer''s mind to think of stuff like this. It would be better if the prongs on the plug were in focus. After all,  the main subject is the expectation of being plugged in. A nice image.', '2004-03-24 12:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(635697, 65649, 12661, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this is meant to be soft focus, but it really looks out of focus. Additionally, if that is an orange, the challenge details clearly stated that no oranges were to be used.</td>', 'I don''t know if this is meant to be soft focus, but it really looks out of focus. Additionally, if that is an orange, the challenge details clearly stated that no oranges were to be used.', '2004-03-24 12:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(635698, 66105, 16790, '<td valign="top">I was hoping someone would do hair!  And this one is done so well.  Great picture!</td>', 'I was hoping someone would do hair!  And this one is done so well.  Great picture!', '2004-03-24 12:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(635702, 65343, 327, '<td valign="top">Too wild....really a fun shot. Love this idea. Congrats to you!! Top three.</td>', 'Too wild....really a fun shot. Love this idea. Congrats to you!! Top three.', '2004-03-24 12:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(635705, 66069, 18748, '<td valign="top">This is interesting, maybe a brighter orange would be better... On other hand, may be not . 8</td>', 'This is interesting, maybe a brighter orange would be better... On other hand, may be not . 8', '2004-03-24 12:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(635707, 65876, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful POV and love the color and light. Good shot, top three.</td>', 'Wonderful POV and love the color and light. Good shot, top three.', '2004-03-24 12:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(635708, 66405, 14603, '<td valign="top">You`ve obviously gone to a bit bother to think out and arrange this shot.<br/>Hope your work is rewarded.</td>', 'You`ve obviously gone to a bit bother to think out and arrange this shot.Hope your work is rewarded.', '2004-03-24 12:20:44.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(635709, 65594, 327, '<td valign="top">Bravo!</td>', 'Bravo!', '2004-03-24 12:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(635711, 66072, 327, '<td valign="top">Love the feel of this unusual shot.</td>', 'Love the feel of this unusual shot.', '2004-03-24 12:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(635714, 65825, 18748, '<td valign="top">Whole picture looks dark to me, but nice idea 7</td>', 'Whole picture looks dark to me, but nice idea 7', '2004-03-24 12:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(635715, 65743, 327, '<td valign="top">Really a nice one~</td>', 'Really a nice one~', '2004-03-24 12:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(635716, 65261, 14603, '<td valign="top">I like the humour</td>', 'I like the humour', '2004-03-24 12:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(635717, 66180, 327, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, light.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, light.', '2004-03-24 12:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(635718, 66018, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset but oversharpend in an attempt to bring out the detail of the tree branches. It would be better with less USM.</td>', 'Nice sunset but oversharpend in an attempt to bring out the detail of the tree branches. It would be better with less USM.', '2004-03-24 12:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(635720, 65683, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice action and cool colors.</td>', 'Nice action and cool colors.', '2004-03-24 12:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(635721, 66035, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very nice perspective for this image.  Lovely golden-orange colors, meeting the challenge very well.  I wish you''d used a polarizer to take the haze out of the sky - the white in the upper part of the image detracts.  However, for the most part I like this image - very pretty and it captures a feeling of freshness and springtime.</td>', 'Very nice perspective for this image.  Lovely golden-orange colors, meeting the challenge very well.  I wish you''d used a polarizer to take the haze out of the sky - the white in the upper part of the image detracts.  However, for the most part I like this image - very pretty and it captures a feeling of freshness and springtime.', '2004-03-24 12:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(635722, 65558, 18748, '<td valign="top">Looks like animation,very nice.  I like light and color of composition. 9</td>', 'Looks like animation,very nice.  I like light and color of composition. 9', '2004-03-24 12:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(635724, 65854, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful image, nice and sharp with good textures.  Meets the challenge well.  I don''t care for the ornage frame, but I won''t mark down for that.  Nice work.  8</td>', 'Very beautiful image, nice and sharp with good textures.  Meets the challenge well.  I don''t care for the ornage frame, but I won''t mark down for that.  Nice work.  8', '2004-03-24 12:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(635725, 65344, 18748, '<td valign="top">Out of focus, and not to interesting bubbles.  Sorry</td>', 'Out of focus, and not to interesting bubbles.  Sorry', '2004-03-24 12:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(635727, 65637, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very nice, creative dynamic composition.  7</td>', 'Very nice, creative dynamic composition.  7', '2004-03-24 12:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(635730, 65517, 18868, '<td valign="top">technically very nice, but not very challenging to the viewer</td>', 'technically very nice, but not very challenging to the viewer', '2004-03-24 12:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(635731, 66362, 18868, '<td valign="top">yellow, aren''t they?</td>', 'yellow, aren''t they?', '2004-03-24 12:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(635732, 66073, 5391, '<td valign="top">I can''t really make out anything in this image that makes sense to me.  Piano keys, a sign saying "yellow", a flame and some other indistinguishable items that don''t seem related at all.  It''s orange, I''ll give you that, but photographically it doens''t work for me.</td>', 'I can''t really make out anything in this image that makes sense to me.  Piano keys, a sign saying "yellow", a flame and some other indistinguishable items that don''t seem related at all.  It''s orange, I''ll give you that, but photographically it doens''t work for me.', '2004-03-24 12:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(635733, 66323, 18868, '<td valign="top">clean, tight, nice light.</td>', 'clean, tight, nice light.', '2004-03-24 12:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(635735, 66374, 5391, '<td valign="top">Oooooooh...  Any woman who loves shoes is going to love this!!!  I''m one of them.  :)  Cool abstract composition and very cool shoes.  7</td>', 'Oooooooh...  Any woman who loves shoes is going to love this!!!  I''m one of them.  :)  Cool abstract composition and very cool shoes.  7', '2004-03-24 12:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(635736, 66180, 18868, '<td valign="top">very nice!  the tones are smooth where they should be smooth, sharp where they should be sharp, great color.  I like that it''s not totally vertical, maybe it needs a little more angle for drama.</td>', 'very nice!  the tones are smooth where they should be smooth, sharp where they should be sharp, great color.  I like that it''s not totally vertical, maybe it needs a little more angle for drama.', '2004-03-24 12:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(635737, 66441, 10644, '<td valign="top">very creative</td>', 'very creative', '2004-03-24 12:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(635738, 66291, 18868, '<td valign="top">sort of bland, and the dirt really detracts.</td>', 'sort of bland, and the dirt really detracts.', '2004-03-24 12:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(635739, 66369, 5391, '<td valign="top">It would be hard to make this any cuter.  Gus Gus (assuming that''s his name) is adorable, and your selective focus works perfectly for the challenge.  Maybe if he was looking straight on at the camera, it might be a tiny bit better, but so far this is one of my absolutely favorites.  I vote for a ribbon!  10</td>', 'It would be hard to make this any cuter.  Gus Gus (assuming that''s his name) is adorable, and your selective focus works perfectly for the challenge.  Maybe if he was looking straight on at the camera, it might be a tiny bit better, but so far this is one of my absolutely favorites.  I vote for a ribbon!  10', '2004-03-24 12:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(635740, 65437, 5792, '<td valign="top">Decent attempt at a still life, but the lighting is a little harsh and too much Neat Image was applied. Overall focus is too soft for my taste but that might have been your intention. The positioning of your main subject can be debated because it doesn''t meet the ROT and most still life images seem to be centered, but it seems OK to me. Photography rules are only guidlines and each image is unique.<br/> <br/>I''ll bet the "fails to meet the challenge" crowd is killing you on this one. :) Pay no attention to that.</td>', 'Decent attempt at a still life, but the lighting is a little harsh and too much Neat Image was applied. Overall focus is too soft for my taste but that might have been your intention. The positioning of your main subject can be debated because it doesn''t meet the ROT and most still life images seem to be centered, but it seems OK to me. Photography rules are only guidlines and each image is unique. I''ll bet the "fails to meet the challenge" crowd is killing you on this one. :) Pay no attention to that.', '2004-03-24 12:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(635743, 65366, 10644, '<td valign="top">goes nicely with the next challenge too</td>', 'goes nicely with the next challenge too', '2004-03-24 12:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
