(635961, 65122, 5391, '<td valign="top">This would be improved if the bird''s head were in focus, rather than the glove.  Since the glove is orange, you may have wanted it to be the focal point of your picture, specifically, but as a general photographic rule, anything with eyes should normally have the eyes in focus.  The viewer''s eye is naturally drawn there.</td>', 'This would be improved if the bird''s head were in focus, rather than the glove.  Since the glove is orange, you may have wanted it to be the focal point of your picture, specifically, but as a general photographic rule, anything with eyes should normally have the eyes in focus.  The viewer''s eye is naturally drawn there.', '2004-03-24 13:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(635963, 66301, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very nice still life macro shot.  Good composition and focus, and it meets the challenge well.  7</td>', 'Very nice still life macro shot.  Good composition and focus, and it meets the challenge well.  7', '2004-03-24 13:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(635964, 65600, 16499, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, but saturation seems to be low.</td>', 'Nice portrait, but saturation seems to be low.', '2004-03-24 13:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
