(635966, 65557, 18194, '<td valign="top">A very nice photo but the orange seems like a very minor part of the photo.  The yellow areas are to close in color to the bit of orange, so that the orange gets a bit lost.  If the other color in the flower had been something that contrasted more I think the orange would have had more power.  Still a nice photo in its own right.</td>', 'A very nice photo but the orange seems like a very minor part of the photo.  The yellow areas are to close in color to the bit of orange, so that the orange gets a bit lost.  If the other color in the flower had been something that contrasted more I think the orange would have had more power.  Still a nice photo in its own right.', '2004-03-24 13:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(635968, 65633, 327, '<td valign="top">This is pretty boring - I don''t really see a spin....looks like a glass of water. The focus is soft, but the light is okay.</td>', 'This is pretty boring - I don''t really see a spin....looks like a glass of water. The focus is soft, but the light is okay.', '2004-03-24 13:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(635969, 66234, 18194, '<td valign="top">I liked this one, I dont know why but I did.</td>', 'I liked this one, I dont know why but I did.', '2004-03-24 13:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(635971, 65463, 5391, '<td valign="top">The creativity of this shot really makes it stand out.  I''d like to see a little less grain and a little less yellow in the skin tone, but when you''re this creative, you''re allowed a little leeway as "artistic expression".  8</td>', 'The creativity of this shot really makes it stand out.  I''d like to see a little less grain and a little less yellow in the skin tone, but when you''re this creative, you''re allowed a little leeway as "artistic expression".  8', '2004-03-24 13:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(635972, 65899, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this for the most part, but the focus is a just to soft in this light to give it much interest. Good luck.</td>', 'I like this for the most part, but the focus is a just to soft in this light to give it much interest. Good luck.', '2004-03-24 13:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(635975, 66137, 327, '<td valign="top">Just a little soft of the focus..could stand to be sharpened some. I do like the shot.</td>', 'Just a little soft of the focus..could stand to be sharpened some. I do like the shot.', '2004-03-24 13:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(635977, 65550, 18194, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo, the gray background with just a bit of texture is perfect and the lighting is great.</td>', 'Wonderful photo, the gray background with just a bit of texture is perfect and the lighting is great.', '2004-03-24 13:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(635979, 66121, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very nice Julia image. The clarity, especially rock solid on the eyes makes this an outstanding image. Good use of DOF. There is some distraction because of the haloing on the back wing and the overexposure on the sunny front of the flower. Overall it is a great butterfly shot.</td>', 'Very nice Julia image. The clarity, especially rock solid on the eyes makes this an outstanding image. Good use of DOF. There is some distraction because of the haloing on the back wing and the overexposure on the sunny front of the flower. Overall it is a great butterfly shot.', '2004-03-24 13:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(635980, 65454, 16499, '<td valign="top">What a great idea!</td>', 'What a great idea!', '2004-03-24 13:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(635981, 66381, 327, '<td valign="top">Love flyfishing. Muddler minnow? Looks like it. Nice shot however the focus on the fly is a bit soft.<br/>//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=12835</td>', 'Love flyfishing. Muddler minnow? Looks like it. Nice shot however the focus on the fly is a bit soft.//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=12835', '2004-03-24 13:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(635982, 65343, 18194, '<td valign="top">This is either a fantastic photo or it should be disqualified.  If you really got this in one shot and did not have to do massive amounts of PhotoShop to it then it is an amazing shot.  It is a great photo in any event, I am hoping that it does meet the basic editing rules as it should do very well</td>', 'This is either a fantastic photo or it should be disqualified.  If you really got this in one shot and did not have to do massive amounts of PhotoShop to it then it is an amazing shot.  It is a great photo in any event, I am hoping that it does meet the basic editing rules as it should do very well', '2004-03-24 13:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(635983, 65800, 18752, '<td valign="top">This is a nice eye-pleasing composition but regretably not enough of true orange for me</td>', 'This is a nice eye-pleasing composition but regretably not enough of true orange for me', '2004-03-24 13:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(635984, 66136, 327, '<td valign="top">Focus and light let you down on this shot. Nice effort and the colors are awesome.</td>', 'Focus and light let you down on this shot. Nice effort and the colors are awesome.', '2004-03-24 13:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
