(635997, 65557, 16648, '<td valign="top">IF the flower appeared orange to me it might meet your title. As it shows up on my computer, it is a very vibrant yellow. Seeing that it lacks orange as a major part of the composition or image, I feel obligated to quote a cliche'' as well - Does not meet challenge. Other than that, it is very nice picture. NIce DOF, a rare thing in challenges.</td>', 'IF the flower appeared orange to me it might meet your title. As it shows up on my computer, it is a very vibrant yellow. Seeing that it lacks orange as a major part of the composition or image, I feel obligated to quote a cliche'' as well - Does not meet challenge. Other than that, it is very nice picture. NIce DOF, a rare thing in challenges.', '2004-03-24 14:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(635998, 65298, 16902, '<td valign="top">Lovely!</td>', 'Lovely!', '2004-03-24 14:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(636000, 66035, 16648, '<td valign="top">the mountains are boring. the flowers, and overall composition are very very nice though. THe naked mountians...cut them out and paste i some naked breasts and this goes from a 4  or 5 to a 9 or 10</td>', 'the mountains are boring. the flowers, and overall composition are very very nice though. THe naked mountians...cut them out and paste i some naked breasts and this goes from a 4  or 5 to a 9 or 10', '2004-03-24 14:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
