(636004, 66256, 16648, '<td valign="top">tough to get aquarium pics, so this is good on that score, but teh CD an dother thing in the background are distracting. Besides that, only 2 of the fish are smiling.</td>', 'tough to get aquarium pics, so this is good on that score, but teh CD an dother thing in the background are distracting. Besides that, only 2 of the fish are smiling.', '2004-03-24 14:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
