(636023, 65600, 16648, '<td valign="top">nice composition, but the lighting is abit flat, low contrast type of thing.</td>', 'nice composition, but the lighting is abit flat, low contrast type of thing.', '2004-03-24 14:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(636025, 66335, 16648, '<td valign="top">Bill has teeth. Do chickens have teeth?</td>', 'Bill has teeth. Do chickens have teeth?', '2004-03-24 14:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(636027, 65298, 16648, '<td valign="top">The tonearm is excellent - well lit, sharply focused, etc. Really pops out at me</td>', 'The tonearm is excellent - well lit, sharply focused, etc. Really pops out at me', '2004-03-24 14:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(636028, 65631, 12661, '<td valign="top">I have a very similar submission where the ''heart'' of the flower is orange. Sadly I am being rated poorly based on the fact that the entire flower isn''t orange. I hope it''s going better for you. As far as your composition, I think the croping takes away a lot of the context. The center doesn''t really stand out on it''s own and cropping in the entire flower may have given it more presence. Maybe you chose this crop to emphasize the orange.</td>', 'I have a very similar submission where the ''heart'' of the flower is orange. Sadly I am being rated poorly based on the fact that the entire flower isn''t orange. I hope it''s going better for you. As far as your composition, I think the croping takes away a lot of the context. The center doesn''t really stand out on it''s own and cropping in the entire flower may have given it more presence. Maybe you chose this crop to emphasize the orange.', '2004-03-24 14:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(636029, 65750, 16648, '<td valign="top">"The picture you did not submit would have done better" - quote from The Idiot''s Guide to Photography Contests.</td>', '"The picture you did not submit would have done better" - quote from The Idiot''s Guide to Photography Contests.', '2004-03-24 14:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(636032, 66298, 16648, '<td valign="top">too small</td>', 'too small', '2004-03-24 14:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(636034, 65694, 18752, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great idea and realization! I am also guessing that this is orange juice.</td>', 'Wow! Great idea and realization! I am also guessing that this is orange juice.', '2004-03-24 14:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
