(636075, 65443, 16982, '<td valign="top">Good picture, especially the angle.  The only downside is the light areas in the background.</td>', 'Good picture, especially the angle.  The only downside is the light areas in the background.', '2004-03-24 14:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(636077, 66076, 12661, '<td valign="top">The background is somewhat distracting, although you minimized it by propoerly using the depth of field. I''d love to see this flower after it opens up.</td>', 'The background is somewhat distracting, although you minimized it by propoerly using the depth of field. I''d love to see this flower after it opens up.', '2004-03-24 14:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(636084, 66223, 17033, '<td valign="top">I love orange beak pictures, too. But I don''t think we''re going to get very high marks for our efforts!!</td>', 'I love orange beak pictures, too. But I don''t think we''re going to get very high marks for our efforts!!', '2004-03-24 14:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(636085, 66291, 12661, '<td valign="top">You are really pushing the boundaries of ''orange'' here. It''s just enough to let slide though. The photograph itslef is very emotive and well taken. The background is the only part that I find lacking. While the use of negative space is nice, the blending in of the white stripes and the wall is a bit distracting. It kind of gives the impression that the arms aren''t attached.</td>', 'You are really pushing the boundaries of ''orange'' here. It''s just enough to let slide though. The photograph itslef is very emotive and well taken. The background is the only part that I find lacking. While the use of negative space is nice, the blending in of the white stripes and the wall is a bit distracting. It kind of gives the impression that the arms aren''t attached.', '2004-03-24 14:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(636087, 65437, 12661, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I am not the first to say... "See how creative you can be in composing an interesting shot where orange is the primary color without photographing the fruit called an "orange" (or any of its similar varieties, like tangerines.)"</td>', 'I''m sure I am not the first to say... "See how creative you can be in composing an interesting shot where orange is the primary color without photographing the fruit called an "orange" (or any of its similar varieties, like tangerines.)"', '2004-03-24 14:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(636088, 65768, 5391, '<td valign="top">One of the more clever "pepper" photos.  I''m not completely nuts about the centered composition, but you get extra points for thinking outside of the box (or inside of the pepper, as it were...)  My eyes wish for just a tiny bit more sharpness on those seeds, but I really like the effect of the backlight.</td>', 'One of the more clever "pepper" photos.  I''m not completely nuts about the centered composition, but you get extra points for thinking outside of the box (or inside of the pepper, as it were...)  My eyes wish for just a tiny bit more sharpness on those seeds, but I really like the effect of the backlight.', '2004-03-24 14:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(636096, 65899, 17033, '<td valign="top">Makes a nice change from endless bubble in glass pix. Nice focus. I wonder if cropping a little more off the right hand side would prevent the background distracting from the foreground. This isn''t Kenny is it? I thought they''d killed him?!</td>', 'Makes a nice change from endless bubble in glass pix. Nice focus. I wonder if cropping a little more off the right hand side would prevent the background distracting from the foreground. This isn''t Kenny is it? I thought they''d killed him?!', '2004-03-24 14:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(636102, 66009, 12661, '<td valign="top">Sadly, the lemon, being a citrus fruit, is of a ''similar variety'' of an orange. As such, I shall give you a 1 for not meeting the challenge. (Sorry, I could resist either). I love your interpretation and am tempted to add a 0 to the end of that 1 just for the shear genius of the idea. Photographically speaking, nice vibrant colors, nice lighting, and excellent composition/use of negative space. Very well done.</td>', 'Sadly, the lemon, being a citrus fruit, is of a ''similar variety'' of an orange. As such, I shall give you a 1 for not meeting the challenge. (Sorry, I could resist either). I love your interpretation and am tempted to add a 0 to the end of that 1 just for the shear genius of the idea. Photographically speaking, nice vibrant colors, nice lighting, and excellent composition/use of negative space. Very well done.', '2004-03-24 14:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(636104, 66403, 14986, '<td valign="top">Nice old barn.  I wish it wasn''t in so much shadow.  I would have cropped more off of the right side and lessened the border as well.  Still, a nice shot.</td>', 'Nice old barn.  I wish it wasn''t in so much shadow.  I would have cropped more off of the right side and lessened the border as well.  Still, a nice shot.', '2004-03-24 14:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(636105, 65876, 17033, '<td valign="top">After getting a bit bored of flower pix, this one really caught my attention. It has a great crispness to it and I like the fact that the stems in the foreground seem to be converging.</td>', 'After getting a bit bored of flower pix, this one really caught my attention. It has a great crispness to it and I like the fact that the stems in the foreground seem to be converging.', '2004-03-24 14:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(636106, 65993, 16982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful; almost completely orange!</td>', 'Beautiful; almost completely orange!', '2004-03-24 14:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(636107, 66343, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful abstract.  Fits the challenge well and really holds the eye.  8</td>', 'Beautiful abstract.  Fits the challenge well and really holds the eye.  8', '2004-03-24 14:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(636109, 65102, 14986, '<td valign="top">They sure do look like twins.  I would have changed the composition some to either come in closer on the flowers, or maybe set them off center a bit?  I think it would add interest to the shot.  Also, the focus seems a little off.  Pretty flowers.</td>', 'They sure do look like twins.  I would have changed the composition some to either come in closer on the flowers, or maybe set them off center a bit?  I think it would add interest to the shot.  Also, the focus seems a little off.  Pretty flowers.', '2004-03-24 14:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(636112, 65105, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  The negative space is a beautiful color that really contrasts well to bring out the orange in the butterfly, and the subject is placed perfectly in the frame to really give the viewer the feeling that it''s about to take off and float around in the rest of the image.  9</td>', 'Beautiful image.  The negative space is a beautiful color that really contrasts well to bring out the orange in the butterfly, and the subject is placed perfectly in the frame to really give the viewer the feeling that it''s about to take off and float around in the rest of the image.  9', '2004-03-24 14:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(636113, 66121, 17033, '<td valign="top">Nice pic but are you sure you''re not becoming overly familiar with your subjects?!!!</td>', 'Nice pic but are you sure you''re not becoming overly familiar with your subjects?!!!', '2004-03-24 14:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(636114, 65982, 14986, '<td valign="top">This one''s been babied.  Nice catch for the orange challenge.  Are you the owner or someone you know?  Or did you just catch this one?    The orange really stands out here and strengthens the shot.</td>', 'This one''s been babied.  Nice catch for the orange challenge.  Are you the owner or someone you know?  Or did you just catch this one?    The orange really stands out here and strengthens the shot.', '2004-03-24 14:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(636117, 65953, 14986, '<td valign="top">I kind of like this one.  I think a border helps, but this one is a bit too much IMO.  Is that really ice?  Looks like carpeting!    Good eye for the orange.</td>', 'I kind of like this one.  I think a border helps, but this one is a bit too much IMO.  Is that really ice?  Looks like carpeting!    Good eye for the orange.', '2004-03-24 15:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(636118, 65256, 12661, '<td valign="top">The idea is cute but the execution leaves me confused. The carrot is used to motivate someone to move forward yet your subject should be motivated to stay put. Maybe I am looking to deep into this.</td>', 'The idea is cute but the execution leaves me confused. The carrot is used to motivate someone to move forward yet your subject should be motivated to stay put. Maybe I am looking to deep into this.', '2004-03-24 15:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(636119, 66422, 12661, '<td valign="top">A nice sunset, however, the picture appears a bit too dark, especially since it is into the sun. It does pull a lot of contrast out of the clouds though.</td>', 'A nice sunset, however, the picture appears a bit too dark, especially since it is into the sun. It does pull a lot of contrast out of the clouds though.', '2004-03-24 15:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(636120, 66259, 14986, '<td valign="top">Cool looking flowers.  I really wish the lighting was better on the front one.   It needs some better lighting to get those colors to pop a bit.  I like having the main front one as the subject, but surrounded by the other orange flowers.</td>', 'Cool looking flowers.  I really wish the lighting was better on the front one.   It needs some better lighting to get those colors to pop a bit.  I like having the main front one as the subject, but surrounded by the other orange flowers.', '2004-03-24 15:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(636123, 65547, 17033, '<td valign="top">midriff or trousers...what''s the subject?</td>', 'midriff or trousers...what''s the subject?', '2004-03-24 15:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(636126, 65399, 14986, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but I think it''s a little too bright.  I''d like to see the orange be a little deeper color.  Strong entry for orange.  I would crop the left side just a bit more.</td>', 'I like the shot, but I think it''s a little too bright.  I''d like to see the orange be a little deeper color.  Strong entry for orange.  I would crop the left side just a bit more.', '2004-03-24 15:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(636127, 66223, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  Excellent job with the exposure on the ever-so-difficult all-white duck.  Fits the challenge well.  7</td>', 'Very cute.  Excellent job with the exposure on the ever-so-difficult all-white duck.  Fits the challenge well.  7', '2004-03-24 15:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(636128, 65951, 18219, '<td valign="top">sorry, can''t see any orange.</td>', 'sorry, can''t see any orange.', '2004-03-24 15:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(636129, 65895, 12661, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful picture. If you have access to this area, you may want to consider composing the photograph so that the hydrant is less prominant, maybe in one of the top corners. For the challenge, the foreground focus on the hydrant is understandable, but for prosperity, I think distancing it may show better.</td>', 'This is a wonderful picture. If you have access to this area, you may want to consider composing the photograph so that the hydrant is less prominant, maybe in one of the top corners. For the challenge, the foreground focus on the hydrant is understandable, but for prosperity, I think distancing it may show better.', '2004-03-24 15:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(636131, 65768, 17033, '<td valign="top">Just when i as getting bored of peppers...nice to see something in a new (orange) light...well done for originality</td>', 'Just when i as getting bored of peppers...nice to see something in a new (orange) light...well done for originality', '2004-03-24 15:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(636132, 66408, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is really lovely.  I would have cropped some more off the top and right side.</td>', 'This is really lovely.  I would have cropped some more off the top and right side.', '2004-03-24 15:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(636133, 65967, 5391, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big fan of images that look either negative or manipulated like this.  You did, however, make the image fit the challenge.  :)</td>', 'I''m not a big fan of images that look either negative or manipulated like this.  You did, however, make the image fit the challenge.  :)', '2004-03-24 15:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(636135, 65555, 18219, '<td valign="top">My favorite one thus far!</td>', 'My favorite one thus far!', '2004-03-24 15:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(636137, 66180, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  The dreamy colors really "pop" and are enhanced by the strong texture against the soft water.  This could easily be a ribbon winner.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  The dreamy colors really "pop" and are enhanced by the strong texture against the soft water.  This could easily be a ribbon winner.', '2004-03-24 15:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(636138, 65152, 14986, '<td valign="top">I think there''s too much orange.  It hurts my eyes to look at it.    The background also looks kinda sloppy to me.</td>', 'I think there''s too much orange.  It hurts my eyes to look at it.    The background also looks kinda sloppy to me.', '2004-03-24 15:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(636146, 66414, 14986, '<td valign="top">I tried the same shot and wasn''t happy with mine at all.  Mine had a white background, but I really like the blue in this one.  Colors and focus are right on.  I think this one turned out great.  Maybe could have used a green pepper instead of the red one for a little more contrast to the orange.  Maybe not, however, as I do like the colors here.</td>', 'I tried the same shot and wasn''t happy with mine at all.  Mine had a white background, but I really like the blue in this one.  Colors and focus are right on.  I think this one turned out great.  Maybe could have used a green pepper instead of the red one for a little more contrast to the orange.  Maybe not, however, as I do like the colors here.', '2004-03-24 15:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(636147, 66278, 5391, '<td valign="top">A glass of scotch would make voting on almost 400 pictures in this challenge a little more fun!  :)  Seriously, though, this is quite pretty.  I''m not sure that the second glass in the back is necessary - it has some distracting highlights and refelctions that the front, main glass doesn''t have.  Lovely colors and bubbles, though.</td>', 'A glass of scotch would make voting on almost 400 pictures in this challenge a little more fun!  :)  Seriously, though, this is quite pretty.  I''m not sure that the second glass in the back is necessary - it has some distracting highlights and refelctions that the front, main glass doesn''t have.  Lovely colors and bubbles, though.', '2004-03-24 15:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(636149, 66214, 14986, '<td valign="top">Looks more brown than orange to me, but color is subjective, so I''ll not vote down because of that.   Otherwise, the shot just doesn''t hold my interest.    I think technically it''s okay, although the lighting could be brighter.  Did you make the bracelet?</td>', 'Looks more brown than orange to me, but color is subjective, so I''ll not vote down because of that.   Otherwise, the shot just doesn''t hold my interest.    I think technically it''s okay, although the lighting could be brighter.  Did you make the bracelet?', '2004-03-24 15:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(636152, 66369, 14986, '<td valign="top">Kind of a cute shot.  Good job of bringing the eye to the orange.  And I like the border on this one.</td>', 'Kind of a cute shot.  Good job of bringing the eye to the orange.  And I like the border on this one.', '2004-03-24 15:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(636153, 66141, 5391, '<td valign="top">Okay, THAT''S funny and creative.  8</td>', 'Okay, THAT''S funny and creative.  8', '2004-03-24 15:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
