(636166, 65394, 12661, '<td valign="top">Very nice interpretation of the challenge. The depth of field really adds much dimension to the overall image. I wish I had something to say to help you improve, but I can''t think of anything.</td>', 'Very nice interpretation of the challenge. The depth of field really adds much dimension to the overall image. I wish I had something to say to help you improve, but I can''t think of anything.', '2004-03-24 15:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
