(636170, 65683, 14986, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture for orange.  I like the angle you caught it at as well.  Nice job.</td>', 'Wonderful capture for orange.  I like the angle you caught it at as well.  Nice job.', '2004-03-24 15:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
