(636437, 65980, 18552, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photograph. The way you have the bead screen in focus and everything in the background blurred is very effective.</td>', 'Wonderful photograph. The way you have the bead screen in focus and everything in the background blurred is very effective.', '2004-03-24 17:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(636438, 65351, 327, '<td valign="top">You are better then this shot.....please. It''s oof, and not attractive to view.</td>', 'You are better then this shot.....please. It''s oof, and not attractive to view.', '2004-03-24 17:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(636439, 65628, 327, '<td valign="top">While this is true:Orange Shapes and Textures......it''s boring to look at. There is little detail because it''s OOF. The light is too strong. Work on composition, shoot 100''s of shots. You can do better.</td>', 'While this is true:Orange Shapes and Textures......it''s boring to look at. There is little detail because it''s OOF. The light is too strong. Work on composition, shoot 100''s of shots. You can do better.', '2004-03-24 17:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(636441, 66225, 16106, '<td valign="top">Yes it is orange, yes it is sort of interesting to look at, but so are most of the other photos in this challenge, I want more. What is this thing you photographed and why should I care about it? Cool shot, but......</td>', 'Yes it is orange, yes it is sort of interesting to look at, but so are most of the other photos in this challenge, I want more. What is this thing you photographed and why should I care about it? Cool shot, but......', '2004-03-24 17:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(636443, 65128, 772, '<td valign="top">Great shot with excellent detail... = 10</td>', 'Great shot with excellent detail... = 10', '2004-03-24 17:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(636444, 65555, 16106, '<td valign="top">Im seeing parallel lines eveywhere!</td>', 'Im seeing parallel lines eveywhere!', '2004-03-24 17:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(636445, 66260, 327, '<td valign="top">I know you have more creative ideas in your head then a wall. This is texture, it''s orange.......but...........it''s OOF, and boring. There needs to be more to score higher.</td>', 'I know you have more creative ideas in your head then a wall. This is texture, it''s orange.......but...........it''s OOF, and boring. There needs to be more to score higher.', '2004-03-24 17:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(636446, 65667, 772, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.. the human element here creates a lot of strength... = 10</td>', 'Beautiful shot.. the human element here creates a lot of strength... = 10', '2004-03-24 17:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(636447, 65694, 18191, '<td valign="top">The thin light on the bottle it distracting.</td>', 'The thin light on the bottle it distracting.', '2004-03-24 17:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(636449, 66252, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful.. the placement of the sun is perfect... = 10</td>', 'beautiful.. the placement of the sun is perfect... = 10', '2004-03-24 17:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(636450, 65437, 327, '<td valign="top">Yes, and the light/color and background are not complimentary. You''ll need to be a bit more creative to score higher on DPC.</td>', 'Yes, and the light/color and background are not complimentary. You''ll need to be a bit more creative to score higher on DPC.', '2004-03-24 17:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(636451, 66199, 772, '<td valign="top">phenomenally nice photo... i can hear it... = 10</td>', 'phenomenally nice photo... i can hear it... = 10', '2004-03-24 17:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(636452, 66074, 327, '<td valign="top">The color is good, the light is good (few shadows distract) but the photo is not complete..it feels half finished. Also the one pencil''s text is cut off.</td>', 'The color is good, the light is good (few shadows distract) but the photo is not complete..it feels half finished. Also the one pencil''s text is cut off.', '2004-03-24 17:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(636454, 65993, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot... = 10</td>', 'This is a great shot... = 10', '2004-03-24 17:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(636456, 65644, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent example of simplicity... great work :) = 10</td>', 'This is an excellent example of simplicity... great work :) = 10', '2004-03-24 17:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(636457, 66012, 327, '<td valign="top">The composition is not good for this shot. What is in focus? Do I see the liquid on the top? on the bottom......no, it''s OOF. The color is good, but no focus.</td>', 'The composition is not good for this shot. What is in focus? Do I see the liquid on the top? on the bottom......no, it''s OOF. The color is good, but no focus.', '2004-03-24 17:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(636458, 66292, 16106, '<td valign="top">Did you try putting the chair in the light? I find the pattern of light distracting and a bit blown out, I would either use it  or lose it.</td>', 'Did you try putting the chair in the light? I find the pattern of light distracting and a bit blown out, I would either use it  or lose it.', '2004-03-24 17:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(636461, 65991, 16106, '<td valign="top">As orange, so-so, but this is a great shot and would have done major damage in motion blur.</td>', 'As orange, so-so, but this is a great shot and would have done major damage in motion blur.', '2004-03-24 17:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(636463, 66246, 327, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t feel Arabian. She needs more &lt;dark&gt; make-up and more jewels! Sparkles!!!<br/>The backdrop needs pressing and the light is far to bright. It''s not a bad entry, please know I''m not slamming your shot, just my opinion and thoughts.</td>', 'This doesn''t feel Arabian. She needs more <dark> make-up and more jewels! Sparkles!!!The backdrop needs pressing and the light is far to bright. It''s not a bad entry, please know I''m not slamming your shot, just my opinion and thoughts.', '2004-03-24 17:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(636464, 65741, 3524, '<td valign="top">Very nice work clipping the hilights and shadows. You''ve got a strong composition and your technique really enhances it.</td>', 'Very nice work clipping the hilights and shadows. You''ve got a strong composition and your technique really enhances it.', '2004-03-24 17:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(636465, 66298, 18191, '<td valign="top">its nice, but a little bit too small.</td>', 'its nice, but a little bit too small.', '2004-03-24 17:31:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(636466, 66399, 16488, '<td valign="top">Made me smile.</td>', 'Made me smile.', '2004-03-24 17:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(636467, 65813, 16106, '<td valign="top">very funny, if you had gotten them in focus, this would have won! Well it would have won my highest vote.</td>', 'very funny, if you had gotten them in focus, this would have won! Well it would have won my highest vote.', '2004-03-24 17:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(636472, 66393, 16106, '<td valign="top">Looking forward to next challenge? Beautifully light.</td>', 'Looking forward to next challenge? Beautifully light.', '2004-03-24 17:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(636474, 66347, 18191, '<td valign="top">I like what you did with this---very...unique.</td>', 'I like what you did with this---very...unique.', '2004-03-24 17:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(636475, 66435, 16488, '<td valign="top">Awesome sky, but the horizon line seems downhill.</td>', 'Awesome sky, but the horizon line seems downhill.', '2004-03-24 17:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(636479, 66076, 16106, '<td valign="top">Great light on the flower, but a horrible backround.</td>', 'Great light on the flower, but a horrible backround.', '2004-03-24 17:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(636483, 65272, 16488, '<td valign="top">Beautiful motion.  Wish the destination (person in the distance?) was more evident, or absent altogether.</td>', 'Beautiful motion.  Wish the destination (person in the distance?) was more evident, or absent altogether.', '2004-03-24 17:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(636487, 66266, 16488, '<td valign="top">A little too overt to be provocative.</td>', 'A little too overt to be provocative.', '2004-03-24 17:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(636489, 66257, 17937, '<td valign="top">I think I would like this photo much better without the building and satalite dish on the left.  Nice shot otheriwse.</td>', 'I think I would like this photo much better without the building and satalite dish on the left.  Nice shot otheriwse.', '2004-03-24 17:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(636492, 66424, 17937, '<td valign="top">Is this beer?  I love beer.. :)  I think I would have shown more of the glass to help make it less blurry.</td>', 'Is this beer?  I love beer.. :)  I think I would have shown more of the glass to help make it less blurry.', '2004-03-24 17:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(636494, 65464, 16488, '<td valign="top">Disturbing.  I like images which emote feelings even when I don''t like the feeling.</td>', 'Disturbing.  I like images which emote feelings even when I don''t like the feeling.', '2004-03-24 17:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(636495, 66381, 17937, '<td valign="top">DIfferent.  There isn''t much orange shown but the contrast is good enough that your eyes focus right to the it.  Nice work.</td>', 'DIfferent.  There isn''t much orange shown but the contrast is good enough that your eyes focus right to the it.  Nice work.', '2004-03-24 17:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(636497, 65649, 1570, '<td valign="top">this is so out of focus that i can''t tell what it is - it isn''t orange, is it? but they told us not to use it...</td>', 'this is so out of focus that i can''t tell what it is - it isn''t orange, is it? but they told us not to use it...', '2004-03-24 17:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(636499, 66384, 16488, '<td valign="top">Seems as if this might have held my interest were the orange car not first in line...</td>', 'Seems as if this might have held my interest were the orange car not first in line...', '2004-03-24 17:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(636500, 66416, 327, '<td valign="top">Well done.....love this one. Stunning contrast, color. :)</td>', 'Well done.....love this one. Stunning contrast, color. :)', '2004-03-24 17:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(636502, 65996, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like the shot a lot, especially the texture.  It looks like I can reach out and touch it.  I''m not so sure I''d call this "orange," though.</td>', 'I like the shot a lot, especially the texture.  It looks like I can reach out and touch it.  I''m not so sure I''d call this "orange," though.', '2004-03-24 17:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(636504, 66292, 327, '<td valign="top">I used to have that same chair, but in green and with at least 5 coats of paint on it..lol Love this shot. I do think it could be a bit more crisp/sharp. Good entry, and a good over all feel to this shot.</td>', 'I used to have that same chair, but in green and with at least 5 coats of paint on it..lol Love this shot. I do think it could be a bit more crisp/sharp. Good entry, and a good over all feel to this shot.', '2004-03-24 17:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(636505, 66111, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice light, color, focus. Good job.</td>', 'Nice light, color, focus. Good job.', '2004-03-24 17:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(636506, 65721, 16106, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I wish you either got rid of the tree or used more of it, it looks like a mistake. I love the way you played the backboadr against the sky.</td>', 'Nice idea, but I wish you either got rid of the tree or used more of it, it looks like a mistake. I love the way you played the backboadr against the sky.', '2004-03-24 17:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(636510, 66199, 3102, '<td valign="top">A rather cool shot, but it feels like it should have been rotated a bit counter-clockwise.</td>', 'A rather cool shot, but it feels like it should have been rotated a bit counter-clockwise.', '2004-03-24 17:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(636514, 65131, 16488, '<td valign="top">Too commercial to me to be "interesting."</td>', 'Too commercial to me to be "interesting."', '2004-03-24 17:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(636516, 66412, 16488, '<td valign="top">Delightful!</td>', 'Delightful!', '2004-03-24 17:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(636517, 66239, 327, '<td valign="top">This is not sexy, not good/attractive to look at. The yellow top is too pale on her fair skin better if it was not seen. I think it might of been a good idea at the get go..............but it ended in a mess. The bed/carpet is busy....there is no _one_ focal point here. What is the intention?? This girl has skin to die for...and a knock out figure....use it for better photos, I know you can do it!!<br/>Justine <br/></td>', 'This is not sexy, not good/attractive to look at. The yellow top is too pale on her fair skin better if it was not seen. I think it might of been a good idea at the get go..............but it ended in a mess. The bed/carpet is busy....there is no _one_ focal point here. What is the intention?? This girl has skin to die for...and a knock out figure....use it for better photos, I know you can do it!!Justine ', '2004-03-24 17:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(636518, 65649, 16106, '<td valign="top">Shooting for the brown? Violation of the challenge and badly out of focus? give the person what they want I say!</td>', 'Shooting for the brown? Violation of the challenge and badly out of focus? give the person what they want I say!', '2004-03-24 17:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(636519, 65349, 18656, '<td valign="top">A little more DOF and this photo would be the best</td>', 'A little more DOF and this photo would be the best', '2004-03-24 17:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(636521, 66384, 7743, '<td valign="top">The exposure is good, nothing blown out or too dark but the depth of field is just a little bit too shallow.  Part of the Lambourghini is out of focus.  <br/></td>', 'The exposure is good, nothing blown out or too dark but the depth of field is just a little bit too shallow.  Part of the Lambourghini is out of focus.  ', '2004-03-24 17:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(636522, 65273, 327, '<td valign="top">Not bad but the focus is not crisp and the light is un-attractive to the shot.</td>', 'Not bad but the focus is not crisp and the light is un-attractive to the shot.', '2004-03-24 17:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(636524, 66253, 327, '<td valign="top">Needs a tighter crop, more focus. Too many stems, partial flowers going on and making this look far too busy. The eye can''t settle on the subject!!</td>', 'Needs a tighter crop, more focus. Too many stems, partial flowers going on and making this look far too busy. The eye can''t settle on the subject!!', '2004-03-24 17:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(636526, 66389, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting planes and lines.</td>', 'Interesting planes and lines.', '2004-03-24 17:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(636527, 66039, 327, '<td valign="top">Your composition and light are the down fall for this entry. Yes, orange, but interest....no. The focus is soft, and the light is too harsh. Try and cover your flash with tissue/brown paper or cloth.</td>', 'Your composition and light are the down fall for this entry. Yes, orange, but interest....no. The focus is soft, and the light is too harsh. Try and cover your flash with tissue/brown paper or cloth.', '2004-03-24 17:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(636528, 65557, 327, '<td valign="top">This is okay, but it misses the mark because it''s not crisp..</td>', 'This is okay, but it misses the mark because it''s not crisp..', '2004-03-24 17:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(636529, 66266, 7743, '<td valign="top">The background colour doesn''t seem to work.  A solid black background would make your subject pop.</td>', 'The background colour doesn''t seem to work.  A solid black background would make your subject pop.', '2004-03-24 17:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(636532, 65272, 14986, '<td valign="top">I like the motion in this shot.  I also like the composition...the girl on the left side of the photo, walking up the path.  The muted colors of the winter season offset the colors on the girl nicely.</td>', 'I like the motion in this shot.  I also like the composition...the girl on the left side of the photo, walking up the path.  The muted colors of the winter season offset the colors on the girl nicely.', '2004-03-24 17:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(636533, 66368, 15920, '<td valign="top">Soft focus has always been something that I didn''t prefer, so take this for what it is worth:  a sharper focus on the flower would have helped a lot.  That having been said, I really like the background color choice with this.</td>', 'Soft focus has always been something that I didn''t prefer, so take this for what it is worth:  a sharper focus on the flower would have helped a lot.  That having been said, I really like the background color choice with this.', '2004-03-24 17:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(636534, 66433, 16488, '<td valign="top">Luscious color!  Not sure about the composition.</td>', 'Luscious color!  Not sure about the composition.', '2004-03-24 17:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(636536, 65613, 16636, '<td valign="top">a much tighter crop on the main subject would improve the pic I think, the leaf is only a distraction</td>', 'a much tighter crop on the main subject would improve the pic I think, the leaf is only a distraction', '2004-03-24 17:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(636537, 66168, 327, '<td valign="top">Orange chairs, ....yes and in focus and the light is okay......but there is no point of interest for the viewer. Maybe a nude man in the window....a flower on the table..a vase, a coke can.....something to cause the viewer to say...ahhh wow!!</td>', 'Orange chairs, ....yes and in focus and the light is okay......but there is no point of interest for the viewer. Maybe a nude man in the window....a flower on the table..a vase, a coke can.....something to cause the viewer to say...ahhh wow!!', '2004-03-24 17:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(636539, 66006, 327, '<td valign="top">Here the rule of thirds would of helped your shot......dead center is not working. Also check your levels with Photoshop or in your camera...the background is blueish.</td>', 'Here the rule of thirds would of helped your shot......dead center is not working. Also check your levels with Photoshop or in your camera...the background is blueish.', '2004-03-24 17:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(636540, 65895, 16488, '<td valign="top">Not enough orange.</td>', 'Not enough orange.', '2004-03-24 17:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(636542, 66436, 15920, '<td valign="top">Too bad this is basic editing, taking the inside bottle contents back to their original state would really make this exceptional.  As is, it is "only" very good.  Nice focus and good use of dark background.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'Too bad this is basic editing, taking the inside bottle contents back to their original state would really make this exceptional.  As is, it is "only" very good.  Nice focus and good use of dark background.  Very nicely done.', '2004-03-24 17:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(636543, 66266, 14986, '<td valign="top">Amazing what our minds see in even the simple things!   Something about the lighting on this is lacking a bit.  I''m not sure what it is.</td>', 'Amazing what our minds see in even the simple things!   Something about the lighting on this is lacking a bit.  I''m not sure what it is.', '2004-03-24 17:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(636544, 66365, 327, '<td valign="top">Carrots......yes and in focus and the light is okay......but there is no point of interest for the viewer. Maybe a whole carrot tossed in....a flower on the table..a vase, a knife.....something to cause the viewer to say...ahhh wow!!</td>', 'Carrots......yes and in focus and the light is okay......but there is no point of interest for the viewer. Maybe a whole carrot tossed in....a flower on the table..a vase, a knife.....something to cause the viewer to say...ahhh wow!!', '2004-03-24 17:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(636545, 65612, 16488, '<td valign="top">Pretty light on the large flower.  Composition could focus more on the one bloom.</td>', 'Pretty light on the large flower.  Composition could focus more on the one bloom.', '2004-03-24 17:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(636551, 66036, 327, '<td valign="top">Focus is soft and the light is wrong causing it to give a blue cast on your candy.  I think your original idea was very good.:)</td>', 'Focus is soft and the light is wrong causing it to give a blue cast on your candy.  I think your original idea was very good.:)', '2004-03-24 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(636552, 66061, 7743, '<td valign="top">Exposure is great.  The colours are vibrant.  What might work better (compositionally that is) is to crop a little on the left and include the entire handle or more of the reflection of the handle on the mug.</td>', 'Exposure is great.  The colours are vibrant.  What might work better (compositionally that is) is to crop a little on the left and include the entire handle or more of the reflection of the handle on the mug.', '2004-03-24 17:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(636553, 65229, 14986, '<td valign="top">Nice clear picture, but the subject holds no interest.</td>', 'Nice clear picture, but the subject holds no interest.', '2004-03-24 17:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(636554, 66228, 16106, '<td valign="top">Nicer shot than it is orange, had it been called blue you would have been in contention.</td>', 'Nicer shot than it is orange, had it been called blue you would have been in contention.', '2004-03-24 17:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(636555, 65363, 15920, '<td valign="top">A little grainy, but very far from bad.  Great colors on both the exterior and interior with the light inside being slightly over exposed.  I like the small orange light in the lower right corner.  Overall, an acceptable effort.</td>', 'A little grainy, but very far from bad.  Great colors on both the exterior and interior with the light inside being slightly over exposed.  I like the small orange light in the lower right corner.  Overall, an acceptable effort.', '2004-03-24 17:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(636556, 65991, 14986, '<td valign="top">This would have scored 2-3 points higher from me in the "Motion Blur" challenge.  It''s a nice shot.  No presence of orange here...unless you think that jacket is orange.  I''ll give the benefit of the doubt on that, but it''s not a strong element.</td>', 'This would have scored 2-3 points higher from me in the "Motion Blur" challenge.  It''s a nice shot.  No presence of orange here...unless you think that jacket is orange.  I''ll give the benefit of the doubt on that, but it''s not a strong element.', '2004-03-24 18:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(636557, 66178, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, but it seems a little too unfocused.</td>', 'Interesting concept, but it seems a little too unfocused.', '2004-03-24 18:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(636559, 65994, 14986, '<td valign="top">Pretty, clear shot.  I would have liked the angle a little bit more straight on.</td>', 'Pretty, clear shot.  I would have liked the angle a little bit more straight on.', '2004-03-24 18:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(636560, 65220, 16488, '<td valign="top">Almost.</td>', 'Almost.', '2004-03-24 18:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(636561, 66190, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty, springy shot.  It looks like the whole picture has had the tint changed.</td>', 'This is a very pretty, springy shot.  It looks like the whole picture has had the tint changed.', '2004-03-24 18:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(636562, 66237, 16488, '<td valign="top">Not clear on the subject.</td>', 'Not clear on the subject.', '2004-03-24 18:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(636565, 65454, 16488, '<td valign="top">Well conceived and even amusing.</td>', 'Well conceived and even amusing.', '2004-03-24 18:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(636566, 66441, 14986, '<td valign="top">Fun shot  I think technically it''s excellent...very clear, good lighting.  And the fun idea rates some extra points.</td>', 'Fun shot  I think technically it''s excellent...very clear, good lighting.  And the fun idea rates some extra points.', '2004-03-24 18:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(636568, 66324, 14986, '<td valign="top">Wish that orange one would stand out just a little bit more.</td>', 'Wish that orange one would stand out just a little bit more.', '2004-03-24 18:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(636571, 66272, 14986, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting in this shot.  I also like the choice of border.</td>', 'I like the lighting in this shot.  I also like the choice of border.', '2004-03-24 18:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(636574, 66436, 14986, '<td valign="top">Really like how you captured this.  I don''t think orange is the dominant feature in the photo, though.  Still gets a good score from me for technical merit.</td>', 'Really like how you captured this.  I don''t think orange is the dominant feature in the photo, though.  Still gets a good score from me for technical merit.', '2004-03-24 18:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(636575, 65455, 7743, '<td valign="top">The focus seems just a little bit off (DOF slightly too shallow).  The robin''s head is not as sharp as its tail.</td>', 'The focus seems just a little bit off (DOF slightly too shallow).  The robin''s head is not as sharp as its tail.', '2004-03-24 18:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(636576, 65122, 14986, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems dim and the focus is soft.   I also find the hand distracting.  I think the idea of the bird is good if you could have caught him on something else.</td>', 'Lighting seems dim and the focus is soft.   I also find the hand distracting.  I think the idea of the bird is good if you could have caught him on something else.', '2004-03-24 18:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(636578, 66081, 14986, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  Really meets the challenge well.</td>', 'Very pretty.  Really meets the challenge well.', '2004-03-24 18:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
