(636754, 65298, 327, '<td valign="top">It may be old and out of the MP3 player loop....but it is a good photo. I like it. The light is sweet..Real nice entry. Good luck.</td>', 'It may be old and out of the MP3 player loop....but it is a good photo. I like it. The light is sweet..Real nice entry. Good luck.', '2004-03-24 19:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
