(636758, 66252, 327, '<td valign="top">How beautiful. Wow Barcelona...it''s on my to see list. I like silhouettes and you got the colors just right. Good entry.</td>', 'How beautiful. Wow Barcelona...it''s on my to see list. I like silhouettes and you got the colors just right. Good entry.', '2004-03-24 19:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
