(636761, 65550, 327, '<td valign="top">Good try and good capture of action. I just feel the light could of been improved. Do you see at the back of the cup where it''s dark? Also the front of the cup at the bottom. Other then the small (and they are small defects) spots, this is a good entry. I hope you do well.</td>', 'Good try and good capture of action. I just feel the light could of been improved. Do you see at the back of the cup where it''s dark? Also the front of the cup at the bottom. Other then the small (and they are small defects) spots, this is a good entry. I hope you do well.', '2004-03-24 19:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(636762, 65517, 806, '<td valign="top">crop right in to eliminate the surroundings. nice clear image.. glad to see something is growing somewhere! LOL</td>', 'crop right in to eliminate the surroundings. nice clear image.. glad to see something is growing somewhere! LOL', '2004-03-24 19:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(636763, 66095, 12661, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. I like the way you captured the color in both the lenses and the shadow. The cropping is a bit too tight however. I don''t mind the right lense being cropped, but the top half of the right temple should have been within the frame.</td>', 'Nicely composed. I like the way you captured the color in both the lenses and the shadow. The cropping is a bit too tight however. I don''t mind the right lense being cropped, but the top half of the right temple should have been within the frame.', '2004-03-24 19:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(636764, 66141, 806, '<td valign="top">LOL! neat image!</td>', 'LOL! neat image!', '2004-03-24 19:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(636766, 66429, 7743, '<td valign="top">The lighting inside the dome is incredible.  The eye is drawn immediately to the circle at the top of the dome.  Even though there are several blown areas they are not distracting due to the strength of the rest of the image.</td>', 'The lighting inside the dome is incredible.  The eye is drawn immediately to the circle at the top of the dome.  Even though there are several blown areas they are not distracting due to the strength of the rest of the image.', '2004-03-24 19:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(636768, 65518, 16488, '<td valign="top">Gentle.  Nice.  Like the composition.  I can almost feel the viewer waiting for the perfect image to keep in memory.</td>', 'Gentle.  Nice.  Like the composition.  I can almost feel the viewer waiting for the perfect image to keep in memory.', '2004-03-24 19:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(636769, 66407, 12661, '<td valign="top">Great macro. I would have increased the DOF some to place more of the flower in focus however. Leaving only the  back pedals out of focus could have been better.</td>', 'Great macro. I would have increased the DOF some to place more of the flower in focus however. Leaving only the  back pedals out of focus could have been better.', '2004-03-24 19:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(636774, 65439, 12661, '<td valign="top">Very vibrant and strong colors. The only downside is that the image looks a bit grainy.</td>', 'Very vibrant and strong colors. The only downside is that the image looks a bit grainy.', '2004-03-24 19:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(636779, 66180, 12661, '<td valign="top">The water looks very soothing and relaxing. You captured it well.  The twig floating along to the right of the pole is unfortunate, but I applaud you for keeping in the spirit of the rules and not cloning it out.</td>', 'The water looks very soothing and relaxing. You captured it well.  The twig floating along to the right of the pole is unfortunate, but I applaud you for keeping in the spirit of the rules and not cloning it out.', '2004-03-24 19:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(636781, 65989, 12661, '<td valign="top">Nice job capturing the colors of the sky. I would have zoomed out a bit to put more ground reference in the shot however. Regardless, it''s a lovely shot.</td>', 'Nice job capturing the colors of the sky. I would have zoomed out a bit to put more ground reference in the shot however. Regardless, it''s a lovely shot.', '2004-03-24 19:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(636782, 65858, 18191, '<td valign="top">So many photos of plants'' privates!</td>', 'So many photos of plants'' privates!', '2004-03-24 19:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(636783, 65612, 7743, '<td valign="top">These poppies have great colour.  The partial flower on the left is distracting though.  Cropping it out would give the image far more impact.</td>', 'These poppies have great colour.  The partial flower on the left is distracting though.  Cropping it out would give the image far more impact.', '2004-03-24 19:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(636784, 65366, 16148, '<td valign="top">I know this is an orange challenge but I would have liked this better with a black background.  I think the impact is lost with a solid orange picture.  Nice idea.</td>', 'I know this is an orange challenge but I would have liked this better with a black background.  I think the impact is lost with a solid orange picture.  Nice idea.', '2004-03-24 19:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
