(636787, 65383, 12661, '<td valign="top">While it does meet the challenge, I find that this photo lacks context. Basically, it could be anything. In judging as an abstract photo, the curves of the hot bar are nice and the color is very vibrant. But again, I think more needs to be in this photo to tie it all together.</td>', 'While it does meet the challenge, I find that this photo lacks context. Basically, it could be anything. In judging as an abstract photo, the curves of the hot bar are nice and the color is very vibrant. But again, I think more needs to be in this photo to tie it all together.', '2004-03-24 19:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
