(636815, 65985, 3524, '<td valign="top">This has a really cool Mondrian style to it. The blue sky and almost-neutral bottom windows are a great fit against the orange. I think it would be interesting to see what this would look if you took a shot from further away and zoomed back in so that the perspective isn''t as strong. Just curious. It would probably ruin the reflections though.</td>', 'This has a really cool Mondrian style to it. The blue sky and almost-neutral bottom windows are a great fit against the orange. I think it would be interesting to see what this would look if you took a shot from further away and zoomed back in so that the perspective isn''t as strong. Just curious. It would probably ruin the reflections though.', '2004-03-24 19:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
