(637114, 66336, 12151, '<td valign="top">Great geometry and color here.  One of the best shots of a guitar that I''ve seen here.  If I didn''t know what a guitar was, I would like this a lot as an abstract photo.</td>', 'Great geometry and color here.  One of the best shots of a guitar that I''ve seen here.  If I didn''t know what a guitar was, I would like this a lot as an abstract photo.', '2004-03-24 23:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(637115, 65650, 15407, '<td valign="top">Tough subject to keep off the reflections... It looks like you were able to adjust the levels to make it better .  I find it a little oversharpened.</td>', 'Tough subject to keep off the reflections... It looks like you were able to adjust the levels to make it better .  I find it a little oversharpened.', '2004-03-24 23:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(637116, 65400, 12151, '<td valign="top">Great textures; the weathered look also gives this photo a touch of bittersweet mood.  Very well done.</td>', 'Great textures; the weathered look also gives this photo a touch of bittersweet mood.  Very well done.', '2004-03-24 23:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(637117, 65623, 12151, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a graininess about this photo that bothers me sometimes.  But then it enhances the photo every other time I look at it...  Strange.  But the pose is perfect, and the orange accents the sense of power nicely.  This photo is tied with one other photo for my top vote of the week.</td>', 'There seems to be a graininess about this photo that bothers me sometimes.  But then it enhances the photo every other time I look at it...  Strange.  But the pose is perfect, and the orange accents the sense of power nicely.  This photo is tied with one other photo for my top vote of the week.', '2004-03-24 23:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(637119, 65993, 12151, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent photo.  I don''t know how the sky ended up layering into two shades like that, but it certainly adds to the composition.  The strong oranges here are rich, almost threatening.  Very interesting look.  This photo is tied with one other photo for my top vote of the week.</td>', 'This is an excellent photo.  I don''t know how the sky ended up layering into two shades like that, but it certainly adds to the composition.  The strong oranges here are rich, almost threatening.  Very interesting look.  This photo is tied with one other photo for my top vote of the week.', '2004-03-24 23:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(637120, 65694, 12131, '<td valign="top">You this shot would be good for motion blur too I think.  Solid color.  Looks tasty.</td>', 'You this shot would be good for motion blur too I think.  Solid color.  Looks tasty.', '2004-03-24 23:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(637123, 66105, 12151, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot - I''d like to see more versions of this photo, as this one seems to be lacking something.  What''s great about this photo, though, is the subject''s expression, as well as the flashing hair.  Great color choice for the sweater, too.</td>', 'This is a great shot - I''d like to see more versions of this photo, as this one seems to be lacking something.  What''s great about this photo, though, is the subject''s expression, as well as the flashing hair.  Great color choice for the sweater, too.', '2004-03-24 23:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(637124, 66250, 12131, '<td valign="top">Interesting style, kind of ghostly.  It also looks a bit too contrived  Still I like the sharpness. 5</td>', 'Interesting style, kind of ghostly.  It also looks a bit too contrived  Still I like the sharpness. 5', '2004-03-24 23:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(637125, 65576, 12131, '<td valign="top">Little kids can be so adorable.  I love the clueless expressions on this one.  It also heightens the presence of the orange. 7</td>', 'Little kids can be so adorable.  I love the clueless expressions on this one.  It also heightens the presence of the orange. 7', '2004-03-24 23:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(637132, 65399, 12131, '<td valign="top">A tad overexposed but definitely orange. 8</td>', 'A tad overexposed but definitely orange. 8', '2004-03-24 23:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(637136, 66076, 18552, '<td valign="top">Your flower picture is really beautiful. However, I think it would be even better with a plain background - the blurred room behind the flower really detracts from the shot.</td>', 'Your flower picture is really beautiful. However, I think it would be even better with a plain background - the blurred room behind the flower really detracts from the shot.', '2004-03-24 23:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(637141, 66339, 10848, '<td valign="top">Well I must say with all the discussion about what defines orange I would say you definitely have it covered lol. So no one can ever say you did not meet the challenge. Very creative and you covered all your bases, I like your spunk :)</td>', 'Well I must say with all the discussion about what defines orange I would say you definitely have it covered lol. So no one can ever say you did not meet the challenge. Very creative and you covered all your bases, I like your spunk :)', '2004-03-24 23:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(637142, 66035, 13390, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph!!! I enjoy the colors and lighting, very nicely done! Good eye for the shot. There is one thing however that I feel could have made this image a LOT stronger. There are two flowers on the right that draw my focus away from this gorgeous shot, I think it would be a solid shot if you cropped those out. Other than, simply beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful photograph!!! I enjoy the colors and lighting, very nicely done! Good eye for the shot. There is one thing however that I feel could have made this image a LOT stronger. There are two flowers on the right that draw my focus away from this gorgeous shot, I think it would be a solid shot if you cropped those out. Other than, simply beautiful!', '2004-03-25 00:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(637146, 65637, 13390, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge. I really like it. Excellent DOF! However, may I suggest including the whole razor in the shot (this is a personal preference thing for me), it would add more of a sense of completeness. Also, I''m not the biggest fan of borders (I don''t mark these down because I score the shot, not the border). Good luck!</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge. I really like it. Excellent DOF! However, may I suggest including the whole razor in the shot (this is a personal preference thing for me), it would add more of a sense of completeness. Also, I''m not the biggest fan of borders (I don''t mark these down because I score the shot, not the border). Good luck!', '2004-03-25 00:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(637150, 66405, 18927, '<td valign="top">Looks kind of cute</td>', 'Looks kind of cute', '2004-03-25 00:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(637153, 66393, 18927, '<td valign="top">Nice Picture Uncle Neil</td>', 'Nice Picture Uncle Neil', '2004-03-25 00:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(637154, 66077, 11895, '<td valign="top">needs more depth of field</td>', 'needs more depth of field', '2004-03-25 00:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(637157, 65458, 11895, '<td valign="top">perhaps a bit more contrast would improve this</td>', 'perhaps a bit more contrast would improve this', '2004-03-25 00:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(637158, 66317, 12253, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea; I like the layout.  I think a little more DOF would have been good, and perhaps a darker background to give more contrast to the PEZ.</td>', 'Interesting idea; I like the layout.  I think a little more DOF would have been good, and perhaps a darker background to give more contrast to the PEZ.', '2004-03-25 00:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(637159, 65845, 12253, '<td valign="top">Really has a nice presence to it aesthetically.  Good sharpness and contrast of foreground and bacjground.  It might have been better, if possible,  to avoid the hot areas on the left.</td>', 'Really has a nice presence to it aesthetically.  Good sharpness and contrast of foreground and bacjground.  It might have been better, if possible,  to avoid the hot areas on the left.', '2004-03-25 00:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(637160, 65399, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice high key effect!  I like the angle of presentation, and the action here as well.  And I''m pretty sure no real oranges were hurt making that drink!</td>', 'Nice high key effect!  I like the angle of presentation, and the action here as well.  And I''m pretty sure no real oranges were hurt making that drink!', '2004-03-25 00:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(637161, 65555, 12253, '<td valign="top">Lovely effect; good presentation.</td>', 'Lovely effect; good presentation.', '2004-03-25 00:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(637162, 66266, 14526, '<td valign="top">wow provocative indeed!</td>', 'wow provocative indeed!', '2004-03-25 00:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(637164, 66368, 16965, '<td valign="top">I hate to be one of those voters, but it''s not orange... and the image is too stylized (soft focused and over processed) for me to count it as a winner...sorry.</td>', 'I hate to be one of those voters, but it''s not orange... and the image is too stylized (soft focused and over processed) for me to count it as a winner...sorry.', '2004-03-25 00:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(637165, 65987, 14526, '<td valign="top">too dark for me</td>', 'too dark for me', '2004-03-25 00:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(637169, 66321, 12253, '<td valign="top">Well laid out and interesting.  Good sharpness and color, and lovely pure background.  It might be nicer if you could have somehow avoided the glare on the two red apples.   What are those other orange apples...I''ve never seen one.</td>', 'Well laid out and interesting.  Good sharpness and color, and lovely pure background.  It might be nicer if you could have somehow avoided the glare on the two red apples.   What are those other orange apples...I''ve never seen one.', '2004-03-25 00:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(637170, 65628, 14526, '<td valign="top">I wonder if greater DOF might have improved this - it''s a nice shot though</td>', 'I wonder if greater DOF might have improved this - it''s a nice shot though', '2004-03-25 00:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(637171, 66441, 18927, '<td valign="top">Cute, very cute.</td>', 'Cute, very cute.', '2004-03-25 00:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(637175, 66297, 14526, '<td valign="top">the two points of light reflected on the eyes and nose are distracting - liked the idea though</td>', 'the two points of light reflected on the eyes and nose are distracting - liked the idea though', '2004-03-25 00:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(637181, 66002, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nicely seen and captured.  I think it would be nice to try and perspective adjust this; I think it might also be stronger after that if it were cropped along the two hroizontals: the bottom of the building and the moulding just above the windws (just something to think about)</td>', 'Very nicely seen and captured.  I think it would be nice to try and perspective adjust this; I think it might also be stronger after that if it were cropped along the two hroizontals: the bottom of the building and the moulding just above the windws (just something to think about)', '2004-03-25 00:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(637182, 66173, 14526, '<td valign="top">yep! but pic could do with some element of excitement?</td>', 'yep! but pic could do with some element of excitement?', '2004-03-25 00:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(637183, 65271, 14526, '<td valign="top">beauuutiful colours, but too heavily cropped</td>', 'beauuutiful colours, but too heavily cropped', '2004-03-25 00:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(637184, 65612, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good choice of DOF.  Good composition as well, though I would think it would be stronger if the fragment of the flower on the left weren''t there.</td>', 'Nice shot, good choice of DOF.  Good composition as well, though I would think it would be stronger if the fragment of the flower on the left weren''t there.', '2004-03-25 00:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(637188, 66378, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very good idea; good extreme closeup and good perspective.  Brought an instant smile to my face.</td>', 'Very good idea; good extreme closeup and good perspective.  Brought an instant smile to my face.', '2004-03-25 00:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(637189, 66384, 16965, '<td valign="top">funny picture...but it''s not orange??????</td>', 'funny picture...but it''s not orange??????', '2004-03-25 00:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(637190, 65345, 14526, '<td valign="top">Coke?</td>', 'Coke?', '2004-03-25 00:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(637192, 66141, 12253, '<td valign="top">Clever, funny anthropomorphism.  Somehow, it would have been nice to get rid of that emblem on the monitor (in fact, to only have the monitor face and not the bezel.</td>', 'Clever, funny anthropomorphism.  Somehow, it would have been nice to get rid of that emblem on the monitor (in fact, to only have the monitor face and not the bezel.', '2004-03-25 00:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(637201, 66347, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very creative and well done.  I think it would have a stronger effect of being a real life "graphic art" if it were on a smoother background, and maybe one with a contrasting color.</td>', 'Very creative and well done.  I think it would have a stronger effect of being a real life "graphic art" if it were on a smoother background, and maybe one with a contrasting color.', '2004-03-25 00:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(637204, 66121, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, wonderful clarity and detail. Congratulations on a wonderful photo 9</td>', 'Beautiful shot, wonderful clarity and detail. Congratulations on a wonderful photo 9', '2004-03-25 00:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(637205, 66383, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is outstanding! Wonderful capture. Very vivid. Great shot.</td>', 'This is outstanding! Wonderful capture. Very vivid. Great shot.', '2004-03-25 01:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(637206, 66199, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nice scene!  I love the atmosphere on the bottom half, but the top portion, with the whiteout overpowers this.  I just simulated a crop using my window borders, and it''s really much stronger IMHO if you crop out the sky.  Also, not sure if its an illusion here, since there''s no real horizon to use, but it just looks tilted to the right somewhat.</td>', 'Very nice scene!  I love the atmosphere on the bottom half, but the top portion, with the whiteout overpowers this.  I just simulated a crop using my window borders, and it''s really much stronger IMHO if you crop out the sky.  Also, not sure if its an illusion here, since there''s no real horizon to use, but it just looks tilted to the right somewhat.', '2004-03-25 01:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(637207, 65269, 18552, '<td valign="top">What a pretty flower picture, love the focus and the lighting. I think it would be even more attractive if it weren''t so centered in the picture.</td>', 'What a pretty flower picture, love the focus and the lighting. I think it would be even more attractive if it weren''t so centered in the picture.', '2004-03-25 01:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(637209, 66343, 15342, '<td valign="top">Very nice! I''d prefer not to have the transparent end of bag in the frame, but I still give a 9 on it.</td>', 'Very nice! I''d prefer not to have the transparent end of bag in the frame, but I still give a 9 on it.', '2004-03-25 01:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(637213, 66375, 10848, '<td valign="top">Another gorgeous floral. I like the angle in which this was taken. Great attention to detail, the colors are outstanding. 10</td>', 'Another gorgeous floral. I like the angle in which this was taken. Great attention to detail, the colors are outstanding. 10', '2004-03-25 01:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(637214, 66121, 15342, '<td valign="top">Classic but beautiful. Reminds me how I hate the winter up here! :D</td>', 'Classic but beautiful. Reminds me how I hate the winter up here! :D', '2004-03-25 01:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(637215, 65455, 15342, '<td valign="top">Lacks the primary color, but a very nice shot IMO.</td>', 'Lacks the primary color, but a very nice shot IMO.', '2004-03-25 01:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(637217, 65983, 15342, '<td valign="top">Perfect! I love it. 10!</td>', 'Perfect! I love it. 10!', '2004-03-25 01:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(637220, 65344, 15342, '<td valign="top">I think it would score better if the focus was more centered in the frame.</td>', 'I think it would score better if the focus was more centered in the frame.', '2004-03-25 01:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(637223, 65468, 15342, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I dont like color replacements, sorry.</td>', 'Nice, but I dont like color replacements, sorry.', '2004-03-25 01:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(637224, 66399, 15342, '<td valign="top">The orange crayon tip is unfortunately shorter than the other ones and the whole crayon is wider, which makes it too different IMO. <br/> <br/>There is maybe a bit too much sharpness.</td>', 'The orange crayon tip is unfortunately shorter than the other ones and the whole crayon is wider, which makes it too different IMO.  There is maybe a bit too much sharpness.', '2004-03-25 01:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(637226, 65152, 15342, '<td valign="top">Definetly meets the challenge! No questions on that! :)<br/> <br/>Maybe a more contrasting background would have been prettier. A very light orange would have been much nicer IMO.</td>', 'Definetly meets the challenge! No questions on that! :) Maybe a more contrasting background would have been prettier. A very light orange would have been much nicer IMO.', '2004-03-25 01:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(637227, 66137, 18386, '<td valign="top">strong composition, excellent gradation of colors against neutral background. Very good!</td>', 'strong composition, excellent gradation of colors against neutral background. Very good!', '2004-03-25 01:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(637228, 66147, 15342, '<td valign="top">Look like a brush, not concave or convex!<br/> <br/>I like it though. 7</td>', 'Look like a brush, not concave or convex! I like it though. 7', '2004-03-25 01:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(637230, 65798, 15342, '<td valign="top">Great composition, original.</td>', 'Great composition, original.', '2004-03-25 01:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(637231, 66136, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very clever idea for an orange picture! If the focus were sharper it would be even better, I think.</td>', 'Very clever idea for an orange picture! If the focus were sharper it would be even better, I think.', '2004-03-25 01:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(637235, 65528, 15342, '<td valign="top">Very nice but I don''t like the toohbrush..</td>', 'Very nice but I don''t like the toohbrush..', '2004-03-25 01:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(637237, 65969, 15342, '<td valign="top">Too much blur.</td>', 'Too much blur.', '2004-03-25 01:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(637241, 66035, 18552, '<td valign="top">Really a pretty, colorful picture. I think it might be even nicer if the flowers were more in focus instead of the background. The hill is in better focus than the flowers and detracts from them.</td>', 'Really a pretty, colorful picture. I think it might be even nicer if the flowers were more in focus instead of the background. The hill is in better focus than the flowers and detracts from them.', '2004-03-25 01:34:08.000000', NULL, 1);
