(637323, 65991, 16004, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I''m just one of a bandwagon here, but this would be great for the motion blur challenge.  And unfortunately, I''m not really certain if a red jacket, a couple of orange carrier bags and a bit of orangey blur in a window conveys enough onus on the orange part of this challenge.  Also, the image might have been improved if you were a bit more severe in the cropping (get rid of the roof of the station) and a bit of a zoom in on your central person.  Still, even though I personally think it doesn''t quite fulfill the spirit of the challenge, I think that you should at least be rewarded for impeccable timing, and for what I think is a fairly funky shot.  6.</td>', 'I''m sure I''m just one of a bandwagon here, but this would be great for the motion blur challenge.  And unfortunately, I''m not really certain if a red jacket, a couple of orange carrier bags and a bit of orangey blur in a window conveys enough onus on the orange part of this challenge.  Also, the image might have been improved if you were a bit more severe in the cropping (get rid of the roof of the station) and a bit of a zoom in on your central person.  Still, even though I personally think it doesn''t quite fulfill the spirit of the challenge, I think that you should at least be rewarded for impeccable timing, and for what I think is a fairly funky shot.  6.', '2004-03-25 03:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(637325, 65126, 16004, '<td valign="top">I never did like the targa that much - much prefer the normal version...  anywoo, that will not be influencing my voting because I still think this is a really good picture, and you''ve chosen the best bit of any 911 - the rear wheel arch.  The light really works for his picture, showing off all the curves nicely.  It''s a bit regrettable the green car is reflected in the shot, but other than calling a tow truck, I guess that''s something unavoidable (shame only basic editting was allowed).  However, it certainly is ornage (a very nice retro one at that) so I don''t think i''m unreasonable giving an 8.</td>', 'I never did like the targa that much - much prefer the normal version...  anywoo, that will not be influencing my voting because I still think this is a really good picture, and you''ve chosen the best bit of any 911 - the rear wheel arch.  The light really works for his picture, showing off all the curves nicely.  It''s a bit regrettable the green car is reflected in the shot, but other than calling a tow truck, I guess that''s something unavoidable (shame only basic editting was allowed).  However, it certainly is ornage (a very nice retro one at that) so I don''t think i''m unreasonable giving an 8.', '2004-03-25 03:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(637326, 65570, 10702, '<td valign="top">hehe, nice fake.<br/></td>', 'hehe, nice fake.', '2004-03-25 03:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
