(637329, 65762, 16004, '<td valign="top">Tis a very nice sky, and yes, there is definitely some orange in there.  The clouds are a bit unusual too, and adds something different that most sunrise shots seem to lack.  It''s a bit of a pity that the landscape doesn''t do much, but for this challenge it''s enough that the focal point is the sky itself (afterall orange is the prime objective here).  So, I think, 7.</td>', 'Tis a very nice sky, and yes, there is definitely some orange in there.  The clouds are a bit unusual too, and adds something different that most sunrise shots seem to lack.  It''s a bit of a pity that the landscape doesn''t do much, but for this challenge it''s enough that the focal point is the sky itself (afterall orange is the prime objective here).  So, I think, 7.', '2004-03-25 03:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(637331, 65694, 16004, '<td valign="top">Messy!  Wipe that chin!  It''s a nice action shot, and hopefully it will do well.  The bottle is a little lacking in focus, but I guess that''s the payoff in acheiving a picture like this.  I actually like it, quite original.  8.</td>', 'Messy!  Wipe that chin!  It''s a nice action shot, and hopefully it will do well.  The bottle is a little lacking in focus, but I guess that''s the payoff in acheiving a picture like this.  I actually like it, quite original.  8.', '2004-03-25 04:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(637332, 66298, 16004, '<td valign="top">I would like this more, or at least find it have a greater impact, if the image was larger.  Don''t know if you did try this already, but you could zoom in a bit and get rid of the additional noise by using freeware such as NeatImage.</td>', 'I would like this more, or at least find it have a greater impact, if the image was larger.  Don''t know if you did try this already, but you could zoom in a bit and get rid of the additional noise by using freeware such as NeatImage.', '2004-03-25 04:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
