(637334, 65200, 16004, '<td valign="top">I might be insane, but I think this is one of the few flower shots where the flower is actually (aghast!) orange!  Well done you for not being colour blind!  It''s a super shot, brilliant composition and wow, I can''t see the stalk.  Totally gorgeous.  I love how the flower fills the shot just right.  Nothing wrong with this at all.  10.</td>', 'I might be insane, but I think this is one of the few flower shots where the flower is actually (aghast!) orange!  Well done you for not being colour blind!  It''s a super shot, brilliant composition and wow, I can''t see the stalk.  Totally gorgeous.  I love how the flower fills the shot just right.  Nothing wrong with this at all.  10.', '2004-03-25 04:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
