(637539, 66036, 17191, '<td valign="top">I really love photos like this (I tried one similar with pasta for Textures II) lovely colour and reflection.</td>', 'I really love photos like this (I tried one similar with pasta for Textures II) lovely colour and reflection.', '2004-03-25 07:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
