(637543, 65437, 4285, '<td valign="top">Yeah they are ugly. The composition is so-so; ''filling the frame'' is one way to make it more interesting maybe. You have colour cast in the shot which can be taken out using Levels in Photoshop(or other editting software). Softer/diffuse/indirect light would have caused less glare on your subject. Oh yeah, one other thing.....your subject was specifically mentioned in challenge outline has one of the items not to shoot. Sorry. 1</td>', 'Yeah they are ugly. The composition is so-so; ''filling the frame'' is one way to make it more interesting maybe. You have colour cast in the shot which can be taken out using Levels in Photoshop(or other editting software). Softer/diffuse/indirect light would have caused less glare on your subject. Oh yeah, one other thing.....your subject was specifically mentioned in challenge outline has one of the items not to shoot. Sorry. 1', '2004-03-25 07:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(637544, 66175, 17191, '<td valign="top">This is ideal especially with the white fish in the middle of them all.</td>', 'This is ideal especially with the white fish in the middle of them all.', '2004-03-25 07:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
