(637557, 65272, 17191, '<td valign="top">This is a really special photo. I absolutely adore it. The coulors and the way the dress stands out.</td>', 'This is a really special photo. I absolutely adore it. The coulors and the way the dress stands out.', '2004-03-25 07:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
