(637647, 66196, 4285, '<td valign="top">Nice clean image. Hard to make a phone interesting. Maybe if it were shot from a different angle. Or a tighter crop to show the Orange logo lettering more clearly. Certainly would make a good product or stock shot as is.</td>', 'Nice clean image. Hard to make a phone interesting. Maybe if it were shot from a different angle. Or a tighter crop to show the Orange logo lettering more clearly. Certainly would make a good product or stock shot as is.', '2004-03-25 09:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(637651, 66126, 9906, '<td valign="top">This shot appears to be crooked.  This is an easy fix in PhotoShop.  PM me if ya want instructions.  I understand what you are trying to do for the challenge, but this is also very flat due to the lighting available.  Taking this from a different angle or at a different time of day to pull out the marvelous cityscape textures would make it a better shot, but would probably make it not meet this challenge.<br/>TC</td>', 'This shot appears to be crooked.  This is an easy fix in PhotoShop.  PM me if ya want instructions.  I understand what you are trying to do for the challenge, but this is also very flat due to the lighting available.  Taking this from a different angle or at a different time of day to pull out the marvelous cityscape textures would make it a better shot, but would probably make it not meet this challenge.TC', '2004-03-25 09:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(637652, 66297, 4285, '<td valign="top">Good use of DOF. Head turned slightly one way or another could have been more interesting. Looks like it may have been slightly over processed by looking at the left side of the picture.</td>', 'Good use of DOF. Head turned slightly one way or another could have been more interesting. Looks like it may have been slightly over processed by looking at the left side of the picture.', '2004-03-25 09:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(637653, 65393, 9906, '<td valign="top">I used to be able to do this, but now can only do 2/3s of it.  I can''t get the damn bottom row right.  Oh well...<br/>TC</td>', 'I used to be able to do this, but now can only do 2/3s of it.  I can''t get the damn bottom row right.  Oh well...TC', '2004-03-25 09:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(637656, 66180, 4285, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. Beautiful colour saturation makes the different shades of orange pop out. Simple composition is also great.</td>', 'I love this shot. Beautiful colour saturation makes the different shades of orange pop out. Simple composition is also great.', '2004-03-25 09:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(637657, 66280, 9906, '<td valign="top">I think that this shot is a little busy with the colored background.  A single color background would make your oranges jump out more.  This also seems to me to be a little soft in focus.  This makes it look blurry with all the elements here.  A soft focus effect would probably have more impact with the solid background too with these warm orange tones.<br/>TC</td>', 'I think that this shot is a little busy with the colored background.  A single color background would make your oranges jump out more.  This also seems to me to be a little soft in focus.  This makes it look blurry with all the elements here.  A soft focus effect would probably have more impact with the solid background too with these warm orange tones.TC', '2004-03-25 09:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(637659, 66168, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice compositon.  Did you use selective desaturating?  Or is the area really monochromatic in design?<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice compositon.  Did you use selective desaturating?  Or is the area really monochromatic in design?TC', '2004-03-25 09:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
