(637662, 65644, 4285, '<td valign="top">A lot of people here aren''t fond of symetry in photographs but I think in this case it adds to the beauty of the shot. I love the rich tone of the shot and the soft shadows as well.</td>', 'A lot of people here aren''t fond of symetry in photographs but I think in this case it adds to the beauty of the shot. I love the rich tone of the shot and the soft shadows as well.', '2004-03-25 09:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
