(637680, 66283, 4380, '<td valign="top">after viewing almost 400 entries here...THIS IS MY ONLY BET, the entries are dissapointing and less than 5 (its my opinion only) came out with a rating ofl very good. I do like this image because of its simplicity, composition is okay, the curves is the thing that made this image standout. And believe me, you will receive a comments that some part of your image is out of focus, well, i guess you''ll ignore it.  GREAT IMAGE...I''ll give this a perfect score.  I stop joining the challenge here, what im doing right now is just visit the site and vote 1 pix that i think will win a ribbon...Good Luck to your submission, all the best. Here''s the "10"</td>', 'after viewing almost 400 entries here...THIS IS MY ONLY BET, the entries are dissapointing and less than 5 (its my opinion only) came out with a rating ofl very good. I do like this image because of its simplicity, composition is okay, the curves is the thing that made this image standout. And believe me, you will receive a comments that some part of your image is out of focus, well, i guess you''ll ignore it.  GREAT IMAGE...I''ll give this a perfect score.  I stop joining the challenge here, what im doing right now is just visit the site and vote 1 pix that i think will win a ribbon...Good Luck to your submission, all the best. Here''s the "10"', '2004-03-25 09:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
