(637808, 66074, 16402, '<td valign="top">Nice use of DOF, but lighting is just a bit too harsh for me. Think I''d have gone just a little softer.</td>', 'Nice use of DOF, but lighting is just a bit too harsh for me. Think I''d have gone just a little softer.', '2004-03-25 10:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(637811, 65637, 16402, '<td valign="top">Really nice try, but ... because of DOF the emphasis is on the white not the orange. Adjusting the DOF to be on the orange but not the white probably wouldn''t have worked, just made it look weird. My only suggestion would be to extend DOF so it''s all in focus but that might have made it look too commercial. Black background was a good choice though.</td>', 'Really nice try, but ... because of DOF the emphasis is on the white not the orange. Adjusting the DOF to be on the orange but not the white probably wouldn''t have worked, just made it look weird. My only suggestion would be to extend DOF so it''s all in focus but that might have made it look too commercial. Black background was a good choice though.', '2004-03-25 10:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
