(637826, 65273, 4285, '<td valign="top">Image seems noisy but maybe that was intentional. I think a cleaner image with a little more saturation would have worked better. The bright spot (reflection of the sun I assume) is very distracting. Taken from a different angle or a different time in the day would have worked better. The abstract nature of the composition is interesting; it makes you work to figure out how the image was captured - that''s a good quality.</td>', 'Image seems noisy but maybe that was intentional. I think a cleaner image with a little more saturation would have worked better. The bright spot (reflection of the sun I assume) is very distracting. Taken from a different angle or a different time in the day would have worked better. The abstract nature of the composition is interesting; it makes you work to figure out how the image was captured - that''s a good quality.', '2004-03-25 10:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(637827, 65798, 16402, '<td valign="top">Really nice use of contrasting colors.</td>', 'Really nice use of contrasting colors.', '2004-03-25 11:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
