(637843, 65987, 327, '<td valign="top">I think the idea was good for this entry. The light was not. Your colors look dull, and the image seems flat. Good luck.</td>', 'I think the idea was good for this entry. The light was not. Your colors look dull, and the image seems flat. Good luck.', '2004-03-25 11:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(637844, 65544, 18856, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t buy that carrots. Or maybe the snail is for sale ? ;-)</td>', 'I wouldn''t buy that carrots. Or maybe the snail is for sale ? ;-)', '2004-03-25 11:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(637846, 66200, 4285, '<td valign="top">Your focus is soft where the eye is drawn, which in this case is the center of the main flower. This detracts from the image. You could have done one of two compositionally to make this better: 1. set you focus on the center of the flower 2. Recompose/crop so that the "in focus" petals are in the center of the shot.</td>', 'Your focus is soft where the eye is drawn, which in this case is the center of the main flower. This detracts from the image. You could have done one of two compositionally to make this better: 1. set you focus on the center of the flower 2. Recompose/crop so that the "in focus" petals are in the center of the shot.', '2004-03-25 11:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(637848, 66343, 16402, '<td valign="top">I really like this idea and most of the implementation, but ... have the zipper edge (corner) of the bag in the shot bothers me. Seems like a 90 degree turn of the back would have allowed you to use two clean corners.</td>', 'I really like this idea and most of the implementation, but ... have the zipper edge (corner) of the bag in the shot bothers me. Seems like a 90 degree turn of the back would have allowed you to use two clean corners.', '2004-03-25 11:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(637850, 66258, 16402, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit underexposed to me.</td>', 'Seems a bit underexposed to me.', '2004-03-25 11:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(637852, 65458, 327, '<td valign="top">You need to add some saturation or contrast in your post processing. This looks very washed out. Neat entry.</td>', 'You need to add some saturation or contrast in your post processing. This looks very washed out. Neat entry.', '2004-03-25 11:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(637857, 66435, 18073, '<td valign="top">I really like the image, it is very dramatic.  The only problem  IMO is that the water looks to be on a slope, although I think that it is just the shadows are sloping and the horizon is indeed flat, its a litle distracting.  Nice image all the same 7/10</td>', 'I really like the image, it is very dramatic.  The only problem  IMO is that the water looks to be on a slope, although I think that it is just the shadows are sloping and the horizon is indeed flat, its a litle distracting.  Nice image all the same 7/10', '2004-03-25 11:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(637859, 65733, 18073, '<td valign="top">Nice vibrant image, and I like how you have really filled the frame, good detail too!</td>', 'Nice vibrant image, and I like how you have really filled the frame, good detail too!', '2004-03-25 11:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(637860, 65895, 16402, '<td valign="top">While it''s certainly not a shade of orange that I like, it is a great photo considering composition, exposure, everything. I especially like the hint of orange towards top from the Indian Blankets.</td>', 'While it''s certainly not a shade of orange that I like, it is a great photo considering composition, exposure, everything. I especially like the hint of orange towards top from the Indian Blankets.', '2004-03-25 11:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(637862, 66410, 18073, '<td valign="top">I find this image a little bit on the dull side, I feel the colours need to be really vibrant for this kind of image to work.  5/10</td>', 'I find this image a little bit on the dull side, I feel the colours need to be really vibrant for this kind of image to work.  5/10', '2004-03-25 11:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
