(637864, 66175, 18073, '<td valign="top">There was quite a lot of potential for this image, I think the composition could have been tweaked a little, I think the white fish would have been better more off centre.  4/10</td>', 'There was quite a lot of potential for this image, I think the composition could have been tweaked a little, I think the white fish would have been better more off centre.  4/10', '2004-03-25 11:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(637868, 65565, 4285, '<td valign="top">I think this would have worked better if the orange was a little more vivid, maybe by saturating more or playing with levels (using the white point and black point eye droppers you can remove some of the colour cast and make it more vivid, also USM 125%, radius 0.3, threshold 1 - I tried it - makes the image 100% better) Contact me after the challenge and I''ll send the editted copy if you like.</td>', 'I think this would have worked better if the orange was a little more vivid, maybe by saturating more or playing with levels (using the white point and black point eye droppers you can remove some of the colour cast and make it more vivid, also USM 125%, radius 0.3, threshold 1 - I tried it - makes the image 100% better) Contact me after the challenge and I''ll send the editted copy if you like.', '2004-03-25 11:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
