(637951, 65257, 4285, '<td valign="top">Well it falls witin the range of colours listed in the challenge outline so I can''t fault you for that but I bet others will. Interesting composition but I think it would have been moreso if you had used a shallower DOF to emphasize the sign. Then again not everyone can do that in this type of situation - depends on your equipment to a certain degree I guess.</td>', 'Well it falls witin the range of colours listed in the challenge outline so I can''t fault you for that but I bet others will. Interesting composition but I think it would have been moreso if you had used a shallower DOF to emphasize the sign. Then again not everyone can do that in this type of situation - depends on your equipment to a certain degree I guess.', '2004-03-25 12:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
