(637995, 66073, 14986, '<td valign="top">I just didn''t understand this photo at all.  Lot''s of orangish tint,  but the composition and the subject are totally lost on me.  Sorry.  i didn''t score,  just comment.</td>', 'I just didn''t understand this photo at all.  Lot''s of orangish tint,  but the composition and the subject are totally lost on me.  Sorry.  i didn''t score,  just comment.', '2004-03-25 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(637998, 66378, 14986, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems dim to me in this shot.   I think that the composition just isn''t attractive.  Maybe it would have been better not so close up?</td>', 'Lighting seems dim to me in this shot.   I think that the composition just isn''t attractive.  Maybe it would have been better not so close up?', '2004-03-25 12:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(637999, 65472, 14986, '<td valign="top">Cool abstract.  Is it a flower?</td>', 'Cool abstract.  Is it a flower?', '2004-03-25 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(638000, 65349, 14986, '<td valign="top">Fun way to get the color.  I''ve just never really cared for this effect, but I think it''s done well here.   Personally, I would like it better without the water drops.</td>', 'Fun way to get the color.  I''ve just never really cared for this effect, but I think it''s done well here.   Personally, I would like it better without the water drops.', '2004-03-25 12:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(638003, 65272, 17296, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I love this photo. I''m torn as to whether or not I like the motion blur on her arm and leg. Just beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful. I love this photo. I''m torn as to whether or not I like the motion blur on her arm and leg. Just beautiful.', '2004-03-25 12:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(638005, 66342, 11895, '<td valign="top">I suppose that''s a normal background too</td>', 'I suppose that''s a normal background too', '2004-03-25 12:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(638009, 65624, 16126, '<td valign="top">Desaturating the greens and blues would have made this even more powerful</td>', 'Desaturating the greens and blues would have made this even more powerful', '2004-03-25 12:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(638012, 66280, 17296, '<td valign="top">A couple of problems with this image:<br/>1. The image is a bit too blurry (although I realize this could be an equipment limitiation issue) Maybe try using a tripod or better lighting and a faster shutter speed.<br/>2. The positioning of the subject lends itself to an uncomfortable depth of field issue with the flower in the vase. Perhaps standing the drawing up and using it as a backdrop would have been better. It also would have helped you avoid the harsh shadow of the vase.<br/>Just a few suggestions. :)</td>', 'A couple of problems with this image:1. The image is a bit too blurry (although I realize this could be an equipment limitiation issue) Maybe try using a tripod or better lighting and a faster shutter speed.2. The positioning of the subject lends itself to an uncomfortable depth of field issue with the flower in the vase. Perhaps standing the drawing up and using it as a backdrop would have been better. It also would have helped you avoid the harsh shadow of the vase.Just a few suggestions. :)', '2004-03-25 12:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(638014, 65649, 14986, '<td valign="top">Well, this one will score really low from me so I''ll comment on why.  First of all, and most importantly, the rules specifically state to NOT shoot an orange or anything like the orange fruit.   I don''t know if it was intentioinal, but the focus is way out.  Why is there so much space at the bottom of the photo?  I think the composition might have been okay if you raised the camera angle to include more of the fruit.  I also think the way the lighting highlights the table and the blown out portion of the orange detracts from the shot.    I would have preferred a little less light on the right (the highlight is okay, it''s just too bright and loses the detail), and more light on the left side to bring out the orange color and the detail of the fruit.  I hope this is helpful!</td>', 'Well, this one will score really low from me so I''ll comment on why.  First of all, and most importantly, the rules specifically state to NOT shoot an orange or anything like the orange fruit.   I don''t know if it was intentioinal, but the focus is way out.  Why is there so much space at the bottom of the photo?  I think the composition might have been okay if you raised the camera angle to include more of the fruit.  I also think the way the lighting highlights the table and the blown out portion of the orange detracts from the shot.    I would have preferred a little less light on the right (the highlight is okay, it''s just too bright and loses the detail), and more light on the left side to bring out the orange color and the detail of the fruit.  I hope this is helpful!', '2004-03-25 12:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(638017, 66195, 14986, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the title, but I like the orange cloud.  I love sky photos.  I would prefer this one without the trees on the horizon....I would have preferred a cropping just above the blue portion of the sky.</td>', 'Not sure about the title, but I like the orange cloud.  I love sky photos.  I would prefer this one without the trees on the horizon....I would have preferred a cropping just above the blue portion of the sky.', '2004-03-25 12:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(638019, 65152, 17296, '<td valign="top">It appears to me as if this image was made orange in an editing program, but I cannot be sure so I''m raising the score I gave you. I am scoring submissions higher that worked to find orange objects instead of turning them orange. <br/>I do like the texture in this photo. I would suggest ironing the towel in the background the wrinkles are distracting.</td>', 'It appears to me as if this image was made orange in an editing program, but I cannot be sure so I''m raising the score I gave you. I am scoring submissions higher that worked to find orange objects instead of turning them orange. I do like the texture in this photo. I would suggest ironing the towel in the background the wrinkles are distracting.', '2004-03-25 12:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(638020, 66061, 14986, '<td valign="top">This one appears more red than orange to me, but I always give the benefit of the doubt  :)         I do like the composition and the lighting, but the subject just doesn''t hold my interest.</td>', 'This one appears more red than orange to me, but I always give the benefit of the doubt  :)         I do like the composition and the lighting, but the subject just doesn''t hold my interest.', '2004-03-25 12:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(638022, 66432, 14986, '<td valign="top">Great orange color.  I would have liked the focus on the front flower a little sharper.  I think this border also detracts from your nice photo. I like the composition and the lighting here.</td>', 'Great orange color.  I would have liked the focus on the front flower a little sharper.  I think this border also detracts from your nice photo. I like the composition and the lighting here.', '2004-03-25 12:43:39.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(638025, 66163, 17296, '<td valign="top">NIce clarity, but the curtain is distracting. I would also like to see all of him/her.</td>', 'NIce clarity, but the curtain is distracting. I would also like to see all of him/her.', '2004-03-25 12:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(638026, 66060, 14986, '<td valign="top">I like the way you have this on ice.  I find that large reflection to be distracting.</td>', 'I like the way you have this on ice.  I find that large reflection to be distracting.', '2004-03-25 12:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(638027, 65455, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot, and I wish it had more of the element of orange in it.  I really like the DOF, the composition, the light and the clarity of it, so it still gets a good score from me.</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot, and I wish it had more of the element of orange in it.  I really like the DOF, the composition, the light and the clarity of it, so it still gets a good score from me.', '2004-03-25 12:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(638031, 65292, 14986, '<td valign="top">Nice catch for the challenge.  I would like it better with it cropped just above the wiper blades.  Too bad about the crunch on the right side...especially if it''s yours!</td>', 'Nice catch for the challenge.  I would like it better with it cropped just above the wiper blades.  Too bad about the crunch on the right side...especially if it''s yours!', '2004-03-25 12:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(638033, 66442, 14986, '<td valign="top">It says orange, but it sure looks red to me.  As long as it''s close,  I don''t score down for the color though.   Nice clear shot.  It doesn''t really hold my attention, though.</td>', 'It says orange, but it sure looks red to me.  As long as it''s close,  I don''t score down for the color though.   Nice clear shot.  It doesn''t really hold my attention, though.', '2004-03-25 12:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(638034, 65631, 16402, '<td valign="top">Lighting is way to harsh for me.</td>', 'Lighting is way to harsh for me.', '2004-03-25 12:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(638036, 65752, 14986, '<td valign="top">Fun take on the challenge.  I would have like a different composition for it.  I think the idea is imaginative, but the set up isn''t.  Lighting and colors seem fine to me.</td>', 'Fun take on the challenge.  I would have like a different composition for it.  I think the idea is imaginative, but the set up isn''t.  Lighting and colors seem fine to me.', '2004-03-25 12:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(638039, 65813, 14986, '<td valign="top">I like the "chance meeting" effect of this shot.</td>', 'I like the "chance meeting" effect of this shot.', '2004-03-25 12:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(638042, 66280, 14986, '<td valign="top">I think the shapes and colors here could be a cool abstract, arty looking photo.   For me, the large plastic flower being out of focus hurts the photo a lot.  I would like to see all of this in crisp focus and the lighting a bit brighter to make the colors "pop" more.</td>', 'I think the shapes and colors here could be a cool abstract, arty looking photo.   For me, the large plastic flower being out of focus hurts the photo a lot.  I would like to see all of this in crisp focus and the lighting a bit brighter to make the colors "pop" more.', '2004-03-25 12:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(638043, 65667, 14130, '<td valign="top">I nice photo...but not so much orange!</td>', 'I nice photo...but not so much orange!', '2004-03-25 12:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(638044, 66375, 14130, '<td valign="top">WOW, a really nice macro!</td>', 'WOW, a really nice macro!', '2004-03-25 12:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(638045, 66131, 14986, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been a great simple shape shot.  I would prefer it straightened and with the whole bottom plate showing.   The lighting at the top seems to bright to me and it also appears a bit grainy.  Neat choice for the orange challenge, though.  I like it.</td>', 'I think this could have been a great simple shape shot.  I would prefer it straightened and with the whole bottom plate showing.   The lighting at the top seems to bright to me and it also appears a bit grainy.  Neat choice for the orange challenge, though.  I like it.', '2004-03-25 12:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(638046, 65280, 17296, '<td valign="top">I am glad you didn''t use an orange. Did you mean for the end of the banana to be the focal point for the entire photo? ''Cause that''s what you ended up with... The composition isn''t too bad, but I don''t care for the orange scribbles.</td>', 'I am glad you didn''t use an orange. Did you mean for the end of the banana to be the focal point for the entire photo? ''Cause that''s what you ended up with... The composition isn''t too bad, but I don''t care for the orange scribbles.', '2004-03-25 12:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(638053, 65570, 16488, '<td valign="top">Just another orange sunset...or not.  The creative use of props made this stand out to me.  There were so many sunset entries in this challenge that it took what you did to make me do a double take--to want to spend time with this image.  Thanks for sharing your humor.</td>', 'Just another orange sunset...or not.  The creative use of props made this stand out to me.  There were so many sunset entries in this challenge that it took what you did to make me do a double take--to want to spend time with this image.  Thanks for sharing your humor.', '2004-03-25 13:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(638057, 66137, 14130, '<td valign="top">Nice idea!</td>', 'Nice idea!', '2004-03-25 13:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(638059, 66376, 15029, '<td valign="top">it''s not orange. sorry.</td>', 'it''s not orange. sorry.', '2004-03-25 13:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
