(638096, 66188, 14614, '<td valign="top">the portion of the face pulls my eye away from the orange element -- I''d suggest you crop a bit tighter.  Good background against the can.  Seems a bit out of focus</td>', 'the portion of the face pulls my eye away from the orange element -- I''d suggest you crop a bit tighter.  Good background against the can.  Seems a bit out of focus', '2004-03-25 13:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(638098, 65800, 14614, '<td valign="top">excellent abstract.  I find it a bit  too close to the yellow side of orange</td>', 'excellent abstract.  I find it a bit  too close to the yellow side of orange', '2004-03-25 13:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(638101, 65560, 3524, '<td valign="top">Heheh, I hate when that happens. Nice idea. The orange on the purple and ivory tablecloth is a good color choice. But the photo comes across more like a snapshot to me. I think trying to get a sharper focus would be one thing that would help. Another thing might be trying some different angles or arrangements of the utensils so that it''s less of a documentary shot and has a little more drama (arg, I hate drama, but in a photo I think it''s fun). Maybe a lower angle where you''re beginning to peer into the bowl and the fly carcass is just in view over the rim and the spoon is angled so it leads your eye to the fly, or something like that. Just a thought. Thanks for the chuckle and momentary grossout :)</td>', 'Heheh, I hate when that happens. Nice idea. The orange on the purple and ivory tablecloth is a good color choice. But the photo comes across more like a snapshot to me. I think trying to get a sharper focus would be one thing that would help. Another thing might be trying some different angles or arrangements of the utensils so that it''s less of a documentary shot and has a little more drama (arg, I hate drama, but in a photo I think it''s fun). Maybe a lower angle where you''re beginning to peer into the bowl and the fly carcass is just in view over the rim and the spoon is angled so it leads your eye to the fly, or something like that. Just a thought. Thanks for the chuckle and momentary grossout :)', '2004-03-25 13:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(638102, 66428, 14614, '<td valign="top">A creative use of this cards!.  Not sure but I think I''d like it a bit more without the writing on the top one.</td>', 'A creative use of this cards!.  Not sure but I think I''d like it a bit more without the writing on the top one.', '2004-03-25 13:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(638105, 66360, 14614, '<td valign="top">very creative -- seems the hands should be messier ;) -- first orange border that works!  I think I''d like to see the paint fill the frame a bit more</td>', 'very creative -- seems the hands should be messier ;) -- first orange border that works!  I think I''d like to see the paint fill the frame a bit more', '2004-03-25 13:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(638112, 65987, 14614, '<td valign="top">could use a bit more light == creative idea that has an abstract feel</td>', 'could use a bit more light == creative idea that has an abstract feel', '2004-03-25 13:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(638132, 66095, 14614, '<td valign="top">I like your composition.  The border''s a bit overpowering for the shot (IMHO, of course)</td>', 'I like your composition.  The border''s a bit overpowering for the shot (IMHO, of course)', '2004-03-25 13:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(638143, 65454, 14614, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the color lesson on complimentary colors (although in that case the shadow should be blue!)  Creative take on the theme, well set up.</td>', 'Reminds me of the color lesson on complimentary colors (although in that case the shadow should be blue!)  Creative take on the theme, well set up.', '2004-03-25 13:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(638160, 66403, 14614, '<td valign="top">really like your photo - you have an eye for creating a pleasing composition (can''t say the same for your border - too wide and the color drains life from your shot vs. a darker color that helps the colors pop)</td>', 'really like your photo - you have an eye for creating a pleasing composition (can''t say the same for your border - too wide and the color drains life from your shot vs. a darker color that helps the colors pop)', '2004-03-25 14:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(638171, 65357, 18073, '<td valign="top">The focus of the image is the hockey player, and so would benifit with a much tighter crop, but then you would lose your orange colour of course!</td>', 'The focus of the image is the hockey player, and so would benifit with a much tighter crop, but then you would lose your orange colour of course!', '2004-03-25 14:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(638173, 65962, 18073, '<td valign="top">Nice colour but it seems a little out of focus to me.</td>', 'Nice colour but it seems a little out of focus to me.', '2004-03-25 14:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(638177, 66246, 18552, '<td valign="top">Your picture is really nice, beautiful color, well composed and great focus. I think if you would have ironed the drape used in the background it would have made it better. For some reason when I look at it my eye realy notices the wrinkles in the drape.</td>', 'Your picture is really nice, beautiful color, well composed and great focus. I think if you would have ironed the drape used in the background it would have made it better. For some reason when I look at it my eye realy notices the wrinkles in the drape.', '2004-03-25 14:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(638179, 66429, 12253, '<td valign="top">I predict this will win the challenge.  Congratulations in advance.  Well done.</td>', 'I predict this will win the challenge.  Congratulations in advance.  Well done.', '2004-03-25 14:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(638181, 65895, 18073, '<td valign="top">Love the image, but I am not so sure I would class the hydrant as ''orange''.  5/10 (7/10 if the hydrant was more orange)</td>', 'Love the image, but I am not so sure I would class the hydrant as ''orange''.  5/10 (7/10 if the hydrant was more orange)', '2004-03-25 14:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(638182, 65768, 12253, '<td valign="top">Well done! Great abstract; the color and hues are wonderful.  One of my top pics.</td>', 'Well done! Great abstract; the color and hues are wonderful.  One of my top pics.', '2004-03-25 14:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(638183, 66393, 18073, '<td valign="top">Fab image, love how monochrome this image looks, the orange really leaps out of the image.  Good job!  8/10</td>', 'Fab image, love how monochrome this image looks, the orange really leaps out of the image.  Good job!  8/10', '2004-03-25 14:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(638184, 66060, 16402, '<td valign="top">Highlight might be a bit bright but excellent job.</td>', 'Highlight might be a bit bright but excellent job.', '2004-03-25 14:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(638185, 66121, 18073, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  Nice exposure and amazing detail.  7/10</td>', 'Beautiful image.  Nice exposure and amazing detail.  7/10', '2004-03-25 14:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(638187, 65471, 16402, '<td valign="top">Boy I''d like to see more of the pepper.</td>', 'Boy I''d like to see more of the pepper.', '2004-03-25 14:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(638189, 65554, 18073, '<td valign="top">Nice image, I think this image could do with even brighter, more saturated colour.</td>', 'Nice image, I think this image could do with even brighter, more saturated colour.', '2004-03-25 14:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(638190, 65649, 12253, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, these look like oranges, which were not allowed in the challenge.  Other than perhaps an intentional try to score low, I am not sure what you were going for with the out-of-focus and high jpeg artifacts (too much jpeg compression produces artifacts)</td>', 'Unfortunately, these look like oranges, which were not allowed in the challenge.  Other than perhaps an intentional try to score low, I am not sure what you were going for with the out-of-focus and high jpeg artifacts (too much jpeg compression produces artifacts)', '2004-03-25 14:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(638192, 65400, 18073, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, nice detail and I like the dark areas of the image too.....this would make a nice B&amp;W image too I think.</td>', 'Beautiful, nice detail and I like the dark areas of the image too.....this would make a nice B&W image too I think.', '2004-03-25 14:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(638193, 66314, 18073, '<td valign="top">I really do like this image, nice composition and the blooms really stand out due to your well chosen DOF.  7/10</td>', 'I really do like this image, nice composition and the blooms really stand out due to your well chosen DOF.  7/10', '2004-03-25 14:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(638194, 65967, 12253, '<td valign="top">Not sure what you were going for here, just looks like a negative to me.<br/> <br/>My advice is that most of the time, very "manipulated" images like this won''t do well in a competition.  The image might have been ok in normal format, though it looks like it might need ome perspective correction per the tower.</td>', 'Not sure what you were going for here, just looks like a negative to me. My advice is that most of the time, very "manipulated" images like this won''t do well in a competition.  The image might have been ok in normal format, though it looks like it might need ome perspective correction per the tower.', '2004-03-25 14:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(638196, 66168, 18073, '<td valign="top">Love how vivid the orange looks against the dull grey walls and dark floor.  Almost looks like partys of the image have been desaturated. 7/10</td>', 'Love how vivid the orange looks against the dull grey walls and dark floor.  Almost looks like partys of the image have been desaturated. 7/10', '2004-03-25 14:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(638197, 66006, 18073, '<td valign="top">Think the image would benifit from a tighter crop</td>', 'Think the image would benifit from a tighter crop', '2004-03-25 14:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
