(638543, 66387, 17505, '<td valign="top">You need a little more depth of field. It feels odd to look at a picture that has unfocused things infront of the main subject. If you had focused on the front buds, or captured all of them in focus this would be a much straonger picture. What you do have in focus is very nice, there''s just too little of it.</td>', 'You need a little more depth of field. It feels odd to look at a picture that has unfocused things infront of the main subject. If you had focused on the front buds, or captured all of them in focus this would be a much straonger picture. What you do have in focus is very nice, there''s just too little of it.', '2004-03-25 17:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(638545, 65743, 15407, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo, It evokes many emotions.  The composure is fantastic!  (I''d be tempted to say lucky - yet I think not). I would only have cloned out the 3 minor distractions (debris to the rigt of the 1st column on the left just behind the lady, the black mark just to the left of the 1st column on the right &amp; the white spot on her coat)  I think that there may a little trouble in the voting for this great photo as "Orange''  doesn''t come across (to me) as the  primary subject.</td>', 'I really like this photo, It evokes many emotions.  The composure is fantastic!  (I''d be tempted to say lucky - yet I think not). I would only have cloned out the 3 minor distractions (debris to the rigt of the 1st column on the left just behind the lady, the black mark just to the left of the 1st column on the right & the white spot on her coat)  I think that there may a little trouble in the voting for this great photo as "Orange''  doesn''t come across (to me) as the  primary subject.', '2004-03-25 17:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
