(638667, 66265, 17851, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  Hi!  I was rereading my comment and it sounds much harsher than I meant it to be.  I like lakes and skies and gave your photo a better than average score.  What I really want to say is there seem to be many similar type photos and with your talents you would score higher applying your creativity to something more unusual.  I hope that sounds more constructive.</td>', 'Good photo.  Hi!  I was rereading my comment and it sounds much harsher than I meant it to be.  I like lakes and skies and gave your photo a better than average score.  What I really want to say is there seem to be many similar type photos and with your talents you would score higher applying your creativity to something more unusual.  I hope that sounds more constructive.', '2004-03-25 18:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
