(638709, 66389, 12962, '<td valign="top">Wow, this could also be for the motion (and even parallel) challenge (!).  I am very intrigued by the composition.  Diagonal lines and parallels make this harmonious.  The ''transparency'' of the train (or is that a reflection) is also very clever.  Whatever, whether transparency or reflection, that tree and the sun and the sign add an interesting focus that makes the photograph.  If you were even luckier, a human or animal figure could even be more intriguing.  I love it that you thought of this composition rather than just shooting blindly (like me).  A ten.</td>', 'Wow, this could also be for the motion (and even parallel) challenge (!).  I am very intrigued by the composition.  Diagonal lines and parallels make this harmonious.  The ''transparency'' of the train (or is that a reflection) is also very clever.  Whatever, whether transparency or reflection, that tree and the sun and the sign add an interesting focus that makes the photograph.  If you were even luckier, a human or animal figure could even be more intriguing.  I love it that you thought of this composition rather than just shooting blindly (like me).  A ten.', '2004-03-25 18:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
