(638838, 66245, 12962, '<td valign="top">Nice macro and good DOF.  A little bit of noise though but that can be repaired in neatimage which you can download for free.</td>', 'Nice macro and good DOF.  A little bit of noise though but that can be repaired in neatimage which you can download for free.', '2004-03-25 19:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(638839, 65558, 12962, '<td valign="top">Orange on black is definitely the way to go.  Lots of elements here though, that the eye can''t decide where to focus.  I wonder if taking out the butterfly could simplify things.</td>', 'Orange on black is definitely the way to go.  Lots of elements here though, that the eye can''t decide where to focus.  I wonder if taking out the butterfly could simplify things.', '2004-03-25 19:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(638844, 66223, 12962, '<td valign="top">What a fat duck!  I like the in your face, head on, centered presentation.  It really emphasizes the fatness of the duck.  Orange color may not dominate the picture, but it certainly is a player.  A ten for me.</td>', 'What a fat duck!  I like the in your face, head on, centered presentation.  It really emphasizes the fatness of the duck.  Orange color may not dominate the picture, but it certainly is a player.  A ten for me.', '2004-03-25 19:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
