(638862, 65257, 4122, '<td valign="top">i''m sure i''m not the first one to say it .... isnt that yellow?</td>', 'i''m sure i''m not the first one to say it .... isnt that yellow?', '2004-03-25 20:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
