(639367, 66105, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Might even have scraped into the motion blur challenge :) I probably would have had her wearing a neutral top, maybe a white tee shirt or something (9)</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Might even have scraped into the motion blur challenge :) I probably would have had her wearing a neutral top, maybe a white tee shirt or something (9)', '2004-03-26 06:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(639369, 65544, 5728, '<td valign="top">A very clever and good idea. I find the lighting is a touch too harsh on the front carrot, but only minimal, and the snail could be a tad sharper. (I know I am very picky :) Very fitting to the challenge.</td>', 'A very clever and good idea. I find the lighting is a touch too harsh on the front carrot, but only minimal, and the snail could be a tad sharper. (I know I am very picky :) Very fitting to the challenge.', '2004-03-26 06:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
