(639377, 65351, 11181, '<td valign="top">I hate to be blunt but a dead fly, IMO, isn''t really appealing. Nevertheless, very good on the technicals... excellent DOF and focus. Good luck. 4</td>', 'I hate to be blunt but a dead fly, IMO, isn''t really appealing. Nevertheless, very good on the technicals... excellent DOF and focus. Good luck. 4', '2004-03-26 06:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
