(639379, 66422, 18073, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, I like where you''ve placed the sun in the frame, good job!</td>', 'Beautiful image, I like where you''ve placed the sun in the frame, good job!', '2004-03-26 06:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(639382, 65633, 18846, '<td valign="top">"it''s not right, but it''s ok" :)</td>', '"it''s not right, but it''s ok" :)', '2004-03-26 06:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(639385, 66105, 11181, '<td valign="top">I like color on this. Excellent composition. A bit soft on the focus though IMO. I guess its a good thing that she''s not wearing an orange top... it would''ve been overkill! Hope you do well with this... Good luck! 8</td>', 'I like color on this. Excellent composition. A bit soft on the focus though IMO. I guess its a good thing that she''s not wearing an orange top... it would''ve been overkill! Hope you do well with this... Good luck! 8', '2004-03-26 07:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(639388, 66410, 11181, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle you chose. The lighting is a bit dark though... Good focus is a plus. Good luck.</td>', 'Interesting angle you chose. The lighting is a bit dark though... Good focus is a plus. Good luck.', '2004-03-26 07:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(639392, 66035, 11181, '<td valign="top">Almost perfect... 1: the stems in front of the shot look as if you cut the flowers. 2: the two poppys on the right handside is too close making the picture seem unbalanced. 3: the horizon is slanted, IMO, a different angle would have made this shot more effective. 4: very minor,  being the blue sky on the left is oversaturated. But a very good choice of subject nevertheless. Very appealing. Good luck :) 7</td>', 'Almost perfect... 1: the stems in front of the shot look as if you cut the flowers. 2: the two poppys on the right handside is too close making the picture seem unbalanced. 3: the horizon is slanted, IMO, a different angle would have made this shot more effective. 4: very minor,  being the blue sky on the left is oversaturated. But a very good choice of subject nevertheless. Very appealing. Good luck :) 7', '2004-03-26 07:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(639400, 66387, 11181, '<td valign="top">The focus is either off or you were intentionally focussing on the leaf. The flash on this shot doesn''t work well either IMO. A longer exposure would have been better. In fairness to camera''s where you can''t adjust those settings try using the "night" mode (moon shaped icon). Also if you don''t have a tripod, use some place where you can put your camera while its taking the shot. (window ledge, railings etc.). And to fix the focussing here, center the camera where you''d like the focus to be (in this case, the flowers) by half-pressing the shutter.. while your finger is on the shutter, recompose the shot and press fully. Try it and let me know if that helps. Good luck. 4</td>', 'The focus is either off or you were intentionally focussing on the leaf. The flash on this shot doesn''t work well either IMO. A longer exposure would have been better. In fairness to camera''s where you can''t adjust those settings try using the "night" mode (moon shaped icon). Also if you don''t have a tripod, use some place where you can put your camera while its taking the shot. (window ledge, railings etc.). And to fix the focussing here, center the camera where you''d like the focus to be (in this case, the flowers) by half-pressing the shutter.. while your finger is on the shutter, recompose the shot and press fully. Try it and let me know if that helps. Good luck. 4', '2004-03-26 07:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
