(639429, 66223, 9906, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what it is about ducks that make them look overly sharpened...  I think it may be the waxy feathers.  I have tried shooting mallards and they never quite look right. Good shot here.  The background ain''t the most attractive, but it works!<br/>TC</td>', 'I don''t know what it is about ducks that make them look overly sharpened...  I think it may be the waxy feathers.  I have tried shooting mallards and they never quite look right. Good shot here.  The background ain''t the most attractive, but it works!TC', '2004-03-26 08:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(639430, 65468, 9906, '<td valign="top">Definately an interesting use of white balance to create an effect!<br/>TC</td>', 'Definately an interesting use of white balance to create an effect!TC', '2004-03-26 08:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(639432, 66131, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I think it could use a little more creative lighting.  Perhaps a strong side light like you have here with a reflector to bounce back and help with some of the darker shadows on the left side leaves...<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice composition.  I think it could use a little more creative lighting.  Perhaps a strong side light like you have here with a reflector to bounce back and help with some of the darker shadows on the left side leaves...TC', '2004-03-26 08:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
