(639764, 65457, 10047, '<td valign="top">I think I would have tried for a tighter crop. Maybe even just the section of fence with the sunlight on it.</td>', 'I think I would have tried for a tighter crop. Maybe even just the section of fence with the sunlight on it.', '2004-03-26 12:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(639767, 65694, 10047, '<td valign="top">The face is nice and sharp, but the bottle isn''t. Good use of the black background.</td>', 'The face is nice and sharp, but the bottle isn''t. Good use of the black background.', '2004-03-26 12:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(639771, 65414, 10047, '<td valign="top">Crop might be too tight. It s difficult to tell what this is besides a candle. Also too centered.</td>', 'Crop might be too tight. It s difficult to tell what this is besides a candle. Also too centered.', '2004-03-26 12:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(639772, 65649, 10047, '<td valign="top">Too soft and fuzzy for me.</td>', 'Too soft and fuzzy for me.', '2004-03-26 12:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(639773, 66389, 16636, '<td valign="top">This is amazing, how do you get this one. IMO iit will win this challenge and the next one ''motion blur'' - I just acn''t stop looking at it - 10</td>', 'This is amazing, how do you get this one. IMO iit will win this challenge and the next one ''motion blur'' - I just acn''t stop looking at it - 10', '2004-03-26 12:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(639774, 66262, 10047, '<td valign="top">Focus is a little soft. Might have been from the meter set lens.</td>', 'Focus is a little soft. Might have been from the meter set lens.', '2004-03-26 12:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(639775, 65298, 16636, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity an elegance of this photo, one of my favourites even though the majority of the shot is not orange</td>', 'I love the simplicity an elegance of this photo, one of my favourites even though the majority of the shot is not orange', '2004-03-26 12:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(639781, 66278, 16636, '<td valign="top">I have found it hard to find many photos out of so many entries that I really like. I love the shape, feel, composition and excellent sharpness you have got here, definately of of my favourites - well done</td>', 'I have found it hard to find many photos out of so many entries that I really like. I love the shape, feel, composition and excellent sharpness you have got here, definately of of my favourites - well done', '2004-03-26 12:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(639782, 66387, 10047, '<td valign="top">NIce colors and contrast. I''d like a deeper DOF so more of the flowers are in focus.</td>', 'NIce colors and contrast. I''d like a deeper DOF so more of the flowers are in focus.', '2004-03-26 12:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(639784, 66039, 10047, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting was too bright.</td>', 'I think the lighting was too bright.', '2004-03-26 12:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(639785, 65292, 10047, '<td valign="top">The lighting on the left sees a bit brutal. I think I would have cropped out the windshield.</td>', 'The lighting on the left sees a bit brutal. I think I would have cropped out the windshield.', '2004-03-26 12:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(639790, 65256, 10047, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but it seems too bright and too soft. Maybe too centered also.</td>', 'I like the idea but it seems too bright and too soft. Maybe too centered also.', '2004-03-26 12:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(639793, 65778, 10047, '<td valign="top">I would have tried darkening and saturating the photo more. It seems a little washed out. Nice stop action.</td>', 'I would have tried darkening and saturating the photo more. It seems a little washed out. Nice stop action.', '2004-03-26 12:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(639806, 66178, 10047, '<td valign="top">Too soft. Nice colors and contrast though.</td>', 'Too soft. Nice colors and contrast though.', '2004-03-26 13:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(639812, 66297, 10047, '<td valign="top">Too centered and not enough shading and contrast. The orange cast seems to wash out his features.</td>', 'Too centered and not enough shading and contrast. The orange cast seems to wash out his features.', '2004-03-26 13:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(639815, 65439, 10047, '<td valign="top">I think it needs a little different POV to give it perspective. Also a little too centered. It is very orange.</td>', 'I think it needs a little different POV to give it perspective. Also a little too centered. It is very orange.', '2004-03-26 13:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(639820, 66312, 10047, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky but the powerlines are goofing it up.</td>', 'Beautiful sky but the powerlines are goofing it up.', '2004-03-26 13:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(639822, 65850, 10047, '<td valign="top">The grass is lush and green, but al the toys seem to have a soft focus.</td>', 'The grass is lush and green, but al the toys seem to have a soft focus.', '2004-03-26 13:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(639825, 65122, 14355, '<td valign="top">If the image had been sharp - I believe it would have been in the top 3 for this challenge.</td>', 'If the image had been sharp - I believe it would have been in the top 3 for this challenge.', '2004-03-26 13:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(639828, 66006, 12962, '<td valign="top">Stark, simple, beautiful.  Would probably have more interest if it were offcenter and maybe arranged in a diagonal fashion.  But still, it is a very well thought of entry to the challenge.</td>', 'Stark, simple, beautiful.  Would probably have more interest if it were offcenter and maybe arranged in a diagonal fashion.  But still, it is a very well thought of entry to the challenge.', '2004-03-26 13:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(639829, 65550, 18749, '<td valign="top">i love it<br/></td>', 'i love it', '2004-03-26 13:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(639833, 66037, 12962, '<td valign="top">This is great.  Lots of visual elements here.  I find the figures on the wall stealing the limelight from the orange subject. In fact my eyes focus on the figures rather than the bottles.   Perhaps taking this at a shallower DOF at a larger aperture (to blur the background a little bit) would do the trick.  Nevertheless, it shows that you really put a lot of effort for the challenge and your results are quite beautiful.</td>', 'This is great.  Lots of visual elements here.  I find the figures on the wall stealing the limelight from the orange subject. In fact my eyes focus on the figures rather than the bottles.   Perhaps taking this at a shallower DOF at a larger aperture (to blur the background a little bit) would do the trick.  Nevertheless, it shows that you really put a lot of effort for the challenge and your results are quite beautiful.', '2004-03-26 13:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(639836, 65437, 12962, '<td valign="top">I don''t mean to be rude, but I thought oranges are explicitly stated in the rules for this challenge as an exclusion.  Having said that, the luminosity of the oranges is quite interesting.  The triangular arrangement is very harmonious.  The folds of the background add some visual interest.  There are however, white specks near the edge on the left, although small, somehow, are distracting.  Still, it''s a good effort for the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t mean to be rude, but I thought oranges are explicitly stated in the rules for this challenge as an exclusion.  Having said that, the luminosity of the oranges is quite interesting.  The triangular arrangement is very harmonious.  The folds of the background add some visual interest.  There are however, white specks near the edge on the left, although small, somehow, are distracting.  Still, it''s a good effort for the challenge.', '2004-03-26 13:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(639838, 66345, 12962, '<td valign="top">Good macro and DOF.  Lighting is also good.</td>', 'Good macro and DOF.  Lighting is also good.', '2004-03-26 13:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(639843, 65742, 12962, '<td valign="top">Orange and black = beautiful combination.  Very well thought of.  The addition of the black crane at the back adds more interest and contrast.  DOF is very nice.  I just don''t like the dead center placement of the orange crane but that is just me (a suggestion is to crop just to the left of the square ball and about an inch from the bottom).  What I like most is the loving effort and details that you spent in this challenge.  It shows beautifully in your photograph.</td>', 'Orange and black = beautiful combination.  Very well thought of.  The addition of the black crane at the back adds more interest and contrast.  DOF is very nice.  I just don''t like the dead center placement of the orange crane but that is just me (a suggestion is to crop just to the left of the square ball and about an inch from the bottom).  What I like most is the loving effort and details that you spent in this challenge.  It shows beautifully in your photograph.', '2004-03-26 13:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(639846, 66393, 12962, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This is so weird in a beautiful kind of way.  It is so unexpected... or perhaps a consumer''s nightmare.  Very well conceived and executed.  The placement of the half-eaten egg (I guess I prefer to interpret it that way) is perfect.</td>', 'Wow.  This is so weird in a beautiful kind of way.  It is so unexpected... or perhaps a consumer''s nightmare.  Very well conceived and executed.  The placement of the half-eaten egg (I guess I prefer to interpret it that way) is perfect.', '2004-03-26 13:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(639855, 66069, 17937, '<td valign="top">Not sure how you did it but I like...</td>', 'Not sure how you did it but I like...', '2004-03-26 13:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(639858, 66314, 15800, '<td valign="top">nice...although, it might have been good to get the blossoms facing the camera, rather than against...but otherwise, great shot!</td>', 'nice...although, it might have been good to get the blossoms facing the camera, rather than against...but otherwise, great shot!', '2004-03-26 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(639861, 65272, 17937, '<td valign="top">Great image...  The only thing that I can say is maybe she should be a little more in focus...  Otherwise I like this a lot...</td>', 'Great image...  The only thing that I can say is maybe she should be a little more in focus...  Otherwise I like this a lot...', '2004-03-26 13:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(639862, 66163, 15800, '<td valign="top">nice close-up</td>', 'nice close-up', '2004-03-26 13:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(639863, 66245, 15800, '<td valign="top">this is right smack in the middle of the photograph...rule of thirds!</td>', 'this is right smack in the middle of the photograph...rule of thirds!', '2004-03-26 13:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(639864, 66298, 17937, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Could you make this any larger?<br/></td>', 'Very nice.  Could you make this any larger?', '2004-03-26 13:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(639866, 66223, 15800, '<td valign="top">nice, clear, close-up!!!</td>', 'nice, clear, close-up!!!', '2004-03-26 13:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(639867, 65528, 17937, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  One of my favorites so far...</td>', 'Very cool.  One of my favorites so far...', '2004-03-26 13:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(639868, 66168, 13390, '<td valign="top">I love the effect you have used here. The composition here is quite strong. I can''t really think of anything to improve the shot at this moment. By the way,t eh back floor really adds to the quality of the image.</td>', 'I love the effect you have used here. The composition here is quite strong. I can''t really think of anything to improve the shot at this moment. By the way,t eh back floor really adds to the quality of the image.', '2004-03-26 13:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(639870, 66017, 15800, '<td valign="top">dark in the bottom right hand corner...maybe have some different lighting??<br/></td>', 'dark in the bottom right hand corner...maybe have some different lighting??', '2004-03-26 13:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(639873, 66343, 13390, '<td valign="top">Very Cool! I really like the image and composition! Very creative! One thing that could make this shot even better is a little bit stronger lighting. The lighting "feels" slightly week. Other than, stellar shot!</td>', 'Very Cool! I really like the image and composition! Very creative! One thing that could make this shot even better is a little bit stronger lighting. The lighting "feels" slightly week. Other than, stellar shot!', '2004-03-26 13:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(639874, 66201, 15800, '<td valign="top">"steam" doesn''t look like steam.  Looks like smoke.  Did you try actual steam???  Otherwise, the composition and idea is AWESOME!</td>', '"steam" doesn''t look like steam.  Looks like smoke.  Did you try actual steam???  Otherwise, the composition and idea is AWESOME!', '2004-03-26 13:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(639875, 66061, 13390, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Great DOF and focus. I love how you used green to complement the orange, I as a viewer appreciate that attention to detail, very nicely done!</td>', 'Very nice! Great DOF and focus. I love how you used green to complement the orange, I as a viewer appreciate that attention to detail, very nicely done!', '2004-03-26 13:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(639880, 66314, 17296, '<td valign="top">Great DOF. If only you could get all the blossoms in focus...</td>', 'Great DOF. If only you could get all the blossoms in focus...', '2004-03-26 14:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(639882, 65353, 17296, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I wouldn''t mind seeing a little more detail in the shadowy areas.</td>', 'Beautiful. I wouldn''t mind seeing a little more detail in the shadowy areas.', '2004-03-26 14:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(639883, 65876, 17296, '<td valign="top">So many flowers! I love it. Nice DOF, great colors. Very nice. 10.</td>', 'So many flowers! I love it. Nice DOF, great colors. Very nice. 10.', '2004-03-26 14:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(639885, 66345, 17296, '<td valign="top">I wish the yellow pencil was in better focus. My favorite of the pen/pencil/crayon photos.</td>', 'I wish the yellow pencil was in better focus. My favorite of the pen/pencil/crayon photos.', '2004-03-26 14:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(639887, 66072, 17296, '<td valign="top">What a strange landscape! Very interesting. I love the DOF. I don''t really like the wire hanging from the roof... but maybe you couldn''t do anything about that. Very nice.</td>', 'What a strange landscape! Very interesting. I love the DOF. I don''t really like the wire hanging from the roof... but maybe you couldn''t do anything about that. Very nice.', '2004-03-26 14:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(639894, 65220, 18568, '<td valign="top">The use of God''s natural light is astounding in this picture.  The picture reminds me of a window at my office where I work.  I think of this picture everytime I step into my office.</td>', 'The use of God''s natural light is astounding in this picture.  The picture reminds me of a window at my office where I work.  I think of this picture everytime I step into my office.', '2004-03-26 14:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(639895, 65963, 17296, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I love the perspective in this shot. Not an enormous amount of orange here, but definitly enough. I wish the sky had either stronger color or more cloud detail...</td>', 'Very nice. I love the perspective in this shot. Not an enormous amount of orange here, but definitly enough. I wish the sky had either stronger color or more cloud detail...', '2004-03-26 14:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(639896, 66435, 17937, '<td valign="top">That is a very odd and awesome sky.  Great Image.</td>', 'That is a very odd and awesome sky.  Great Image.', '2004-03-26 14:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(639899, 66210, 17296, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The tree is a little fuzzy, I don''t know if this is a product of the texture of the tree or neat-image or something similar. I like the mountain in the distance, it gives the shot depth. And the colors in the sky are just amazing. Beautiful, definitly my favorite of the sunset photos.</td>', 'Very nice. The tree is a little fuzzy, I don''t know if this is a product of the texture of the tree or neat-image or something similar. I like the mountain in the distance, it gives the shot depth. And the colors in the sky are just amazing. Beautiful, definitly my favorite of the sunset photos.', '2004-03-26 14:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(639901, 65508, 17296, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Looks like some strange creature... The black background works great here.</td>', 'Very cool. Looks like some strange creature... The black background works great here.', '2004-03-26 14:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(639902, 66292, 17296, '<td valign="top">Great composition. The light on the floor almost looks like white pieces of paper set there. I like this a lot.</td>', 'Great composition. The light on the floor almost looks like white pieces of paper set there. I like this a lot.', '2004-03-26 14:16:26.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(639904, 66360, 17296, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. I might have turned it 90 degrees counterclockwise, maybe. Perhaps it would make me feel like I was playing in the finger paint...</td>', 'I like this shot. I might have turned it 90 degrees counterclockwise, maybe. Perhaps it would make me feel like I was playing in the finger paint...', '2004-03-26 14:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(639905, 65876, 17937, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Where do you love that you got this great shot this time of the year?  Obviously not the northeast.. :)</td>', 'Very nice.  Where do you love that you got this great shot this time of the year?  Obviously not the northeast.. :)', '2004-03-26 14:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(639906, 66017, 17296, '<td valign="top">I like this except for: the shadow in the lower right corner, the cement in the upper right, the yellow stuff in the upper left/center, and the soft focus on the front petals of the flower. I might have ripped off the errant petals in the center of the flower for good measure too. What''s up with the 2 sided border? A tighter crop would have fixed a few of the problems. Despite all this, I like it a lot.</td>', 'I like this except for: the shadow in the lower right corner, the cement in the upper right, the yellow stuff in the upper left/center, and the soft focus on the front petals of the flower. I might have ripped off the errant petals in the center of the flower for good measure too. What''s up with the 2 sided border? A tighter crop would have fixed a few of the problems. Despite all this, I like it a lot.', '2004-03-26 14:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(639908, 66387, 10686, '<td valign="top">needs more fill light, flowers are too dark</td>', 'needs more fill light, flowers are too dark', '2004-03-26 14:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(639911, 66329, 10686, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shades of orange. I wish the vase/glass was either completely included or excluded and not just partially in the frame.</td>', 'Wonderful shades of orange. I wish the vase/glass was either completely included or excluded and not just partially in the frame.', '2004-03-26 14:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(639915, 65531, 10686, '<td valign="top">Needs fill light on the front</td>', 'Needs fill light on the front', '2004-03-26 14:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(639918, 66327, 10686, '<td valign="top">It''s a truck, no real mystery about it</td>', 'It''s a truck, no real mystery about it', '2004-03-26 14:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(639923, 65443, 16324, '<td valign="top">little more dof please</td>', 'little more dof please', '2004-03-26 14:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(639926, 66252, 16324, '<td valign="top">Dramatic, great silouete! Nice orange</td>', 'Dramatic, great silouete! Nice orange', '2004-03-26 14:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(639929, 65232, 14863, '<td valign="top">This is really cool- they looke like little soldiers with orange light heads. Great job</td>', 'This is really cool- they looke like little soldiers with orange light heads. Great job', '2004-03-26 14:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(639932, 65280, 14863, '<td valign="top">Hehe- really funny- give you a 9 for makin'' me laugh :D</td>', 'Hehe- really funny- give you a 9 for makin'' me laugh :D', '2004-03-26 14:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(639934, 66043, 11895, '<td valign="top">I really like this, good composition, these women look genuinely happy about what they are doing, my only suggestion would be more sharpening as it looks blurry</td>', 'I really like this, good composition, these women look genuinely happy about what they are doing, my only suggestion would be more sharpening as it looks blurry', '2004-03-26 14:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(639957, 65349, 18709, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, and you could not be closer to the terms of the competition</td>', 'I like the idea, and you could not be closer to the terms of the competition', '2004-03-26 15:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(639959, 66017, 16324, '<td valign="top">why orange on the bottom and right side?</td>', 'why orange on the bottom and right side?', '2004-03-26 15:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(639964, 65406, 18709, '<td valign="top">Too early for azalea buds where I live.</td>', 'Too early for azalea buds where I live.', '2004-03-26 15:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(639965, 66232, 18709, '<td valign="top">Very ingenious adn original.</td>', 'Very ingenious adn original.', '2004-03-26 15:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(639968, 65762, 18709, '<td valign="top">Gotterdammerung, The twilight of the Gods.   This is very Wagnerian.  Fire in the sky.</td>', 'Gotterdammerung, The twilight of the Gods.   This is very Wagnerian.  Fire in the sky.', '2004-03-26 15:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(639970, 65359, 18709, '<td valign="top">This a beautiful image.  Lots of mystery.</td>', 'This a beautiful image.  Lots of mystery.', '2004-03-26 15:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(639973, 66374, 18709, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic shapes, especially with the black background.</td>', 'Very dramatic shapes, especially with the black background.', '2004-03-26 15:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(639977, 65385, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is well-taken, and with a feeling of a thaw in the air.</td>', 'This is well-taken, and with a feeling of a thaw in the air.', '2004-03-26 15:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(639978, 66213, 16324, '<td valign="top">did not like the purple, but nice photo of a fire place</td>', 'did not like the purple, but nice photo of a fire place', '2004-03-26 15:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(639980, 66331, 16324, '<td valign="top">I thought yellow is for dummies.</td>', 'I thought yellow is for dummies.', '2004-03-26 15:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(639981, 66246, 19021, '<td valign="top">great</td>', 'great', '2004-03-26 15:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(639982, 66337, 18709, '<td valign="top">I always have a problem with photos of ''bits'' of buildings.  This is well-taken but <br/>I think that aspect of it is a minus.   But not everybody thiks like I do.  Don''t give up.</td>', 'I always have a problem with photos of ''bits'' of buildings.  This is well-taken but I think that aspect of it is a minus.   But not everybody thiks like I do.  Don''t give up.', '2004-03-26 15:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(639987, 65987, 18709, '<td valign="top">A nice collage.  Well arranged. (it''s easy to get these things wrong) .</td>', 'A nice collage.  Well arranged. (it''s easy to get these things wrong) .', '2004-03-26 15:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(639988, 66043, 18709, '<td valign="top">This looks like good fun.  Even if you don''t win  (and you might) it was probably worth it.</td>', 'This looks like good fun.  Even if you don''t win  (and you might) it was probably worth it.', '2004-03-26 15:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(639989, 66310, 3765, '<td valign="top">I have just rerated this from an 8 to a 10. Wonderful straightforward composition. Nothing fancy just a good eye. Good!</td>', 'I have just rerated this from an 8 to a 10. Wonderful straightforward composition. Nothing fancy just a good eye. Good!', '2004-03-26 15:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(639992, 66153, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is a good pohtograph, but I''m not sure that just taking a photo of something orange- coloured is quite enough.  It needs a bit of ingenuity, and that is not so <br/>aasy.  Perhaps that is why I hven''t entered for this challenge.</td>', 'This is a good pohtograph, but I''m not sure that just taking a photo of something orange- coloured is quite enough.  It needs a bit of ingenuity, and that is not so aasy.  Perhaps that is why I hven''t entered for this challenge.', '2004-03-26 15:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(639993, 66327, 18709, '<td valign="top">It is funny that a colour as warm as orange can look so cold.   Well done.</td>', 'It is funny that a colour as warm as orange can look so cold.   Well done.', '2004-03-26 15:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(639996, 65940, 18709, '<td valign="top">I said in a previoius crit, that just taking a picture of something orange, is not quite enough.  I have to eat my words.  I can very nearly SMELL this rose.</td>', 'I said in a previoius crit, that just taking a picture of something orange, is not quite enough.  I have to eat my words.  I can very nearly SMELL this rose.', '2004-03-26 15:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(639997, 66102, 18709, '<td valign="top">This picture looks unedited to me, and is a really first-class image.  We used to have sodium lights in London which gave off this rather eerie colour.</td>', 'This picture looks unedited to me, and is a really first-class image.  We used to have sodium lights in London which gave off this rather eerie colour.', '2004-03-26 15:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(640001, 66066, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is quite  a  picture, and it breaks some of the rules, and gets away with it. Two-thirds of the picture is virtually blank, and yet the colour is so attractive, that it is forgivable.  The crane support bisecting the setting sun is an unforgettable image.</td>', 'This is quite  a  picture, and it breaks some of the rules, and gets away with it. Two-thirds of the picture is virtually blank, and yet the colour is so attractive, that it is forgivable.  The crane support bisecting the setting sun is an unforgettable image.', '2004-03-26 15:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(640004, 66095, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is clever. The reflection gives it character and can allow us to conjure up all sorts of  other images.</td>', 'This is clever. The reflection gives it character and can allow us to conjure up all sorts of  other images.', '2004-03-26 15:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(640008, 66436, 18709, '<td valign="top">Split-second timing here.  Well-done.   Perhaps if the drink had been an orange-juice, it would have had more impact.  Still the orange lid  is a strong feature, and quite dramatic.</td>', 'Split-second timing here.  Well-done.   Perhaps if the drink had been an orange-juice, it would have had more impact.  Still the orange lid  is a strong feature, and quite dramatic.', '2004-03-26 15:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(640010, 65277, 11895, '<td valign="top">very nice but seems slightly dark</td>', 'very nice but seems slightly dark', '2004-03-26 15:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(640014, 66009, 18709, '<td valign="top">Nobody can accuse you of picturing an orange,   This is ingenious and a good way to dodge the rules legitimately.  Well-done.</td>', 'Nobody can accuse you of picturing an orange,   This is ingenious and a good way to dodge the rules legitimately.  Well-done.', '2004-03-26 15:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(640016, 66179, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful silhouette. i suppose it is orange, though it looks a bit yellowy to me.  But orange comes in all shades, and since I have actually eaten oranges of exactly this colour, how can I argue.</td>', 'This is a beautiful silhouette. i suppose it is orange, though it looks a bit yellowy to me.  But orange comes in all shades, and since I have actually eaten oranges of exactly this colour, how can I argue.', '2004-03-26 15:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(640020, 65963, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is probably more saffron than orange, but it is OK with me.  Wonderful perspective, takne, as far as I can tell from exactly the right viewpoint.  Excellent.</td>', 'This is probably more saffron than orange, but it is OK with me.  Wonderful perspective, takne, as far as I can tell from exactly the right viewpoint.  Excellent.', '2004-03-26 15:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(640021, 65752, 6130, '<td valign="top">Funny.</td>', 'Funny.', '2004-03-26 15:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(640023, 66137, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this.</td>', 'I like this.', '2004-03-26 15:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(640025, 65280, 6130, '<td valign="top">Funny.</td>', 'Funny.', '2004-03-26 15:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(640027, 66357, 18709, '<td valign="top">A mouth-watering picture.  Nicely arranged.  Not looking at all contrived. Clean and uncluttered. Just enough head-room, any more would have meant that half the picture would be empty.  I like this.  What happened to all the goodies?</td>', 'A mouth-watering picture.  Nicely arranged.  Not looking at all contrived. Clean and uncluttered. Just enough head-room, any more would have meant that half the picture would be empty.  I like this.  What happened to all the goodies?', '2004-03-26 15:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(640029, 65454, 18709, '<td valign="top">Very clever play on colours.  Did you know what the results would be when you took it?  I wonder.  It is taken on rather unromantic  yellow lines in the road, and yet it really has something.</td>', 'Very clever play on colours.  Did you know what the results would be when you took it?  I wonder.  It is taken on rather unromantic  yellow lines in the road, and yet it really has something.', '2004-03-26 15:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(640036, 65997, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2004-03-26 15:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(640037, 66355, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is a startling image.  Can it be true?   It certainly looks it.  The contrast between the blue sky and the pillar is very telling, and the rather drab colour of the soil and rocks throw it into sharp relief.  Very good. I also like the fact that it is confined to the left hand third of the picture.</td>', 'This is a startling image.  Can it be true?   It certainly looks it.  The contrast between the blue sky and the pillar is very telling, and the rather drab colour of the soil and rocks throw it into sharp relief.  Very good. I also like the fact that it is confined to the left hand third of the picture.', '2004-03-26 15:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(640040, 65750, 18709, '<td valign="top">Very poignant.   I wish it were so.  This is good. So it the title.</td>', 'Very poignant.   I wish it were so.  This is good. So it the title.', '2004-03-26 15:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(640041, 66147, 18709, '<td valign="top">Re your title,  You pays your money and you takes your choice.  I like this. it is so warm to look at.  Perhaps on a hot day, it might not be so welcome.</td>', 'Re your title,  You pays your money and you takes your choice.  I like this. it is so warm to look at.  Perhaps on a hot day, it might not be so welcome.', '2004-03-26 16:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
