(640184, 66232, 17296, '<td valign="top">This photo is...weird. But cool. It reminds me of an album cover. I like it. Good job.</td>', 'This photo is...weird. But cool. It reminds me of an album cover. I like it. Good job.', '2004-03-26 17:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(640186, 65105, 12573, '<td valign="top">Negative space done well.  The bug looks ready to flutter off to an awaiting flower, which is unseen by the viewer.  There''s a sense of peace and simplicity in the position of the butterfly, leading my eye to the emptiness to the right.  Very nice.</td>', 'Negative space done well.  The bug looks ready to flutter off to an awaiting flower, which is unseen by the viewer.  There''s a sense of peace and simplicity in the position of the butterfly, leading my eye to the emptiness to the right.  Very nice.', '2004-03-26 17:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(640189, 66403, 12573, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I wish the tangle of branches on the right wasn''t there, but I like the contrast of the green shrubbery against the rusty roof.  There''s some slight flaring in the upper right corner that is a little distracting.  Also the large pine tree in the very back of the image is out of place.  It reminds of a midwest haybarn that might house some old relics worth more than the barn itself.  Nice work!</td>', 'Nice composition.  I wish the tangle of branches on the right wasn''t there, but I like the contrast of the green shrubbery against the rusty roof.  There''s some slight flaring in the upper right corner that is a little distracting.  Also the large pine tree in the very back of the image is out of place.  It reminds of a midwest haybarn that might house some old relics worth more than the barn itself.  Nice work!', '2004-03-26 17:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(640191, 66310, 17296, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but it looks as though it has had some serious noise reduction done on it. Personally I''d rather see a little more noise rather than over-processing. Nice capture though.</td>', 'Nice photo, but it looks as though it has had some serious noise reduction done on it. Personally I''d rather see a little more noise rather than over-processing. Nice capture though.', '2004-03-26 18:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(640193, 66239, 12573, '<td valign="top">Lighting is too harsh.  Not sure what the subject is nor do I understand what the mess of color on her tummy is suppose to represent.  The cropping work is good, though, and I think this person posed in the same manner without the confusing orange/yellow gunk would make for a good composition, though not necessarily for this challenge.  The rug/blanket underneath the person is distracting.</td>', 'Lighting is too harsh.  Not sure what the subject is nor do I understand what the mess of color on her tummy is suppose to represent.  The cropping work is good, though, and I think this person posed in the same manner without the confusing orange/yellow gunk would make for a good composition, though not necessarily for this challenge.  The rug/blanket underneath the person is distracting.', '2004-03-26 18:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(640194, 66195, 17296, '<td valign="top">I very much like this photo. But I think there is something missing from the composition... I can''t put my finger on it. Sorry I can''t be more helpful. I really like the photo though.</td>', 'I very much like this photo. But I think there is something missing from the composition... I can''t put my finger on it. Sorry I can''t be more helpful. I really like the photo though.', '2004-03-26 18:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(640195, 66010, 17296, '<td valign="top">I adore the composition of this photo. It''s simple, it''s clean, I really like it. I would have scored it higher if it were clearer. Good job.</td>', 'I adore the composition of this photo. It''s simple, it''s clean, I really like it. I would have scored it higher if it were clearer. Good job.', '2004-03-26 18:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(640196, 66342, 12573, '<td valign="top">Lighting is very good on this flower, but perhaps not perfect.  Where''s the stem?  I can make it out, but barely.  It would have been cool to get the stem to go away entirely.  Otherwise, it should be lit enough to show what it is.  The soft focus is excellent and I like the transition of color from orange petal to green bud.  Overall. it''s a 7.  Cheers!</td>', 'Lighting is very good on this flower, but perhaps not perfect.  Where''s the stem?  I can make it out, but barely.  It would have been cool to get the stem to go away entirely.  Otherwise, it should be lit enough to show what it is.  The soft focus is excellent and I like the transition of color from orange petal to green bud.  Overall. it''s a 7.  Cheers!', '2004-03-26 18:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(640199, 65298, 12573, '<td valign="top">I love this picture.  The DOF is right on.  The spinning of the record is obvious and suggests the person who took the picture is enjoying some tunes worthy of an inspiring photograph.  The perpendicular placement of the arm in the frame is great and helps keep my eye in the lower portion of the image due to it being completely in focus from left to right.  The exposure could not be better.  My favorite so far.  10.</td>', 'I love this picture.  The DOF is right on.  The spinning of the record is obvious and suggests the person who took the picture is enjoying some tunes worthy of an inspiring photograph.  The perpendicular placement of the arm in the frame is great and helps keep my eye in the lower portion of the image due to it being completely in focus from left to right.  The exposure could not be better.  My favorite so far.  10.', '2004-03-26 18:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(640202, 66105, 12962, '<td valign="top">I love this.  It fits the challenge.  Dynamic.  Beautiful model.  Love the eccentric placing of the model.</td>', 'I love this.  It fits the challenge.  Dynamic.  Beautiful model.  Love the eccentric placing of the model.', '2004-03-26 18:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(640203, 65105, 17296, '<td valign="top">I love the composition of this shot. The only thing I do not like is that the leaves the butterfly is sitting on are not green. I think it hurts the photo overall. Other than that I like the DOF and that the background is grey/black.</td>', 'I love the composition of this shot. The only thing I do not like is that the leaves the butterfly is sitting on are not green. I think it hurts the photo overall. Other than that I like the DOF and that the background is grey/black.', '2004-03-26 18:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(640204, 66369, 15810, '<td valign="top">One of the best shots, pity the carrot wasnt nice and new and shiny. Brilliant 10</td>', 'One of the best shots, pity the carrot wasnt nice and new and shiny. Brilliant 10', '2004-03-26 18:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(640205, 66077, 12573, '<td valign="top">Well chosen subject for the challenge, but poorly executed in my opinion.  You need to get everything in focus and avoid overcropping and/or camera shake so that everything is crisp and clear.  The can of soda probably could make the point of the image without the full glass next to it.  Also, the point of view is too direct.  Coming down at an angle of view on these subjects with a wider angle would have made the shot more interesting.</td>', 'Well chosen subject for the challenge, but poorly executed in my opinion.  You need to get everything in focus and avoid overcropping and/or camera shake so that everything is crisp and clear.  The can of soda probably could make the point of the image without the full glass next to it.  Also, the point of view is too direct.  Coming down at an angle of view on these subjects with a wider angle would have made the shot more interesting.', '2004-03-26 18:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(640206, 65683, 17296, '<td valign="top">This would have been a fine entry for motion blur. Very cool photo.</td>', 'This would have been a fine entry for motion blur. Very cool photo.', '2004-03-26 18:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(640207, 66258, 17296, '<td valign="top">It''s too bad you couldn''t get a photo of this guy from the front. Seeing just the back of him is a little impersonal...</td>', 'It''s too bad you couldn''t get a photo of this guy from the front. Seeing just the back of him is a little impersonal...', '2004-03-26 18:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(640209, 66252, 17296, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette. I''m thinking that I''d like to see maybe a tiny bit of detail in the structure though...</td>', 'Nice silhouette. I''m thinking that I''d like to see maybe a tiny bit of detail in the structure though...', '2004-03-26 18:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(640210, 66009, 17296, '<td valign="top">Great idea, great composition. I love it!</td>', 'Great idea, great composition. I love it!', '2004-03-26 18:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(640211, 66405, 17296, '<td valign="top">My, this seems like an elaborate set up! Very cute!</td>', 'My, this seems like an elaborate set up! Very cute!', '2004-03-26 18:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(640213, 65371, 12573, '<td valign="top">What can I say, I like it.  The extreme cropping keeps out of view everything that is not important to showing us the subject.  Still, the subject itself is not interesting enough to keep me looking for too long.  It''s so close to being abstract that the letters almost lose meaning, but the flirtation with that lost context keeps the image together.</td>', 'What can I say, I like it.  The extreme cropping keeps out of view everything that is not important to showing us the subject.  Still, the subject itself is not interesting enough to keep me looking for too long.  It''s so close to being abstract that the letters almost lose meaning, but the flirtation with that lost context keeps the image together.', '2004-03-26 18:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(640215, 65220, 10047, '<td valign="top">A little on the small side, and the frame with the 3d shading competes against the photo. I had to scroll down anyway even though you reduced the size. I try to stay away from "portrait" orientation because of that, but that is personal preference. I don''t kow if reducing the size was a mistake or not. Hopefully you''ll get more comments that will either agree or disagree with my opinion. If no one else makes a comment about the size, then it was probably just me.</td>', 'A little on the small side, and the frame with the 3d shading competes against the photo. I had to scroll down anyway even though you reduced the size. I try to stay away from "portrait" orientation because of that, but that is personal preference. I don''t kow if reducing the size was a mistake or not. Hopefully you''ll get more comments that will either agree or disagree with my opinion. If no one else makes a comment about the size, then it was probably just me.', '2004-03-26 18:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(640220, 66069, 12573, '<td valign="top">Georgeous.  I could nitpick about a few things (line of reflection too close to middle of image, some white between orange and blue background), but they don''t take away from the sexiness of this photo.  Shaggadelic baby, yeah!</td>', 'Georgeous.  I could nitpick about a few things (line of reflection too close to middle of image, some white between orange and blue background), but they don''t take away from the sexiness of this photo.  Shaggadelic baby, yeah!', '2004-03-26 18:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(640225, 65598, 12573, '<td valign="top">Too harsh post processing.  Also, the lack of resolution in the image is distracting.</td>', 'Too harsh post processing.  Also, the lack of resolution in the image is distracting.', '2004-03-26 18:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(640245, 66193, 18802, '<td valign="top">Photo seems empty.</td>', 'Photo seems empty.', '2004-03-26 19:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(640247, 65558, 18802, '<td valign="top">Very orange. But it''s not very interesting. The fuzzy ball on top is interesting but the rest of the photo makes me want to click next.</td>', 'Very orange. But it''s not very interesting. The fuzzy ball on top is interesting but the rest of the photo makes me want to click next.', '2004-03-26 19:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(640251, 66095, 18802, '<td valign="top">This pair of scrached and dirty orange sun glasses doesn''t draw my intrest into the photo. The rear where the ear peice goes out of picture then back in again is distracting expecially against the sharp white border. But I have to say the shadow/reflection on the surface is nice to look at. Maybe that should have been the subject?</td>', 'This pair of scrached and dirty orange sun glasses doesn''t draw my intrest into the photo. The rear where the ear peice goes out of picture then back in again is distracting expecially against the sharp white border. But I have to say the shadow/reflection on the surface is nice to look at. Maybe that should have been the subject?', '2004-03-26 19:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(640253, 65915, 18802, '<td valign="top">Amazing hair color. Background seems a bit much orange. Maybe a different color wall with that interesting picture on it? Also the lighting on the face is very bright compared to the low contrast background. Lastly the eye expression seems like she is angry. Might have been better to have less intensity in the stare unless you were trying to make a compare with the wall picture. In any case she looks mean and I want to look away or grab a stick!</td>', 'Amazing hair color. Background seems a bit much orange. Maybe a different color wall with that interesting picture on it? Also the lighting on the face is very bright compared to the low contrast background. Lastly the eye expression seems like she is angry. Might have been better to have less intensity in the stare unless you were trying to make a compare with the wall picture. In any case she looks mean and I want to look away or grab a stick!', '2004-03-26 19:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(640257, 65628, 18802, '<td valign="top">The back ground looks like a rug from the 70''s! But that''s just a for fun comment. The little flowers are out of focus but the round thing is very sharp, which makes the flowers look even more out of focus than they actually are. Don''t know what it is but this picture is alittle hard to look at for more than a minute. Must be the flowers.</td>', 'The back ground looks like a rug from the 70''s! But that''s just a for fun comment. The little flowers are out of focus but the round thing is very sharp, which makes the flowers look even more out of focus than they actually are. Don''t know what it is but this picture is alittle hard to look at for more than a minute. Must be the flowers.', '2004-03-26 19:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(640259, 66253, 18802, '<td valign="top">I''m no expert but at first glance this looks like a heavily flashed picture. I like the placement of the flowers but the lighting just doesn''t do them justice. Also at the top right the background shows a fair amount of not so pretty grain. I think the bottom does too but it''s too dark to show up.</td>', 'I''m no expert but at first glance this looks like a heavily flashed picture. I like the placement of the flowers but the lighting just doesn''t do them justice. Also at the top right the background shows a fair amount of not so pretty grain. I think the bottom does too but it''s too dark to show up.', '2004-03-26 19:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(640261, 65125, 18802, '<td valign="top">Too much light? I can sense there is a ton of detail that wants to be shown but just needs the right light. Maybe a bit soft in the focus too? If this was a flash shot then maybe you could experiment with using sheer or very white cloth a foot or so in front of the flash to defuse.</td>', 'Too much light? I can sense there is a ton of detail that wants to be shown but just needs the right light. Maybe a bit soft in the focus too? If this was a flash shot then maybe you could experiment with using sheer or very white cloth a foot or so in front of the flash to defuse.', '2004-03-26 19:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(640262, 65378, 18802, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot. Lots to keep the eye busy. But there are also a ton of flash spots (or is that the sun?) right through the center of the best orange parts. If you could take out the blown highlights this would have been much better.</td>', 'Very interesting shot. Lots to keep the eye busy. But there are also a ton of flash spots (or is that the sun?) right through the center of the best orange parts. If you could take out the blown highlights this would have been much better.', '2004-03-26 19:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(640265, 66076, 18802, '<td valign="top">Too much light. Highlights are blown. Probably a tuff shot since this flower looks kind of waxy and if so would give bright spots. Back ground is nicely done I think. Very sharp focus all around the orange flower. Nice application of thirds as well.</td>', 'Too much light. Highlights are blown. Probably a tuff shot since this flower looks kind of waxy and if so would give bright spots. Back ground is nicely done I think. Very sharp focus all around the orange flower. Nice application of thirds as well.', '2004-03-26 19:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(640268, 66324, 19015, '<td valign="top">This one stood out in the crowd for me - nice photo!</td>', 'This one stood out in the crowd for me - nice photo!', '2004-03-26 19:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(640269, 66363, 18802, '<td valign="top">At first I thought it was an orange severed finger. Creeping me out just a bit. But other than that it''s a nice shot. Shadow on the "stem" and just above the stem is pretty heavy in this other wise very bright shot. That kind of bothers my eye in its wandering over the photo.</td>', 'At first I thought it was an orange severed finger. Creeping me out just a bit. But other than that it''s a nice shot. Shadow on the "stem" and just above the stem is pretty heavy in this other wise very bright shot. That kind of bothers my eye in its wandering over the photo.', '2004-03-26 19:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(640272, 66413, 11181, '<td valign="top">I don''t know, but IMO, the setup of this shot just doesn''t make it dramatic enough. I guess, IMO, this would''ve looked better in a natural setup rather than studio type. Nevertheless, a good concept. Good on the technicals too (ie. focus, choice of light) Good luck :)</td>', 'I don''t know, but IMO, the setup of this shot just doesn''t make it dramatic enough. I guess, IMO, this would''ve looked better in a natural setup rather than studio type. Nevertheless, a good concept. Good on the technicals too (ie. focus, choice of light) Good luck :)', '2004-03-26 19:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(640273, 65394, 18802, '<td valign="top">Interesting fighter wing of crayons effect. Could have cleaned the tips up. The gray apperance is distracting. Also it would have been easier on my eyes if all the tips were in focus. I like the DOF from mid crayon back but the left and right blurry tips are distracting.</td>', 'Interesting fighter wing of crayons effect. Could have cleaned the tips up. The gray apperance is distracting. Also it would have been easier on my eyes if all the tips were in focus. I like the DOF from mid crayon back but the left and right blurry tips are distracting.', '2004-03-26 19:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(640274, 66281, 14043, '<td valign="top">Purple...?  You title really throws me off... Was the G originally written in purple?  It''s also brown, and not orange.  I really can''t tell what those things are on the table and   that bothers me.  I like the shadow and fading effect, but the overexposed left side and the background which doesn''t meet at the back (and the fold in it) are distracting.  Score: 4</td>', 'Purple...?  You title really throws me off... Was the G originally written in purple?  It''s also brown, and not orange.  I really can''t tell what those things are on the table and   that bothers me.  I like the shadow and fading effect, but the overexposed left side and the background which doesn''t meet at the back (and the fold in it) are distracting.  Score: 4', '2004-03-26 19:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(640275, 66152, 18802, '<td valign="top">The left is so much more fun to look at than the right. I see the frozen leaf in the ice but it''s confusing next to the very strong leaf image.</td>', 'The left is so much more fun to look at than the right. I see the frozen leaf in the ice but it''s confusing next to the very strong leaf image.', '2004-03-26 19:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(640278, 65923, 18802, '<td valign="top">The reflection on the table and the shadow of the crackers makes you wonder where to look next. Looks like you used a flashlight or something to make the near crackers bright and interesting.. and it does but it also confuses things with the odd shadows.</td>', 'The reflection on the table and the shadow of the crackers makes you wonder where to look next. Looks like you used a flashlight or something to make the near crackers bright and interesting.. and it does but it also confuses things with the odd shadows.', '2004-03-26 20:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(640279, 66150, 14043, '<td valign="top">It is brown, not orange, which is obvious since it is wood.  I like the idea, but it seems really flat.  Try cropping it to just a section of the photo, maybe 1/4 of this, like the bottom right corner.  There is no place to focus like this, nothing to draw attention.  Score: 4</td>', 'It is brown, not orange, which is obvious since it is wood.  I like the idea, but it seems really flat.  Try cropping it to just a section of the photo, maybe 1/4 of this, like the bottom right corner.  There is no place to focus like this, nothing to draw attention.  Score: 4', '2004-03-26 20:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(640281, 66231, 18802, '<td valign="top">It''s very orange but not very interesting. Not being mean. It''s just that it''s not grabing my attention. Could have been shot from a more interesting angle or maybe found a more interesting subject?</td>', 'It''s very orange but not very interesting. Not being mean. It''s just that it''s not grabing my attention. Could have been shot from a more interesting angle or maybe found a more interesting subject?', '2004-03-26 20:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(640283, 66213, 11181, '<td valign="top">The purple glowing wood just looks unnatural... its just weird on such a shot IMO. i guess this was done with a hue adjustment to get the flame orange. Also, the picture looks too pixelated (jagged) maybe because of digital zoom. But the focus is just right btw. I hope this comment was useful. Good luck! :)</td>', 'The purple glowing wood just looks unnatural... its just weird on such a shot IMO. i guess this was done with a hue adjustment to get the flame orange. Also, the picture looks too pixelated (jagged) maybe because of digital zoom. But the focus is just right btw. I hope this comment was useful. Good luck! :)', '2004-03-26 20:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(640285, 66246, 18802, '<td valign="top">Nice vale and conceptual use of vale. Like the expression as well. Maybe not intentional (also part of the draw) but the left hand suggests a becon. What I don''t like is the background cloth. The hard creases are a real disappointment. The soft waves in the cloth are nice but then you notice the creases.</td>', 'Nice vale and conceptual use of vale. Like the expression as well. Maybe not intentional (also part of the draw) but the left hand suggests a becon. What I don''t like is the background cloth. The hard creases are a real disappointment. The soft waves in the cloth are nice but then you notice the creases.', '2004-03-26 20:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(640286, 65122, 11653, '<td valign="top">Good color. Needs to be more sharp. Subject is a bit too centered.</td>', 'Good color. Needs to be more sharp. Subject is a bit too centered.', '2004-03-26 20:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(640291, 65417, 14043, '<td valign="top">Hm...didn''t I see one like this in the parallel challenge??  Anyway, the vertical orientation of this was a good choice.  However, the incorrect white balance is the only thing which made this photo have anything to do with orange.  The noise is distracting and overall it is uninteresting.  Try rotating to line up the door with the side of the photo.  Score: 4</td>', 'Hm...didn''t I see one like this in the parallel challenge??  Anyway, the vertical orientation of this was a good choice.  However, the incorrect white balance is the only thing which made this photo have anything to do with orange.  The noise is distracting and overall it is uninteresting.  Try rotating to line up the door with the side of the photo.  Score: 4', '2004-03-26 20:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(640293, 66077, 11653, '<td valign="top">Cheese curls need to be more in focus. I can''t decide what it is but needs something. Maybe a different background color.</td>', 'Cheese curls need to be more in focus. I can''t decide what it is but needs something. Maybe a different background color.', '2004-03-26 20:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(640294, 66102, 18802, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot. The abscens of stars helps this photo. You picked up some jaggies on the roof which normally mean not enough resolution but I don''t think that''s the case here. In any case they are a little distracting.</td>', 'Very interesting shot. The abscens of stars helps this photo. You picked up some jaggies on the roof which normally mean not enough resolution but I don''t think that''s the case here. In any case they are a little distracting.', '2004-03-26 20:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(640298, 66323, 19030, '<td valign="top">Was an editing technique used to increase saturation or contrast?</td>', 'Was an editing technique used to increase saturation or contrast?', '2004-03-26 20:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(640299, 66163, 11653, '<td valign="top">Nice detail. I think a tighter crop around the cat''s face would have make photo more dramatic.</td>', 'Nice detail. I think a tighter crop around the cat''s face would have make photo more dramatic.', '2004-03-26 20:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(640300, 65762, 18802, '<td valign="top">Definitely has some wow factor going for it. Not much else I can say. It''s a well done photo.</td>', 'Definitely has some wow factor going for it. Not much else I can say. It''s a well done photo.', '2004-03-26 20:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(640301, 66141, 11653, '<td valign="top">Clever shot, good colors.</td>', 'Clever shot, good colors.', '2004-03-26 20:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(640302, 66237, 19030, '<td valign="top">How was this done??</td>', 'How was this done??', '2004-03-26 20:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(640304, 65778, 11653, '<td valign="top">Nice detail. Like the contrast between the still water and the rapids.</td>', 'Nice detail. Like the contrast between the still water and the rapids.', '2004-03-26 20:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
