(640383, 66329, 10818, '<td valign="top">That looks great...wonderful photo...I really dont think you needed the glass though....very nice</td>', 'That looks great...wonderful photo...I really dont think you needed the glass though....very nice', '2004-03-26 21:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(640389, 66035, 10818, '<td valign="top">How pretty !  I think I would have chopped off the two up close flowers on the right though..they pull your eyes there..but for no reason..<br/> <br/>Great shot though.</td>', 'How pretty !  I think I would have chopped off the two up close flowers on the right though..they pull your eyes there..but for no reason.. Great shot though.', '2004-03-26 21:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(640391, 65876, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like what you are trying to do here.  It might work better if all the flowers were in focus.</td>', 'I like what you are trying to do here.  It might work better if all the flowers were in focus.', '2004-03-26 21:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(640392, 65272, 10818, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful shot...fantastic motion, rof3rds, and of coarse orange color !<br/>Fantastic.  10 .</td>', 'What a wonderful shot...fantastic motion, rof3rds, and of coarse orange color !Fantastic.  10 .', '2004-03-26 21:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(640393, 66163, 10818, '<td valign="top">Dont tell anyone....but I am going to give you a high score for this cat pic.  :)</td>', 'Dont tell anyone....but I am going to give you a high score for this cat pic.  :)', '2004-03-26 21:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(640395, 65508, 17890, '<td valign="top">good picture, nice focus, interesting to look at - 10</td>', 'good picture, nice focus, interesting to look at - 10', '2004-03-26 21:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(640397, 66010, 14043, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of negative space.  However, too much compression or too little pixels.  Sharpen it up a bit to bring out the sign.  Try cropping out the light and simplify the whole thing with just the sign and the wall.  Score: 4</td>', 'Very nice use of negative space.  However, too much compression or too little pixels.  Sharpen it up a bit to bring out the sign.  Try cropping out the light and simplify the whole thing with just the sign and the wall.  Score: 4', '2004-03-26 21:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(640399, 66252, 17890, '<td valign="top">beatufil shot, breathtaking scene - 10</td>', 'beatufil shot, breathtaking scene - 10', '2004-03-26 21:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(640400, 65743, 14043, '<td valign="top">Great use of repetitionm however the "orange" purse really does not draw your attention at all.  Perhaps you could try to focus just on her (if your camera can do that) to blur out the busy background.  I say "orange" because the purse looks very red to me.  Too much sharpening also, the jaggies are distracting.  Score: 4</td>', 'Great use of repetitionm however the "orange" purse really does not draw your attention at all.  Perhaps you could try to focus just on her (if your camera can do that) to blur out the busy background.  I say "orange" because the purse looks very red to me.  Too much sharpening also, the jaggies are distracting.  Score: 4', '2004-03-26 21:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(640402, 66245, 14043, '<td valign="top">Nice use of DOF, but the bright gray branch is more distracting than adding to the photo.  Try to find a bunch of berries that aren''t on their way out, half-rotten ones aren''t very appealing.  ^^;;  Also, maybe try to place your subject somewhere else rather than just centered in the picture (rule of thirds).  Score: 4</td>', 'Nice use of DOF, but the bright gray branch is more distracting than adding to the photo.  Try to find a bunch of berries that aren''t on their way out, half-rotten ones aren''t very appealing.  ^^;;  Also, maybe try to place your subject somewhere else rather than just centered in the picture (rule of thirds).  Score: 4', '2004-03-26 21:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(640405, 66173, 14043, '<td valign="top">Cute idea with the hat!  Too pixelated though, try not to crop that close or if that is because of your camera, size it down a bit.  I like angling it, but what about a more extreme one?  The black rail on the top bothers me because it isn''t level with the edge, so either a more extreme angle or cropping it off would suit me more.  ^_^  Score: 4</td>', 'Cute idea with the hat!  Too pixelated though, try not to crop that close or if that is because of your camera, size it down a bit.  I like angling it, but what about a more extreme one?  The black rail on the top bothers me because it isn''t level with the edge, so either a more extreme angle or cropping it off would suit me more.  ^_^  Score: 4', '2004-03-26 21:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(640406, 66378, 10593, '<td valign="top">ouch brain freeze.  great shot :)</td>', 'ouch brain freeze.  great shot :)', '2004-03-26 21:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(640409, 66210, 10593, '<td valign="top">oh this is gorgeous.  did i spell that right?  anyway, its perfect and getting a 10 from me :)</td>', 'oh this is gorgeous.  did i spell that right?  anyway, its perfect and getting a 10 from me :)', '2004-03-26 21:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(640410, 66129, 14043, '<td valign="top">Good plain background, a bit of an offset, and nice colors.  No orange.  The noise realy detracts from this, it would have definately been bumped up at least 1 more without that and then another if there were something orange in it (other than a tiny part where the stem was).  I like the idea of removing the stem to make it a ''tomorange.''  Score: 3</td>', 'Good plain background, a bit of an offset, and nice colors.  No orange.  The noise realy detracts from this, it would have definately been bumped up at least 1 more without that and then another if there were something orange in it (other than a tiny part where the stem was).  I like the idea of removing the stem to make it a ''tomorange.''  Score: 3', '2004-03-26 21:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(640411, 66207, 10818, '<td valign="top">What a great shot.  The flames look great over the blue sky, and the sunset is blended well between the trees.....just perfect.  10</td>', 'What a great shot.  The flames look great over the blue sky, and the sunset is blended well between the trees.....just perfect.  10', '2004-03-26 21:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(640412, 65544, 10818, '<td valign="top">I always hated carrots...now I hate them more..if thats possibe. :)<br/> <br/>Great shot though....perfect clearity dof and color.</td>', 'I always hated carrots...now I hate them more..if thats possibe. :) Great shot though....perfect clearity dof and color.', '2004-03-26 21:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(640413, 65560, 10818, '<td valign="top">I think the food is nastier then the fly.........  :0<br/> <br/>little out of focus and the background is sorta busy...but not bad.</td>', 'I think the food is nastier then the fly.........  :0 little out of focus and the background is sorta busy...but not bad.', '2004-03-26 21:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(640414, 65559, 19030, '<td valign="top">vague</td>', 'vague', '2004-03-26 21:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(640415, 65607, 10593, '<td valign="top">i love the colors and why is this picture making me thirsty.  anyway im giving you a good score.  i took a close up pic of a carnation almost like this.  i love how its almost silky looking :) great job.</td>', 'i love the colors and why is this picture making me thirsty.  anyway im giving you a good score.  i took a close up pic of a carnation almost like this.  i love how its almost silky looking :) great job.', '2004-03-26 21:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(640418, 65443, 10818, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...I think it would be better if the arm was outstretched instead of the wrist at such a strange angle....nice 1 though.</td>', 'Nice shot...I think it would be better if the arm was outstretched instead of the wrist at such a strange angle....nice 1 though.', '2004-03-26 21:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(640419, 65385, 19035, '<td valign="top">I hate orange barrel season - but i love the photo....</td>', 'I hate orange barrel season - but i love the photo....', '2004-03-26 21:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
