(640516, 66141, 19040, '<td valign="top">I can relate!</td>', 'I can relate!', '2004-03-26 22:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(640543, 65400, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very good painting like photograph.  Nice colors and aesthetics.</td>', 'Very good painting like photograph.  Nice colors and aesthetics.', '2004-03-26 23:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(640545, 65876, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nice work; good aesthetics.</td>', 'Very nice work; good aesthetics.', '2004-03-26 23:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(640552, 66375, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nice clarity and color.  I think it would be nice to see a bit more of the flower on the left and bottom.</td>', 'Very nice clarity and color.  I think it would be nice to see a bit more of the flower on the left and bottom.', '2004-03-26 23:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(640553, 65798, 18484, '<td valign="top">nice use of the colour</td>', 'nice use of the colour', '2004-03-26 23:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(640555, 65827, 18484, '<td valign="top">nice shot...I''m having trouble pulling out the orange though...may be my monitor.</td>', 'nice shot...I''m having trouble pulling out the orange though...may be my monitor.', '2004-03-26 23:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(640556, 66045, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nice overall.  Good aesthetics.  II like the way the petals form the background.  I think it would have been a bit stronger without the foreground stamen OOF.</td>', 'Very nice overall.  Good aesthetics.  II like the way the petals form the background.  I think it would have been a bit stronger without the foreground stamen OOF.', '2004-03-26 23:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(640558, 65858, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nice overall.  Good aesthetics.  I think I can see this is very good and as you wanted; but I think it might have been stronger with more DOF.</td>', 'Very nice overall.  Good aesthetics.  I think I can see this is very good and as you wanted; but I think it might have been stronger with more DOF.', '2004-03-26 23:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(640559, 66324, 18484, '<td valign="top">nice shot.</td>', 'nice shot.', '2004-03-26 23:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(640560, 65571, 12253, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract; good texture and color.</td>', 'Interesting abstract; good texture and color.', '2004-03-26 23:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(640561, 66079, 12253, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and good aesthetics.  I think it would have been improved by more DOF.  Very nice overall!</td>', 'Lovely colors and good aesthetics.  I think it would have been improved by more DOF.  Very nice overall!', '2004-03-26 23:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(640563, 65498, 18484, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective.</td>', 'I like the perspective.', '2004-03-26 23:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(640564, 66105, 12253, '<td valign="top">I like what you did here, and moreso, perhaps can see lots of good shots coming from this.  I think with the motion going to the left, it seems I am being forced to move my eyes out of frame, rather than into the frame, which might have been stronger IMHO</td>', 'I like what you did here, and moreso, perhaps can see lots of good shots coming from this.  I think with the motion going to the left, it seems I am being forced to move my eyes out of frame, rather than into the frame, which might have been stronger IMHO', '2004-03-26 23:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(640566, 66435, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset and reflection.  I like the composition with the water and the shore.  If I had to pick out one small suggestion, I would say that it would be nice not to have lost part of the shoreline on the right.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset and reflection.  I like the composition with the water and the shore.  If I had to pick out one small suggestion, I would say that it would be nice not to have lost part of the shoreline on the right.', '2004-03-26 23:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(640568, 65457, 18484, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.....very well done. the simplicity is soothing.</td>', 'I like this shot.....very well done. the simplicity is soothing.', '2004-03-27 00:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(640569, 66252, 18552, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! What a lovely picture.</td>', 'Fantastic! What a lovely picture.', '2004-03-27 00:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(640577, 66010, 14805, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity here. you might try running neat image on it to clean it up a bit, especially with the high contrast lines.</td>', 'I really like the simplicity here. you might try running neat image on it to clean it up a bit, especially with the high contrast lines.', '2004-03-27 00:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(640579, 66407, 14805, '<td valign="top">very nice.  I''ll bet it was difficult to get that shot. well composed, and I love the DOF.</td>', 'very nice.  I''ll bet it was difficult to get that shot. well composed, and I love the DOF.', '2004-03-27 00:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(640580, 66422, 14805, '<td valign="top">I am a sucker for a pretty sky.  very nice compostion</td>', 'I am a sucker for a pretty sky.  very nice compostion', '2004-03-27 00:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(640583, 65164, 14805, '<td valign="top">I love the color and contrast, but it doesn''t speak to me.</td>', 'I love the color and contrast, but it doesn''t speak to me.', '2004-03-27 00:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(640584, 65394, 14805, '<td valign="top">nice dop</td>', 'nice dop', '2004-03-27 00:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(640585, 65406, 14805, '<td valign="top">this looks a dirty to me</td>', 'this looks a dirty to me', '2004-03-27 00:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(640586, 66363, 14805, '<td valign="top">i like this.  way to think outside the box</td>', 'i like this.  way to think outside the box', '2004-03-27 00:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(640589, 66260, 17787, '<td valign="top">too much little and blurred.</td>', 'too much little and blurred.', '2004-03-27 00:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(640590, 65343, 17787, '<td valign="top">interesting...</td>', 'interesting...', '2004-03-27 00:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(640598, 66435, 18802, '<td valign="top">Great shot. The detail of the sky and the warmth of the colors in the water work well in this photo. Either you waited days for these conditions or you got so lucky! Nice work.</td>', 'Great shot. The detail of the sky and the warmth of the colors in the water work well in this photo. Either you waited days for these conditions or you got so lucky! Nice work.', '2004-03-27 01:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(640602, 65298, 18802, '<td valign="top">Classic equipment and translucent Gold Colored Vinyl (well orange / gold). Fantastic lighting. A little something going on in the background with the faint white shapes. Maybe could have thrown a dark sheet over that or other wise muted it more? I really enjoy the detail of the arm. Have to say it again how I like the lighting. Makes the forground visiable without looking light blasted. This should do well. Something to be proud of. Also nice use of thirds.</td>', 'Classic equipment and translucent Gold Colored Vinyl (well orange / gold). Fantastic lighting. A little something going on in the background with the faint white shapes. Maybe could have thrown a dark sheet over that or other wise muted it more? I really enjoy the detail of the arm. Have to say it again how I like the lighting. Makes the forground visiable without looking light blasted. This should do well. Something to be proud of. Also nice use of thirds.', '2004-03-27 01:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(640603, 66012, 14043, '<td valign="top">Really cool  idea.  Unfortunately I don''t really care for the look.  Everything is blurred, except for the metal spoon, but I''d like to see more of the liquid than just the bottom of the spoon.  I do like the action.  Could you have gotten the background to be a more even white and perhaps brighter?  Score: 4</td>', 'Really cool  idea.  Unfortunately I don''t really care for the look.  Everything is blurred, except for the metal spoon, but I''d like to see more of the liquid than just the bottom of the spoon.  I do like the action.  Could you have gotten the background to be a more even white and perhaps brighter?  Score: 4', '2004-03-27 01:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(640604, 65778, 18802, '<td valign="top">Great action shot. Meets the challenge well without being obvious about it. So many photo''s (mine included) sacrifice good photography just to satisfy the theme. Not so here.  You did remember to get a model concent form right? ;-)</td>', 'Great action shot. Meets the challenge well without being obvious about it. So many photo''s (mine included) sacrifice good photography just to satisfy the theme. Not so here.  You did remember to get a model concent form right? ;-)', '2004-03-27 01:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(640605, 66213, 14043, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an awesome bonfire!  The purple is really cool, but the blown out white sections all over are WOAH, really bright!  The solid black bacground and lack of noise are great, but the whole thing looks pixelated.  I like you cropping, but perhaps less black on the bottom?  Score: 4</td>', 'Wow, what an awesome bonfire!  The purple is really cool, but the blown out white sections all over are WOAH, really bright!  The solid black bacground and lack of noise are great, but the whole thing looks pixelated.  I like you cropping, but perhaps less black on the bottom?  Score: 4', '2004-03-27 01:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(640606, 66429, 18802, '<td valign="top">Very calming and warm feel. I don''t mind the contrast between the lower and upper sections but some might not like it. This photo is so easy to look at. Well done.</td>', 'Very calming and warm feel. I don''t mind the contrast between the lower and upper sections but some might not like it. This photo is so easy to look at. Well done.', '2004-03-27 01:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(640607, 66375, 18802, '<td valign="top">Choice of black background was excellent. Makes the pettles really pop. Well lit. Great focus. If there is a negative I''m not seeing it.</td>', 'Choice of black background was excellent. Makes the pettles really pop. Well lit. Great focus. If there is a negative I''m not seeing it.', '2004-03-27 01:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(640609, 65970, 14043, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, it would have been great for the Portrait challenge.  I really don''t like the orange light though, you did a wonderful job of lighting your subject, but it doesn''t complement her at all.  The wall pattern is too busy, or is that noise?<br/>Either way, it is distracting.  Score: 4</td>', 'Cute shot, it would have been great for the Portrait challenge.  I really don''t like the orange light though, you did a wonderful job of lighting your subject, but it doesn''t complement her at all.  The wall pattern is too busy, or is that noise?Either way, it is distracting.  Score: 4', '2004-03-27 01:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(640611, 65985, 18802, '<td valign="top">I have no idea how you achieved this. The orange and blue are great complementors. And the transition of the reflection from gray to orange is entertaining. Even the sun behind the clouds is not badly overexposed like one would expect. Good work and it shows.</td>', 'I have no idea how you achieved this. The orange and blue are great complementors. And the transition of the reflection from gray to orange is entertaining. Even the sun behind the clouds is not badly overexposed like one would expect. Good work and it shows.', '2004-03-27 01:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(640614, 65199, 14043, '<td valign="top">An interesting take and I find it to be a neat try.  However, if you are going to place your subject in the middle, crop the surrounding area evenly (take some more off the top or leave more on the bottom).  All the black spots and stripes are really distracting.  Score: 3</td>', 'An interesting take and I find it to be a neat try.  However, if you are going to place your subject in the middle, crop the surrounding area evenly (take some more off the top or leave more on the bottom).  All the black spots and stripes are really distracting.  Score: 3', '2004-03-27 01:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(640615, 66355, 18802, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what that is.. and that''s part of the attraction. Nice composition. This feels like a sunset with no sun. Great use of thirds. The simple border helps too.</td>', 'I have no idea what that is.. and that''s part of the attraction. Nice composition. This feels like a sunset with no sun. Great use of thirds. The simple border helps too.', '2004-03-27 01:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(640617, 65991, 14043, '<td valign="top">Cool!  Nice action shot.  I would have prefered a tighter crop on the top to remove the ceiling of the station to focus the viewer on the train and the man.   Is that jacket really orange though?  It looks read to me with a yellow hat.  ^_^  Score: 5</td>', 'Cool!  Nice action shot.  I would have prefered a tighter crop on the top to remove the ceiling of the station to focus the viewer on the train and the man.   Is that jacket really orange though?  It looks read to me with a yellow hat.  ^_^  Score: 5', '2004-03-27 01:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(640618, 66331, 14043, '<td valign="top">I really would have prefered a tighter horizontal crop, maybe just "The Internet" through "Office 200_" to remove the two signs on top.  The color seems off though, since I own some dummies books, I can vouch for their being yellow and not orange, so that doesn''t sell me on this picture at all.  Score: 4</td>', 'I really would have prefered a tighter horizontal crop, maybe just "The Internet" through "Office 200_" to remove the two signs on top.  The color seems off though, since I own some dummies books, I can vouch for their being yellow and not orange, so that doesn''t sell me on this picture at all.  Score: 4', '2004-03-27 01:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(640623, 66282, 18484, '<td valign="top">Intriguing piece</td>', 'Intriguing piece', '2004-03-27 01:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(640624, 65435, 14043, '<td valign="top">Wow, I love pansies.  Unfortunately I see very little orange, so I had to mark it down, even though this is wonderful.  The DOF seems off because of the huge black patch, it makes it feel like on ly the back leaf is in focus (which it may very well be).  It is really annoying to look at a picture and have the majority of it blurry.  Score: 4</td>', 'Wow, I love pansies.  Unfortunately I see very little orange, so I had to mark it down, even though this is wonderful.  The DOF seems off because of the huge black patch, it makes it feel like on ly the back leaf is in focus (which it may very well be).  It is really annoying to look at a picture and have the majority of it blurry.  Score: 4', '2004-03-27 01:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(640625, 66232, 18484, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and a very neat shot</td>', 'Very interesting and a very neat shot', '2004-03-27 01:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
