(640795, 66230, 10402, '<td valign="top">The starlite effect works well here, and is aligned just right. The key light is too harsh, washing out the body of the device and diluting the effect of the orange lights.</td>', 'The starlite effect works well here, and is aligned just right. The key light is too harsh, washing out the body of the device and diluting the effect of the orange lights.', '2004-03-27 10:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
