(640798, 66310, 10402, '<td valign="top">This sunrise certainly has beautiful colors. But the most interesting parts of the photo are on the right side, going off the edge. It makes me wish the camera was pointed about 45 degrees further right.</td>', 'This sunrise certainly has beautiful colors. But the most interesting parts of the photo are on the right side, going off the edge. It makes me wish the camera was pointed about 45 degrees further right.', '2004-03-27 10:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(640799, 65468, 14608, '<td valign="top">Wary nice, great composition .<br/>Good light and details<br/>Is that basic editing..?<br/>If yes 10<br/></td>', 'Wary nice, great composition .Good light and detailsIs that basic editing..?If yes 10', '2004-03-27 10:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(640802, 65644, 10402, '<td valign="top">It''s the negative space, and the interesting shadows it contains, that makes this photo work well. I also like the gradient of the texture from rough to smooth.</td>', 'It''s the negative space, and the interesting shadows it contains, that makes this photo work well. I also like the gradient of the texture from rough to smooth.', '2004-03-27 10:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(640806, 66079, 10402, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. The stamens have a wonderful form and texture that is captured well in this image. The contrasting color of the petals make a great background. The chunks of pollen on the lip add that extra something to make this an outstanding photo.</td>', 'This is beautiful. The stamens have a wonderful form and texture that is captured well in this image. The contrasting color of the petals make a great background. The chunks of pollen on the lip add that extra something to make this an outstanding photo.', '2004-03-27 10:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
