(641065, 66344, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the composition.  The lighting is a little off though.  A refelector  may have helped on the right to bring out the detail in the shadows and balance the lighting.</td>', 'I like the composition.  The lighting is a little off though.  A refelector  may have helped on the right to bring out the detail in the shadows and balance the lighting.', '2004-03-27 17:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(641087, 66035, 7743, '<td valign="top">The colours of the poppies are great.  The bald hill in the background doesn''t seem to add anything to the image, nor does the blank white sky.  A higher vantage point could allow you to capture more detail in the poppies and less of the hill and sky.</td>', 'The colours of the poppies are great.  The bald hill in the background doesn''t seem to add anything to the image, nor does the blank white sky.  A higher vantage point could allow you to capture more detail in the poppies and less of the hill and sky.', '2004-03-27 18:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(641093, 66152, 7743, '<td valign="top">This seems to be a bit under exposed.  When light colours dominate the composition, the camera''s meter is fooled into trying to make the light areas medium grey.  Once one area is exposed the way you want it then the rest of the exposure just falls into place.</td>', 'This seems to be a bit under exposed.  When light colours dominate the composition, the camera''s meter is fooled into trying to make the light areas medium grey.  Once one area is exposed the way you want it then the rest of the exposure just falls into place.', '2004-03-27 18:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(641102, 66314, 7743, '<td valign="top">The DOF here is almost perfect.  (not all the blossoms are in focus).  The background is awesome.  I love it when it''s totally unrecognizable and better yet just a wash of colour like this. 9</td>', 'The DOF here is almost perfect.  (not all the blossoms are in focus).  The background is awesome.  I love it when it''s totally unrecognizable and better yet just a wash of colour like this. 9', '2004-03-27 18:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
