(641410, 65876, 14603, '<td valign="top">A perfect image for this challenge in my view.<br/>Well captured.</td>', 'A perfect image for this challenge in my view.Well captured.', '2004-03-28 11:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(641411, 65272, 14603, '<td valign="top">Well thought out image..I think the slow shutter speed has added to the overall effect perfectly.<br/>Good work</td>', 'Well thought out image..I think the slow shutter speed has added to the overall effect perfectly.Good work', '2004-03-28 11:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(641413, 66069, 14603, '<td valign="top">Orange and blue..one of the most eye catching combinations, added to the clarity of this image.. make for a very effective abstract.<br/>Well done</td>', 'Orange and blue..one of the most eye catching combinations, added to the clarity of this image.. make for a very effective abstract.Well done', '2004-03-28 11:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(641419, 66105, 18194, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.  I think what I like about it the most is that it is unique in the challenge.  The orange is not overpowering, it is not a carrot, and it is not the first orange item you came to.  The photo stands on its own as being a good photo.   Very well done I think.</td>', 'I like this photo.  I think what I like about it the most is that it is unique in the challenge.  The orange is not overpowering, it is not a carrot, and it is not the first orange item you came to.  The photo stands on its own as being a good photo.   Very well done I think.', '2004-03-28 12:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(641421, 65280, 18194, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a bit odd to me, drawing your attention to brown end of the banana rather then the orange in the photo.  I like the contrast with the white and the black.</td>', 'The focus seems a bit odd to me, drawing your attention to brown end of the banana rather then the orange in the photo.  I like the contrast with the white and the black.', '2004-03-28 12:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(641423, 65122, 18194, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  The focus is just a bit soft for my taste.</td>', 'Nice photo.  The focus is just a bit soft for my taste.', '2004-03-28 12:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(641424, 66369, 18194, '<td valign="top">The depth of field was perfect, in my opinion.  The lighting was very well done as well, nice photo.</td>', 'The depth of field was perfect, in my opinion.  The lighting was very well done as well, nice photo.', '2004-03-28 12:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(641425, 65980, 1570, '<td valign="top">i like this - nice catch of the subject, and things are going on in the background, sweet! 8.</td>', 'i like this - nice catch of the subject, and things are going on in the background, sweet! 8.', '2004-03-28 12:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(641427, 66369, 1570, '<td valign="top">cute! like the dof, very nice, 8.</td>', 'cute! like the dof, very nice, 8.', '2004-03-28 12:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(641429, 66326, 18194, '<td valign="top">I think the idea here is very good, and the lighting is very well done.  However I found that there was too much going on.  I see water drops on what I assume is a piece of glass between the camera and the glass. This makes it very hard to make out what is happening at the surface of the liquid.  This also looks like it was shot in bottom of a sink, perhaps using dark towel as a background would have removed some of the background clutter.</td>', 'I think the idea here is very good, and the lighting is very well done.  However I found that there was too much going on.  I see water drops on what I assume is a piece of glass between the camera and the glass. This makes it very hard to make out what is happening at the surface of the liquid.  This also looks like it was shot in bottom of a sink, perhaps using dark towel as a background would have removed some of the background clutter.', '2004-03-28 12:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(641435, 66069, 8891, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your POTD at SHutterbugs today! I really is quite good.</td>', 'Congrats on your POTD at SHutterbugs today! I really is quite good.', '2004-03-28 12:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
