(642701, 65599, 12573, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I particularly like how the dual light source provides a symmetry to the shot.  The bracelet, thong, and the fact that the shirt exposes the waist tell us about the woman in this shot and who she might be.  The black background helps to keep the focus in the middle of the shot, but it might have been interesting to lighten it up a bit so we could make out her curves.  Still, I really like this shot, technically.  It''s a 10 in my book.</td>', 'Great shot!  I particularly like how the dual light source provides a symmetry to the shot.  The bracelet, thong, and the fact that the shirt exposes the waist tell us about the woman in this shot and who she might be.  The black background helps to keep the focus in the middle of the shot, but it might have been interesting to lighten it up a bit so we could make out her curves.  Still, I really like this shot, technically.  It''s a 10 in my book.', '2004-03-29 15:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(642702, 65394, 18903, '<td valign="top">its a nice picture, the angle is nice, and the focus is done well, but IMO doesn''t really capture the "orange" theme very well.</td>', 'its a nice picture, the angle is nice, and the focus is done well, but IMO doesn''t really capture the "orange" theme very well.', '2004-03-29 15:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(642704, 65443, 12573, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, this is kinda nice!  If only the driver bit tip was in focus.  Still, I guess that makes me focus more on the drill instead, which is ultimately the subject.  I think a white background would''ve been more flattering to this subject. Also, the arm appears to be in an awkward position, as if the photographer himself was holding the drill.  Is that a flashlight on the bottom, might have been neat to have it lit for this shot.  Overall, it is a 7.</td>', 'Hmmm, this is kinda nice!  If only the driver bit tip was in focus.  Still, I guess that makes me focus more on the drill instead, which is ultimately the subject.  I think a white background would''ve been more flattering to this subject. Also, the arm appears to be in an awkward position, as if the photographer himself was holding the drill.  Is that a flashlight on the bottom, might have been neat to have it lit for this shot.  Overall, it is a 7.', '2004-03-29 15:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(642706, 66111, 18903, '<td valign="top">the pic is well taken, good focus, nicely placed subject matter, but its just.... not that interesting i guess  :)</td>', 'the pic is well taken, good focus, nicely placed subject matter, but its just.... not that interesting i guess  :)', '2004-03-29 15:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(642709, 66335, 18073, '<td valign="top">Love the close framing in this image, and that is what I call ORANGE!</td>', 'Love the close framing in this image, and that is what I call ORANGE!', '2004-03-29 15:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(642710, 65528, 12573, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  I wish it was lit a little more, um, clinically I guess (?).  Something about it just seems off.  I think I like the DOF, so that''s not it.  I definitely like the placement of your subject and how the tube in the background is out of focus, but still can be identified.  Maybe I''m looking for more contrast in the toothbrush, something to make it pop a little bit.  I give it a 7.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  I wish it was lit a little more, um, clinically I guess (?).  Something about it just seems off.  I think I like the DOF, so that''s not it.  I definitely like the placement of your subject and how the tube in the background is out of focus, but still can be identified.  Maybe I''m looking for more contrast in the toothbrush, something to make it pop a little bit.  I give it a 7.', '2004-03-29 15:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(642714, 65344, 5364, '<td valign="top">I think I would have prefered it with some of the bubbles in focus, but it''s a nice effect.</td>', 'I think I would have prefered it with some of the bubbles in focus, but it''s a nice effect.', '2004-03-29 15:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(642716, 65131, 9089, '<td valign="top">I give you an extra point because I just got my Optio S4 and it is in an Altoids Tin :-)</td>', 'I give you an extra point because I just got my Optio S4 and it is in an Altoids Tin :-)', '2004-03-29 15:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(642718, 66310, 12573, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  Excellent composition considering how cliche this can sometimes be.  The sky has an almost watercolor look to it...almost surreal.  I would have liked to see less of the ocean in the frame and have the horizon a little lower.  The sand is so dark, it doesn''t help the image much.  Perhaps with a lower "snails eye view", with some of the orange reflection in the sand would''ve been better.  Still, it''s an 8.  Very nice.</td>', 'Gorgeous.  Excellent composition considering how cliche this can sometimes be.  The sky has an almost watercolor look to it...almost surreal.  I would have liked to see less of the ocean in the frame and have the horizon a little lower.  The sand is so dark, it doesn''t help the image much.  Perhaps with a lower "snails eye view", with some of the orange reflection in the sand would''ve been better.  Still, it''s an 8.  Very nice.', '2004-03-29 15:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(642727, 65557, 5364, '<td valign="top">I think your white background has slightly overwhelmed the flowers.</td>', 'I think your white background has slightly overwhelmed the flowers.', '2004-03-29 15:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
