(642851, 66410, 8860, '<td valign="top">I wonder if an overhead angle would have been more effective, producing a more dazzling array of objects. This appears to be too softly focused and the DOF does not bring any particular relevance to the concept.</td>', 'I wonder if an overhead angle would have been more effective, producing a more dazzling array of objects. This appears to be too softly focused and the DOF does not bring any particular relevance to the concept.', '2004-03-29 17:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
