(642891, 66419, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is quite ruddy, but there''s still plenty of orange - and it''s lovely stuff too. Great focus and a very nice looking ball. Crop and border is a bit odd but it''s very nice.</td>', 'This is quite ruddy, but there''s still plenty of orange - and it''s lovely stuff too. Great focus and a very nice looking ball. Crop and border is a bit odd but it''s very nice.', '2004-03-29 17:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(642892, 65598, 8860, '<td valign="top">Bit too washed out and insipid for me and focus has let you down. Good composition though.</td>', 'Bit too washed out and insipid for me and focus has let you down. Good composition though.', '2004-03-29 17:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(642893, 66137, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very nice concept and ''orange''. Pic is skewed clockwise a little.</td>', 'Very nice concept and ''orange''. Pic is skewed clockwise a little.', '2004-03-29 17:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(642895, 65952, 8860, '<td valign="top">Should have cropped out the raffia which would create a more dazzling composition. Great colours though.</td>', 'Should have cropped out the raffia which would create a more dazzling composition. Great colours though.', '2004-03-29 17:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(642898, 66389, 15803, '<td valign="top">One of my top three in the challenge</td>', 'One of my top three in the challenge', '2004-03-29 17:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(642899, 65437, 8860, '<td valign="top">Cute typo in your title! Not sure why you took this though - what did you want to achieve?</td>', 'Cute typo in your title! Not sure why you took this though - what did you want to achieve?', '2004-03-29 17:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(642900, 66389, 12573, '<td valign="top">Brilliant.  Sometimes the subject just presents itself and sometimes, as in this photo, the photographer seeks it out with the deference and fortitude of a master.  You have managed to combine two fantastically composed photographs into one without any great feat of technical ability, just a well-trained eye.  10, 10, 10, 10...plus one.</td>', 'Brilliant.  Sometimes the subject just presents itself and sometimes, as in this photo, the photographer seeks it out with the deference and fortitude of a master.  You have managed to combine two fantastically composed photographs into one without any great feat of technical ability, just a well-trained eye.  10, 10, 10, 10...plus one.', '2004-03-29 17:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(642901, 66323, 15803, '<td valign="top">Great lighting</td>', 'Great lighting', '2004-03-29 17:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(642902, 65378, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice design and spread of colour.</td>', 'Nice design and spread of colour.', '2004-03-29 17:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(642903, 66207, 2158, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but if you''d got slightly further to the right, the torch and the tree wouldn''t have overlapped.</td>', 'Great shot, but if you''d got slightly further to the right, the torch and the tree wouldn''t have overlapped.', '2004-03-29 17:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(642904, 65359, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice indeed. Debris in water is a little distracting - but that''s picking nits! [9]</td>', 'Very, very nice indeed. Debris in water is a little distracting - but that''s picking nits! [9]', '2004-03-29 17:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(642906, 66436, 15803, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the best soda ever made</td>', 'Great shot of the best soda ever made', '2004-03-29 17:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(642907, 66375, 12573, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.  I''ve always wanted to do this shot, but I have neither the talent for setting up such perfect lighting, nor the eye to know how close is too close.  You''ve managed to capture an orange flower in this open challenge and do it without being cliche, do it creatively, and do it without resorting to unoriginal sponaneity.  I only wish the center of the flower had a little more punch...more color.  9.</td>', 'Fantastic.  I''ve always wanted to do this shot, but I have neither the talent for setting up such perfect lighting, nor the eye to know how close is too close.  You''ve managed to capture an orange flower in this open challenge and do it without being cliche, do it creatively, and do it without resorting to unoriginal sponaneity.  I only wish the center of the flower had a little more punch...more color.  9.', '2004-03-29 17:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(642917, 65343, 12573, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.  I''d love to see an explanation of how this was done.  The orange on white is such an eye-pleasing combination of color.  This could be in a print ad for oakley sunglasses and I wouldn''t think twice as to whether a professional had their had in it''s creation.  Top notch.</td>', 'Fantastic.  I''d love to see an explanation of how this was done.  The orange on white is such an eye-pleasing combination of color.  This could be in a print ad for oakley sunglasses and I wouldn''t think twice as to whether a professional had their had in it''s creation.  Top notch.', '2004-03-29 18:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(642921, 66061, 8860, '<td valign="top">Tea hee!</td>', 'Tea hee!', '2004-03-29 18:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(642924, 65650, 12573, '<td valign="top">As I''m sure you are aware, the noise in this image is a deal killer.  If it were shot with a lower ISO (or with less post processing), I''d have to give this a 9.  As it is, its a 7.  The composition and lighting of the subjects is really good.  Now just get the technical parts right and you have a potential ribbon winner.</td>', 'As I''m sure you are aware, the noise in this image is a deal killer.  If it were shot with a lower ISO (or with less post processing), I''d have to give this a 9.  As it is, its a 7.  The composition and lighting of the subjects is really good.  Now just get the technical parts right and you have a potential ribbon winner.', '2004-03-29 18:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(642925, 65983, 8860, '<td valign="top">Screensaver? Very nice image and totally satisfying to look at. There''s an odd area bottom right though.</td>', 'Screensaver? Very nice image and totally satisfying to look at. There''s an odd area bottom right though.', '2004-03-29 18:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(642927, 65993, 8860, '<td valign="top">I''m looking forward to being here on April 6th! I''ve heard about the mist - this looks great.</td>', 'I''m looking forward to being here on April 6th! I''ve heard about the mist - this looks great.', '2004-03-29 18:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(642928, 65570, 15242, '<td valign="top">Very orange, not very artistic.</td>', 'Very orange, not very artistic.', '2004-03-29 18:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(642929, 65469, 15242, '<td valign="top">Yes, they are orange, but I''d rather not look at them.</td>', 'Yes, they are orange, but I''d rather not look at them.', '2004-03-29 18:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(642930, 66228, 12573, '<td valign="top">Orange? Not a bad picture, but it simply has not met the requirements of the challenge.  Is the persons shirt orange?  I can''t tell on my monitor.  I''ll give it a 5 because it''s a decent composition with overall good lighting and effect.  If only those stairs were orange instead of blue!</td>', 'Orange? Not a bad picture, but it simply has not met the requirements of the challenge.  Is the persons shirt orange?  I can''t tell on my monitor.  I''ll give it a 5 because it''s a decent composition with overall good lighting and effect.  If only those stairs were orange instead of blue!', '2004-03-29 18:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(642932, 66429, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2004-03-29 18:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(642933, 65649, 15242, '<td valign="top">So when the challenge decription said don''t use an orange, did you really think a blurry orange (or something that looks like an orange when blurry) would be okay?</td>', 'So when the challenge decription said don''t use an orange, did you really think a blurry orange (or something that looks like an orange when blurry) would be okay?', '2004-03-29 18:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(642934, 65493, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is nicely taken.  All the shades of orange there are.</td>', 'This is nicely taken.  All the shades of orange there are.', '2004-03-29 18:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(642936, 65244, 15242, '<td valign="top">Very orange, but not very interesting.</td>', 'Very orange, but not very interesting.', '2004-03-29 18:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(642939, 66006, 12573, '<td valign="top">This is an example of photography 101 ignored.  If you are going to ignore all the rules, you better have a good reason.  First, don''t center the subject in the frame.  Second, light the subject properly to create a mood or to express an emotion.  Third, well, don''t photograph sweaty carrots made of icing and call it art...cuz it ain''t.</td>', 'This is an example of photography 101 ignored.  If you are going to ignore all the rules, you better have a good reason.  First, don''t center the subject in the frame.  Second, light the subject properly to create a mood or to express an emotion.  Third, well, don''t photograph sweaty carrots made of icing and call it art...cuz it ain''t.', '2004-03-29 18:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(642943, 66331, 15242, '<td valign="top">I guess technically it''s not bad, but I don''t think orange when I look at it, I just think dumb.  It''s not at all artistic or creatively composed.</td>', 'I guess technically it''s not bad, but I don''t think orange when I look at it, I just think dumb.  It''s not at all artistic or creatively composed.', '2004-03-29 18:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(642946, 66149, 18709, '<td valign="top">I like this, but i''m not sure why.  Your  positioning of the table mat is  erm.. unconventional shall we say, but oddly ... it works.</td>', 'I like this, but i''m not sure why.  Your  positioning of the table mat is  erm.. unconventional shall we say, but oddly ... it works.', '2004-03-29 18:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(642949, 66327, 15242, '<td valign="top">I think you might be trying too hard to get a fancy composition.  The color of the truck is very striking, some shots of the curves on the fenders, or seams might have been better.</td>', 'I think you might be trying too hard to get a fancy composition.  The color of the truck is very striking, some shots of the curves on the fenders, or seams might have been better.', '2004-03-29 18:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(642952, 65633, 18632, '<td valign="top">nice tones, I like the use of a natural filter. Some more focus, drama, impact would make it even better</td>', 'nice tones, I like the use of a natural filter. Some more focus, drama, impact would make it even better', '2004-03-29 18:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(642953, 66414, 15242, '<td valign="top">Crop off more on top next time.  Nice colors.</td>', 'Crop off more on top next time.  Nice colors.', '2004-03-29 18:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(642956, 65406, 18632, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flower, great tones of orange, but I feel your editing detracts rather than improves the pic</td>', 'Beautiful flower, great tones of orange, but I feel your editing detracts rather than improves the pic', '2004-03-29 18:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(642960, 65951, 15242, '<td valign="top">Is it just me or is there no orange here?</td>', 'Is it just me or is there no orange here?', '2004-03-29 18:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(642961, 66135, 18709, '<td valign="top">This works very well.</td>', 'This works very well.', '2004-03-29 18:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(642962, 66179, 18632, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous scene, perfectly balanced composition. I love it</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous scene, perfectly balanced composition. I love it', '2004-03-29 18:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(642965, 65854, 18709, '<td valign="top">I find this a bit unappetizing.  Who would believe that it tastes so wonderful.</td>', 'I find this a bit unappetizing.  Who would believe that it tastes so wonderful.', '2004-03-29 18:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(642966, 65292, 15242, '<td valign="top">Pulling back a little more so you see the whole van, or just more of it, would help keep eyes from focusing on the tire.  That bright spot an the left side of the windshield kills the shot.</td>', 'Pulling back a little more so you see the whole van, or just more of it, would help keep eyes from focusing on the tire.  That bright spot an the left side of the windshield kills the shot.', '2004-03-29 18:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(642970, 65733, 18632, '<td valign="top">technically a good pic, for my taste lacks drama, feeling...</td>', 'technically a good pic, for my taste lacks drama, feeling...', '2004-03-29 18:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(642972, 66439, 18632, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I had a fish just like it, it got killed by a japanes "fighter" fish. I love the translucent tones, and the clever use of lighting. Pity the tail was cropped, the rest is so nicely framed.</td>', 'Great shot, I had a fish just like it, it got killed by a japanes "fighter" fish. I love the translucent tones, and the clever use of lighting. Pity the tail was cropped, the rest is so nicely framed.', '2004-03-29 18:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(642973, 65468, 15242, '<td valign="top">Well done except done except for a few minor things.  Picture how much better this would be without the logs and that red spot on the right.  Take the picture from a lower angle and that disappears.  You''d also have much more imposing ghosts.</td>', 'Well done except done except for a few minor things.  Picture how much better this would be without the logs and that red spot on the right.  Take the picture from a lower angle and that disappears.  You''d also have much more imposing ghosts.', '2004-03-29 18:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(642977, 65514, 18632, '<td valign="top">Interesting reflections and use of light. Although I feel it lacks focus, it needs something more to catch my eye</td>', 'Interesting reflections and use of light. Although I feel it lacks focus, it needs something more to catch my eye', '2004-03-29 18:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(642980, 65563, 15242, '<td valign="top">Over lit on the top.  Crop out the part above the brim of the hat and that goes away and your left with a pretty nice shot.</td>', 'Over lit on the top.  Crop out the part above the brim of the hat and that goes away and your left with a pretty nice shot.', '2004-03-29 18:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(642986, 66407, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is very good.</td>', 'This is very good.', '2004-03-29 18:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(642987, 66317, 18632, '<td valign="top">Could lighting and comp. I would have liked all the pez in focus</td>', 'Could lighting and comp. I would have liked all the pez in focus', '2004-03-29 18:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(642988, 66323, 15242, '<td valign="top">You have o red spec on the left.  Otherwise nice shot.</td>', 'You have o red spec on the left.  Otherwise nice shot.', '2004-03-29 18:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(642992, 66245, 15242, '<td valign="top">The out of focus branches on the bottom kill this.  Otherwise it''s a very nice shot.</td>', 'The out of focus branches on the bottom kill this.  Otherwise it''s a very nice shot.', '2004-03-29 18:34:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(642994, 66335, 12475, '<td valign="top">probably my favorite representation of orange in the challenge. terrific detail and framing, too.</td>', 'probably my favorite representation of orange in the challenge. terrific detail and framing, too.', '2004-03-29 18:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(642995, 66260, 15242, '<td valign="top">Not interesting or artistic, and it doesn''t appear to be well taken.</td>', 'Not interesting or artistic, and it doesn''t appear to be well taken.', '2004-03-29 18:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(642999, 66180, 12475, '<td valign="top">what a great find; love the rust colors against the blue water. beautiful shot.</td>', 'what a great find; love the rust colors against the blue water. beautiful shot.', '2004-03-29 18:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(643002, 65683, 15242, '<td valign="top">Cool! I like it.  Good job all around.</td>', 'Cool! I like it.  Good job all around.', '2004-03-29 18:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(643003, 66252, 12475, '<td valign="top">this is so dramatic and elegant. i''m not sure it''s the best for this particular challenge, but it''s got such terrific impact that i scored quite high anyway.</td>', 'this is so dramatic and elegant. i''m not sure it''s the best for this particular challenge, but it''s got such terrific impact that i scored quite high anyway.', '2004-03-29 18:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(643005, 66365, 15242, '<td valign="top">Not interesting or artistic.</td>', 'Not interesting or artistic.', '2004-03-29 18:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(643008, 66105, 12475, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, framed so well.</td>', 'Lovely shot, framed so well.', '2004-03-29 18:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(643009, 66039, 15242, '<td valign="top">Horrible still life.   Bad lighting and boring subjects.</td>', 'Horrible still life.   Bad lighting and boring subjects.', '2004-03-29 18:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(643012, 65554, 15242, '<td valign="top">Using a real basketball would have been better.  A different background color would also help.</td>', 'Using a real basketball would have been better.  A different background color would also help.', '2004-03-29 18:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(643013, 65962, 15242, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color but seem to have some focus issues.</td>', 'Nice use of color but seem to have some focus issues.', '2004-03-29 18:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(643016, 66298, 15242, '<td valign="top">Kind of small, but nice shot.  Future note, make your picture as large as allowed.  Otherwise it looks like you''re hiding something.</td>', 'Kind of small, but nice shot.  Future note, make your picture as large as allowed.  Otherwise it looks like you''re hiding something.', '2004-03-29 18:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(643017, 66036, 18632, '<td valign="top">I like the random non composition setup, although it maybe lacks a little focus<br/></td>', 'I like the random non composition setup, although it maybe lacks a little focus', '2004-03-29 18:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(643020, 65644, 15242, '<td valign="top">Either no shadow or a clearly difined shadow would have been better.  The hint of a shadow is distracting.</td>', 'Either no shadow or a clearly difined shadow would have been better.  The hint of a shadow is distracting.', '2004-03-29 18:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(643021, 65951, 18632, '<td valign="top">Interesting shapes, I like the angle, but is that orange?<br/></td>', 'Interesting shapes, I like the angle, but is that orange?', '2004-03-29 18:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(643026, 66232, 4122, '<td valign="top">if this was a crisper photo with more detail it would be one of the best.</td>', 'if this was a crisper photo with more detail it would be one of the best.', '2004-03-29 18:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(643027, 65122, 15242, '<td valign="top">Out of focus or fuzzy (try unsharpen mask) and the glove is a horrible touch.  A crisp clear shot on a branch would have done well.</td>', 'Out of focus or fuzzy (try unsharpen mask) and the glove is a horrible touch.  A crisp clear shot on a branch would have done well.', '2004-03-29 18:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(643029, 65951, 4122, '<td valign="top">is my monitor broke? i must have lost the orange coloring cause i don''t see any here.</td>', 'is my monitor broke? i must have lost the orange coloring cause i don''t see any here.', '2004-03-29 18:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(643030, 65931, 15242, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the DOF</td>', 'I don''t like the DOF', '2004-03-29 18:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(643031, 65257, 18632, '<td valign="top">cool shapes, you''ve got a good eye for composition, well done</td>', 'cool shapes, you''ve got a good eye for composition, well done', '2004-03-29 18:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(643032, 66384, 4122, '<td valign="top">i heard some color blind people see red as orange.  unfortunately i am not color blind and this photo has no orange.</td>', 'i heard some color blind people see red as orange.  unfortunately i am not color blind and this photo has no orange.', '2004-03-29 18:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(643033, 66283, 18632, '<td valign="top">Nice shape, a bit dull though</td>', 'Nice shape, a bit dull though', '2004-03-29 18:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(643035, 66114, 18632, '<td valign="top">cool lines,angles and shadows, good feeling of depth, well done</td>', 'cool lines,angles and shadows, good feeling of depth, well done', '2004-03-29 18:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(643036, 66265, 18632, '<td valign="top">great pic, that atmosphere is so warm, the light perfect, I love the streak the boat leaves behind, truly a beautiful compostion</td>', 'great pic, that atmosphere is so warm, the light perfect, I love the streak the boat leaves behind, truly a beautiful compostion', '2004-03-29 18:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(643037, 66368, 18632, '<td valign="top">Artistic shot, interesting idea, a bit bland for my tast though, needs some more punch</td>', 'Artistic shot, interesting idea, a bit bland for my tast though, needs some more punch', '2004-03-29 18:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(643045, 66260, 18632, '<td valign="top">cool texture, could be a martian landscape! bit bland though</td>', 'cool texture, could be a martian landscape! bit bland though', '2004-03-29 19:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(643047, 66018, 18632, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky, the colours are out of this world. I also love the silouetting of the trees, maybe a little less contrast in the foreground would have improved it though<br/></td>', 'Beautiful sky, the colours are out of this world. I also love the silouetting of the trees, maybe a little less contrast in the foreground would have improved it though', '2004-03-29 19:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(643050, 65876, 18632, '<td valign="top">Great shot, masterpiece, the feeling of depth is great</td>', 'Great shot, masterpiece, the feeling of depth is great', '2004-03-29 19:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(643054, 66429, 8367, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured the detail very well on this beautiful and interesting subject.</td>', 'You''ve captured the detail very well on this beautiful and interesting subject.', '2004-03-29 19:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(643072, 65733, 8367, '<td valign="top">Great color and clarity. I think the compostion could be improved by having more space around it.</td>', 'Great color and clarity. I think the compostion could be improved by having more space around it.', '2004-03-29 19:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(643083, 66278, 11793, '<td valign="top">the glare on the rear glass is kind of weird.<br/>cool though</td>', 'the glare on the rear glass is kind of weird.cool though', '2004-03-29 19:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(643090, 65886, 11793, '<td valign="top">focus looks a bit soft.<br/></td>', 'focus looks a bit soft.', '2004-03-29 19:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(643093, 66069, 11793, '<td valign="top">well done, good luck</td>', 'well done, good luck', '2004-03-29 19:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(643096, 65778, 15919, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the water, both in forground and background.  The main subject could be litle sharper or in better focus but its overal a fine image</td>', 'Good capture of the water, both in forground and background.  The main subject could be litle sharper or in better focus but its overal a fine image', '2004-03-29 19:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(643100, 65628, 15919, '<td valign="top">Its a strange setup but somehow its eyecaching.</td>', 'Its a strange setup but somehow its eyecaching.', '2004-03-29 19:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(643102, 66283, 11793, '<td valign="top">would have left it edge to edge<br/>nice job - good luck</td>', 'would have left it edge to edgenice job - good luck', '2004-03-29 19:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(643106, 65298, 15919, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and well focused.  Good lightning.  Overal pretty fine image.</td>', 'Very sharp and well focused.  Good lightning.  Overal pretty fine image.', '2004-03-29 19:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(643109, 65993, 18080, '<td valign="top">10<br/>that''s all i can say. I love it.</td>', '10that''s all i can say. I love it.', '2004-03-29 19:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(643112, 65970, 18080, '<td valign="top">excelent shot. I love how you have so many colours, and just one...</td>', 'excelent shot. I love how you have so many colours, and just one...', '2004-03-29 19:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(643113, 66407, 16965, '<td valign="top">This has a very strange sense of depth to it.....  is the fly really on the flower?  Amazing shot, though!</td>', 'This has a very strange sense of depth to it.....  is the fly really on the flower?  Amazing shot, though!', '2004-03-29 19:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(643116, 66263, 16965, '<td valign="top">I love the negative subject in the frame, but the halo around the sun is a bit disorenting.</td>', 'I love the negative subject in the frame, but the halo around the sun is a bit disorenting.', '2004-03-29 19:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(643125, 65637, 18080, '<td valign="top">This was my first idea. You have done a good job. Love the DOF.</td>', 'This was my first idea. You have done a good job. Love the DOF.', '2004-03-29 19:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
