(643185, 65950, 12573, '<td valign="top">This would have really been fantastic I think if the large post was cropped out of the picture and the "wings" placed in the lower corner of the frame.  The sky is perfectly complement by the tone of the sculpture.  A little over exposure in the middle of the wing actually makes this more interesting to me.  I give it an 8.  Cheers.</td>', 'This would have really been fantastic I think if the large post was cropped out of the picture and the "wings" placed in the lower corner of the frame.  The sky is perfectly complement by the tone of the sculpture.  A little over exposure in the middle of the wing actually makes this more interesting to me.  I give it an 8.  Cheers.', '2004-03-29 20:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
