(643198, 66310, 15968, '<td valign="top">Autumn... or March dawn?  Nice photograph... lovely orange in left foreground.</td>', 'Autumn... or March dawn?  Nice photograph... lovely orange in left foreground.', '2004-03-29 20:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(643200, 65422, 5792, '<td valign="top">A greater depth of field on this image might be better for it. It meets the challenge well but the yellow to red colors are overwhelming to me and makes it seem artificial outside this challenge.</td>', 'A greater depth of field on this image might be better for it. It meets the challenge well but the yellow to red colors are overwhelming to me and makes it seem artificial outside this challenge.', '2004-03-29 20:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(643202, 65356, 15968, '<td valign="top">Like a Japanese painting!</td>', 'Like a Japanese painting!', '2004-03-29 20:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(643205, 65876, 12573, '<td valign="top">This image will not likely score very highly, which is a shame.  It''s so hard to pull off a good DOF with this kind of shot but you have done it.  Also, the difficulty of getting a proper exposure in the harsh light of midday has been overcome adroitly.  The ever-so-slight slant in the composition adds interest, while the blurry background prevents the abundance of flora from being overwhelming.  Good work.</td>', 'This image will not likely score very highly, which is a shame.  It''s so hard to pull off a good DOF with this kind of shot but you have done it.  Also, the difficulty of getting a proper exposure in the harsh light of midday has been overcome adroitly.  The ever-so-slight slant in the composition adds interest, while the blurry background prevents the abundance of flora from being overwhelming.  Good work.', '2004-03-29 20:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(643207, 65997, 12330, '<td valign="top">either this is an old picture ore this snowboarder needs to get back from the 90´s :)</td>', 'either this is an old picture ore this snowboarder needs to get back from the 90´s :)', '2004-03-29 20:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(643215, 66339, 2158, '<td valign="top">You tried to fit too much into this photo.  One or two items on their own would have produced a much better picture.</td>', 'You tried to fit too much into this photo.  One or two items on their own would have produced a much better picture.', '2004-03-29 20:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(643216, 66246, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice photo of the woman, but next time try for a background that isn''t creased.  Those little details do make a difference.</td>', 'Nice photo of the woman, but next time try for a background that isn''t creased.  Those little details do make a difference.', '2004-03-29 20:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(643217, 66121, 15968, '<td valign="top">Wow what a good shot... there are so many of these orange insects in this contest, and yet this one truly stands out!  The focus is outstanding.  The whole of the butterfly is in the image clearly... the lighting...!!</td>', 'Wow what a good shot... there are so many of these orange insects in this contest, and yet this one truly stands out!  The focus is outstanding.  The whole of the butterfly is in the image clearly... the lighting...!!', '2004-03-29 20:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(643218, 65970, 5792, '<td valign="top">You have a very beautiful young model and you captured a good expression and it has good tonal range. But if I did not know what the challenge is and looked at this image I would ask myself why you made it orange. An image must always stand on its own merit independent of the challenge in which it is entered. For me this would be a lot better if it were not orange. A different or detailess solid colored background (black, white, blue?) would also help it.</td>', 'You have a very beautiful young model and you captured a good expression and it has good tonal range. But if I did not know what the challenge is and looked at this image I would ask myself why you made it orange. An image must always stand on its own merit independent of the challenge in which it is entered. For me this would be a lot better if it were not orange. A different or detailess solid colored background (black, white, blue?) would also help it.', '2004-03-29 20:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
