(643228, 65952, 17505, '<td valign="top">The floor or baske tot he right distracts. I think it would have been a stronger whot without it.</td>', 'The floor or baske tot he right distracts. I think it would have been a stronger whot without it.', '2004-03-29 21:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
