(643461, 66035, 6804, '<td valign="top">I like this. The bright orange and crisp green is a perfect entry for this challenge. The depth of field is soft and pleasent. The flowers are nicely spaced. 9</td>', 'I like this. The bright orange and crisp green is a perfect entry for this challenge. The depth of field is soft and pleasent. The flowers are nicely spaced. 9', '2004-03-30 01:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
