(643464, 66175, 16780, '<td valign="top">The size of this photo is bound to hurt your score.  It looks like a great shot, but too small to realy look at it</td>', 'The size of this photo is bound to hurt your score.  It looks like a great shot, but too small to realy look at it', '2004-03-30 01:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
