(643468, 65277, 16780, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, but the white is a bit flat.  I think itt has the potential to be a "jump out at you" image with a few adjustments. It''s very well taken.</td>', 'Very nice shot, but the white is a bit flat.  I think itt has the potential to be a "jump out at you" image with a few adjustments. It''s very well taken.', '2004-03-30 01:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(643471, 66342, 6804, '<td valign="top">I love this picture, but I hate the title (not docking points for the title) The stem is perfectly placed and the soft natural looking light is excellent. Clarity is awesome, its a great entry for the orange challenge.</td>', 'I love this picture, but I hate the title (not docking points for the title) The stem is perfectly placed and the soft natural looking light is excellent. Clarity is awesome, its a great entry for the orange challenge.', '2004-03-30 01:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(643472, 66383, 10339, '<td valign="top">Nice. One of the better sunsets in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice. One of the better sunsets in this challenge.', '2004-03-30 01:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(643474, 65657, 10339, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. This reminds me of my mom''s sewing table when I was a kid.</td>', 'Very nicely done. This reminds me of my mom''s sewing table when I was a kid.', '2004-03-30 01:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(643476, 66285, 16780, '<td valign="top">I like the concept here.  I would either focus more on the flower or use a greater depth of field to get it all in focus.  Also, some minor adjustements to ither curves, levels or contrast could liven it up.  It seems a bit flat as is.</td>', 'I like the concept here.  I would either focus more on the flower or use a greater depth of field to get it all in focus.  Also, some minor adjustements to ither curves, levels or contrast could liven it up.  It seems a bit flat as is.', '2004-03-30 01:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(643478, 65762, 16780, '<td valign="top">Nice!  The amount of dark silhouette area at the bottom keeps trying to pull my eyes down.  Cropping about 1/3-1/2 of what''s there would improve the composition IMO</td>', 'Nice!  The amount of dark silhouette area at the bottom keeps trying to pull my eyes down.  Cropping about 1/3-1/2 of what''s there would improve the composition IMO', '2004-03-30 01:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
