(644098, 65343, 16106, '<td valign="top">Funniest shot in the competition. I''d love to know how you did this. Good color, great focus and crop. Sweet lighting too, very silk production.</td>', 'Funniest shot in the competition. I''d love to know how you did this. Good color, great focus and crop. Sweet lighting too, very silk production.', '2004-03-30 16:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(644109, 66429, 16106, '<td valign="top">Jaw dropping depth, with great detail and color. The square crop works very well to pull the eye in to the center. The only knock ( and that is very slight ) is that the percentage of area in the shot that is orange is a bit low. Great shot, makes me want to see this building, you make it sing.</td>', 'Jaw dropping depth, with great detail and color. The square crop works very well to pull the eye in to the center. The only knock ( and that is very slight ) is that the percentage of area in the shot that is orange is a bit low. Great shot, makes me want to see this building, you make it sing.', '2004-03-30 16:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(644115, 65417, 16106, '<td valign="top">I find this composition too busy for my taste with little to stop my eye at or near the middle, so I keep tracking up and down, never resting in the frame.</td>', 'I find this composition too busy for my taste with little to stop my eye at or near the middle, so I keep tracking up and down, never resting in the frame.', '2004-03-30 16:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(644126, 65267, 19222, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous...such perfect timing and incredible sense of motion.</td>', 'Gorgeous...such perfect timing and incredible sense of motion.', '2004-03-30 16:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(644127, 65257, 19222, '<td valign="top">The orange really isn''t the center of the photograph...plus I always considered street signs to be yellow...</td>', 'The orange really isn''t the center of the photograph...plus I always considered street signs to be yellow...', '2004-03-30 16:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(644129, 65915, 16106, '<td valign="top">Strong colors, but I wish you hadn''t cut her chin off, doing so makes my eye slide out of the frame. The head down, eyes averted pose makes her look angry and distracted. IMHO had she been looking at the camera with the orange collar of the sweater completing the frame of orange around her face, this would have been a much stronger photograph.</td>', 'Strong colors, but I wish you hadn''t cut her chin off, doing so makes my eye slide out of the frame. The head down, eyes averted pose makes her look angry and distracted. IMHO had she been looking at the camera with the orange collar of the sweater completing the frame of orange around her face, this would have been a much stronger photograph.', '2004-03-30 16:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(644138, 66339, 16106, '<td valign="top">granted that this is a silly shot, it could have been stronger if the orange things filled the frame. A lower, tighter composition leaving out the table and most of the wall could have turned these into a cool abstract. I also find the colors a bit too saturated, so I have trouble reading  the edges of some object or the writting on the cookie box.</td>', 'granted that this is a silly shot, it could have been stronger if the orange things filled the frame. A lower, tighter composition leaving out the table and most of the wall could have turned these into a cool abstract. I also find the colors a bit too saturated, so I have trouble reading  the edges of some object or the writting on the cookie box.', '2004-03-30 16:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(644142, 65261, 16106, '<td valign="top">While you got perfect color on the carrotts, the hand looks like it isn''t getting any blood flow, rather blue and scary looking. A bit of levels work on the blue might have helped.</td>', 'While you got perfect color on the carrotts, the hand looks like it isn''t getting any blood flow, rather blue and scary looking. A bit of levels work on the blue might have helped.', '2004-03-30 16:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(644153, 65560, 16106, '<td valign="top">The central point of the shot that is the fly is out of focus, while the table cloth behind the bowl is sharp so you are a bit back focused. I''m guessing you had both filtered natural light with its blue color and incandessant light with its yellow color because the light seems to be messing with the colors, creating weird reflections that puzzle the eye.</td>', 'The central point of the shot that is the fly is out of focus, while the table cloth behind the bowl is sharp so you are a bit back focused. I''m guessing you had both filtered natural light with its blue color and incandessant light with its yellow color because the light seems to be messing with the colors, creating weird reflections that puzzle the eye.', '2004-03-30 16:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(644156, 65437, 15371, '<td valign="top">ok not the best</td>', 'ok not the best', '2004-03-30 16:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(644157, 66281, 16106, '<td valign="top">This shot puzzles the hell out of me. After a few moments of study I see a sepia toned image of objects I cannot recognise. evocative with nice tones but it leavs so many questions unanswered, such as, where is the orange? What is that drawing of? What are those objects? Interesting but not satisfying.</td>', 'This shot puzzles the hell out of me. After a few moments of study I see a sepia toned image of objects I cannot recognise. evocative with nice tones but it leavs so many questions unanswered, such as, where is the orange? What is that drawing of? What are those objects? Interesting but not satisfying.', '2004-03-30 16:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(644161, 65547, 16106, '<td valign="top">This shot would have worked better with an orange backdrop. As it is the pants are the feature and they are just not that interesting. With an orange backround the belly would have been the focus of attention and that is well lit and pretty to look at.</td>', 'This shot would have worked better with an orange backdrop. As it is the pants are the feature and they are just not that interesting. With an orange backround the belly would have been the focus of attention and that is well lit and pretty to look at.', '2004-03-30 16:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(644166, 66193, 16106, '<td valign="top">I like this idea but the results are not as promising as the idea. the bulb looks slightly fuzzy and for this to work it has to be sharp as glass. While I like leaving all that backround in black,  I wish there was more room at the top, about as much as you left on the sides.</td>', 'I like this idea but the results are not as promising as the idea. the bulb looks slightly fuzzy and for this to work it has to be sharp as glass. While I like leaving all that backround in black,  I wish there was more room at the top, about as much as you left on the sides.', '2004-03-30 16:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(644176, 66373, 10167, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and composition that you have chosen</td>', 'I like the lighting and composition that you have chosen', '2004-03-30 16:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(644188, 65983, 12813, '<td valign="top">I like a lot the bottom of your photo, below the white line, the line itself spoils it.  I would suggest a different crop</td>', 'I like a lot the bottom of your photo, below the white line, the line itself spoils it.  I would suggest a different crop', '2004-03-30 17:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(644201, 66280, 13666, '<td valign="top">I would''ve liked it a little sharper. :)</td>', 'I would''ve liked it a little sharper. :)', '2004-03-30 17:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(644202, 65272, 13666, '<td valign="top">Love how she stands out frm the rest of the dull scenery.</td>', 'Love how she stands out frm the rest of the dull scenery.', '2004-03-30 17:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(644203, 66079, 13666, '<td valign="top">If this were more crisp I think it''d be an awesome macro shot.</td>', 'If this were more crisp I think it''d be an awesome macro shot.', '2004-03-30 17:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(644213, 65617, 15642, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big fan of spot color...but nice composition</td>', 'I''m not a big fan of spot color...but nice composition', '2004-03-30 17:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
