(644326, 66136, 16794, '<td valign="top">Good.  Would be a good kitchen photo.  Probably should have picked out those two bad seeds right in the middle.  A little distracting.  7</td>', 'Good.  Would be a good kitchen photo.  Probably should have picked out those two bad seeds right in the middle.  A little distracting.  7', '2004-03-30 19:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(644328, 65271, 16794, '<td valign="top">I don''t know where you live, but I find it odd that you found an Autum leaf between the photo dates in March.</td>', 'I don''t know where you live, but I find it odd that you found an Autum leaf between the photo dates in March.', '2004-03-30 19:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(644329, 66441, 16794, '<td valign="top">Very creative. 9</td>', 'Very creative. 9', '2004-03-30 19:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(644333, 66066, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very nicely observed - focus will let it down slightly though. Great scene.</td>', 'Very nicely observed - focus will let it down slightly though. Great scene.', '2004-03-30 19:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(644334, 66176, 17505, '<td valign="top">That looks like it breaks several laws, not the least of which are related to photography. I really hope you weren''t driving.</td>', 'That looks like it breaks several laws, not the least of which are related to photography. I really hope you weren''t driving.', '2004-03-30 19:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(644335, 66436, 16794, '<td valign="top">You should send this to Mt. Dew.  Unbelievable focus on all parts of the bottle.  Makes me want a pop right now.   10</td>', 'You should send this to Mt. Dew.  Unbelievable focus on all parts of the bottle.  Makes me want a pop right now.   10', '2004-03-30 19:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(644337, 65514, 16794, '<td valign="top">Nothing is in focus on my computer, except the back support chain.</td>', 'Nothing is in focus on my computer, except the back support chain.', '2004-03-30 19:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(644338, 65559, 17505, '<td valign="top">Too much of the glass was cropped away, That''s the main focus, but it''s hard to understand what I''m looking at because the rim is gone. Also, there were too many filters used in this contest. In my opinion they really don''t stand a chance against the crisp contrast of a smaller amount of orange used as the primary focus.</td>', 'Too much of the glass was cropped away, That''s the main focus, but it''s hard to understand what I''m looking at because the rim is gone. Also, there were too many filters used in this contest. In my opinion they really don''t stand a chance against the crisp contrast of a smaller amount of orange used as the primary focus.', '2004-03-30 19:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(644346, 65399, 326, '<td valign="top">Very nice for the orange challenge! Good job!</td>', 'Very nice for the orange challenge! Good job!', '2004-03-30 19:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
