(644659, 65876, 19251, '<td valign="top">Really nice use of depth of field, wish that the top right didn''t lose the flowers though, nice job otherwise and my favorite for this challenge.  This is obviously a tough concept to capture in an image.</td>', 'Really nice use of depth of field, wish that the top right didn''t lose the flowers though, nice job otherwise and my favorite for this challenge.  This is obviously a tough concept to capture in an image.', '2004-03-31 00:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
