(644783, 65351, 6349, '<td valign="top">4.1?  I really like this a lot.  May be because I''ve been working with fruit flies in Biology class for 2 weeks now so I don''t automatically find them unappealing.  Or maybe it''s that I can find meaning in photos like this.  Check out my entry in the silence challenge.  Funny connection.  This is going in my favorites</td>', '4.1?  I really like this a lot.  May be because I''ve been working with fruit flies in Biology class for 2 weeks now so I don''t automatically find them unappealing.  Or maybe it''s that I can find meaning in photos like this.  Check out my entry in the silence challenge.  Funny connection.  This is going in my favorites', '2004-03-31 01:44:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(644792, 65985, 12962, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your kind comments.  This building is really different and fun and quite orange.  I was going to post a picture of a tomato on an orange plate for this challenge.  The week-end of the end of the challenge, a friend of mine from California was in Chicago and wanted to see post-modern architecture - so we drove around the city and saw this building - the new campus center of the Illinois Institute of Technology at Chicago''s south side.  I of course took a lot of pictures, dropped my nice tomato pictures and submitted this one.  I just wanted to share this with you.  More pictures and coverage at IIT''s official website at <a href="//www.iit.edu/mtcc/news/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.iit.edu/mtcc/news/</a>   and I also posted outtakes in my profile.  Again, thanks and hope you enjoy this building as much as I did.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-03-31 00:48:10.</i></td>', 'Thank you all for your kind comments.  This building is really different and fun and quite orange.  I was going to post a picture of a tomato on an orange plate for this challenge.  The week-end of the end of the challenge, a friend of mine from California was in Chicago and wanted to see post-modern architecture - so we drove around the city and saw this building - the new campus center of the Illinois Institute of Technology at Chicago''s south side.  I of course took a lot of pictures, dropped my nice tomato pictures and submitted this one.  I just wanted to share this with you.  More pictures and coverage at IIT''s official website at //www.iit.edu/mtcc/news/   and I also posted outtakes in my profile.  Again, thanks and hope you enjoy this building as much as I did.', '2004-03-31 01:46:37.000000', '2004-03-31 01:48:10.000000', 0),
(644797, 66363, 6349, '<td valign="top">nice to see your lighter mood.  this had me cracking up.</td>', 'nice to see your lighter mood.  this had me cracking up.', '2004-03-31 01:47:28.000000', NULL, 0),
