(644910, 65458, 11181, '<td valign="top">Hehehe.. i was right about Singapore! LOL... lived there for about 6 months. I''ll post some of my Sing shots on imagestation over the weekend.. :D Its not a big city/country so you''ll get very familiar with the ambience, people, culture etc. in no time! Anyway, better luck on the next challenge! Such a unique shot should''ve done MUCH better!</td>', 'Hehehe.. i was right about Singapore! LOL... lived there for about 6 months. I''ll post some of my Sing shots on imagestation over the weekend.. :D Its not a big city/country so you''ll get very familiar with the ambience, people, culture etc. in no time! Anyway, better luck on the next challenge! Such a unique shot should''ve done MUCH better!', '2004-03-31 02:48:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(644929, 65623, 12151, '<td valign="top">argh! i totally don''t get how this placed this low.  unbelievable.  although appaarently the slightly grainy quality to this photo bothered everybody else. you''ve been gypped regardless.</td>', 'argh! i totally don''t get how this placed this low.  unbelievable.  although appaarently the slightly grainy quality to this photo bothered everybody else. you''ve been gypped regardless.', '2004-03-31 03:09:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(644964, 66245, 14255, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ami Yuy:</b></div><hr/><i> Try to find a bunch of berries that aren''t on their way out, half-rotten ones aren''t very appealing.  ^^;;  </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I specifically chose a bunch of berries that were on their way out as i liked the textures and colour variations. I note your comment that they aren''t very appealing but would say that not everything in life is perfect. <br/>A photograph of a brick wall may be boring but add graffiti to that same wall &amp; a more interesting picture is created (I''m not condoning Graffiti just illustrating that perrfect isn''t always best)<br/>Once again thatnks for your comments<br/>cris</td>', 'Originally posted by Ami Yuy: Try to find a bunch of berries that aren''t on their way out, half-rotten ones aren''t very appealing.  ^^;;    I specifically chose a bunch of berries that were on their way out as i liked the textures and colour variations. I note your comment that they aren''t very appealing but would say that not everything in life is perfect. A photograph of a brick wall may be boring but add graffiti to that same wall & a more interesting picture is created (I''m not condoning Graffiti just illustrating that perrfect isn''t always best)Once again thatnks for your commentscris', '2004-03-31 03:56:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(644972, 66069, 5792, '<td valign="top">Ivica... Congratualations on 1st place and in only your second challenge. I agree with many others, this is an obvious blue ribbon winner. It is rare I give a 10 on an image, but yours was by far the best of this challenge and an easy 1st place pick. I will look forward to many more of your images in the future.</td>', 'Ivica... Congratualations on 1st place and in only your second challenge. I agree with many others, this is an obvious blue ribbon winner. It is rare I give a 10 on an image, but yours was by far the best of this challenge and an easy 1st place pick. I will look forward to many more of your images in the future.', '2004-03-31 04:03:07.000000', NULL, 0);
