(645010, 66228, 3942, '<td valign="top">Oops,<br/> <br/>my lowest ever score. Granted, I was a little surprised on Wednesday morning. "Cool shot ... but not for this challenge"? IMHO there is enough orange for this challenge. The sweater of the main subject ist orange, an I think, that this sweater is the eye-cather in this shot. But O.K., I have to acccept your opinion too ;-). Thanx a lot for your comments, and special thanks to John and Jason for adding this 4.4-shot to your favorites :-)!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-03-31 04:04:23.</i></td>', 'Oops, my lowest ever score. Granted, I was a little surprised on Wednesday morning. "Cool shot ... but not for this challenge"? IMHO there is enough orange for this challenge. The sweater of the main subject ist orange, an I think, that this sweater is the eye-cather in this shot. But O.K., I have to acccept your opinion too ;-). Thanx a lot for your comments, and special thanks to John and Jason for adding this 4.4-shot to your favorites :-)!', '2004-03-31 05:01:46.000000', '2004-03-31 05:04:23.000000', 0),
