(645099, 65962, 7889, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by chinstrap:</b></div><hr/><i> Red and blue - i dont see any orange here. That aside the combination of the colours make for a striking photo </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Patsy - I must apologise because looking at this on my work monitor the orange is more evident.<br/> <br/>Mike<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by chinstrap: Red and blue - i dont see any orange here. That aside the combination of the colours make for a striking photo   Patsy - I must apologise because looking at this on my work monitor the orange is more evident. Mike', '2004-03-31 07:26:18.000000', NULL, 0),
