(645807, 65649, 14476, '<td valign="top">From looking at your entries, you have a lot of potential and a good eye.  Please don''t get discouraged by this score and I for one will look forward to seeing more of your photography soon.</td>', 'From looking at your entries, you have a lot of potential and a good eye.  Please don''t get discouraged by this score and I for one will look forward to seeing more of your photography soon.', '2004-03-31 13:53:28.000000', NULL, 0),
