(646013, 66429, 16106, '<td valign="top">How could anyone give this a score of one? Has anyone left thier keyboards alone during voting with their cat or infant in the room? Surely this couldn''t be a result of someone seeing the work and thinking it warrents the lowest score possible!</td>', 'How could anyone give this a score of one? Has anyone left thier keyboards alone during voting with their cat or infant in the room? Surely this couldn''t be a result of someone seeing the work and thinking it warrents the lowest score possible!', '2004-03-31 15:40:32.000000', NULL, 0),
