(650940, 65267, 7969, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the CC, my first instinct on this shot is that it hurts my eyes to look at, not sure if others felt this way too or if is just me, I think it has to do with the reflection and the tone.  The bubbles are somewhat interesting but I find the shot lacks in a real focal point, the stream coming down may have proven to be one, but because it is out of focus is not IMO.  hope that helps a  little and that its not too hard of a comment.</td>', 'Greetings from the CC, my first instinct on this shot is that it hurts my eyes to look at, not sure if others felt this way too or if is just me, I think it has to do with the reflection and the tone.  The bubbles are somewhat interesting but I find the shot lacks in a real focal point, the stream coming down may have proven to be one, but because it is out of focus is not IMO.  hope that helps a  little and that its not too hard of a comment.', '2004-04-02 19:35:00.000000', NULL, 0),
