(651617, 65996, 10165, '<td valign="top">A lesson learned. <br/>I borrowed a monitor to use for my laptop from a frind of mine. I thought that all the colors were correct in that monitor. This photo is definately orange in that monitor. But when I look at it in other monitors it looks red. So before submitting your photos take a look at them in other monitors or be sure your monitor is good enough.</td>', 'A lesson learned. I borrowed a monitor to use for my laptop from a frind of mine. I thought that all the colors were correct in that monitor. This photo is definately orange in that monitor. But when I look at it in other monitors it looks red. So before submitting your photos take a look at them in other monitors or be sure your monitor is good enough.', '2004-04-03 11:40:34.000000', NULL, 0),
