(676722, 65612, 16269, '<td valign="top">I agree about the poppy on the left. It draws your eye away from the big, open one. I really love the focus and detail of it, though.. and I do like it off centered with the background so scraggly and blurred. I almost bought something like this at the poppy festival (a print somewhat like this!)<br/> <br/>Just looking through some of your work, trying to learn a thing or two!</td>', 'I agree about the poppy on the left. It draws your eye away from the big, open one. I really love the focus and detail of it, though.. and I do like it off centered with the background so scraggly and blurred. I almost bought something like this at the poppy festival (a print somewhat like this!) Just looking through some of your work, trying to learn a thing or two!', '2004-04-20 00:55:33.000000', NULL, 0),
