(778302, 66256, 14401, '<td valign="top">I actually liked this shot - I think you did a superb job of capturing the little guys - they''re nice and sharp.  My opinion?  Those who''re mouthing off need to put up or shut up.  If they''ve never tried taking pix of fish in a tank, I''d challenge ''em to try it and see how long it takes to get one as good!</td>', 'I actually liked this shot - I think you did a superb job of capturing the little guys - they''re nice and sharp.  My opinion?  Those who''re mouthing off need to put up or shut up.  If they''ve never tried taking pix of fish in a tank, I''d challenge ''em to try it and see how long it takes to get one as good!', '2004-06-24 17:52:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(780219, 66256, 10702, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kaycee:</b></div><hr/><i> I actually liked this shot - I think you did a superb job of capturing the little guys - they''re nice and sharp.  My opinion?  Those who''re mouthing off need to put up or shut up.  If they''ve never tried taking pix of fish in a tank, I''d challenge ''em to try it and see how long it takes to get one as good! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I have tried once in my lifetime on my crappy old camera, the background was perfect but I was in need of fishes, but If these two were put together we would be dancing.<br/> <br/>//oskarpall.com/?s=img&amp;iID=16</td>', 'Originally posted by kaycee: I actually liked this shot - I think you did a superb job of capturing the little guys - they''re nice and sharp.  My opinion?  Those who''re mouthing off need to put up or shut up.  If they''ve never tried taking pix of fish in a tank, I''d challenge ''em to try it and see how long it takes to get one as good!   I have tried once in my lifetime on my crappy old camera, the background was perfect but I was in need of fishes, but If these two were put together we would be dancing. //oskarpall.com/?s=img&iID=16', '2004-06-26 01:55:07.000000', NULL, 0),
